(1014707, 122012, 10432, '<td valign="top">It''s very hard to see the details in such a small image.  Sorry!</td>', 'It''s very hard to see the details in such a small image.  Sorry!', '2004-11-17 00:03:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014718, 120601, 25203, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see a longer exposer.</td>', 'I would have liked to see a longer exposer.', '2004-11-17 00:06:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014720, 121676, 772, '<td valign="top">Interesting work.. this has some sort of modern "Man Ray" appeal to it...</td>', 'Interesting work.. this has some sort of modern "Man Ray" appeal to it...', '2004-11-17 00:06:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014730, 122046, 772, '<td valign="top">Cute snapshot... don''t see much merit in it beyond that since I have no personal ties with the subject.  It will make a nice addition to your family album though :)</td>', 'Cute snapshot... don''t see much merit in it beyond that since I have no personal ties with the subject.  It will make a nice addition to your family album though :)', '2004-11-17 00:08:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014740, 122195, 25203, '<td valign="top">I see black, i see white, but what is that brown color in-between.</td>', 'I see black, i see white, but what is that brown color in-between.', '2004-11-17 00:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014745, 120415, 25203, '<td valign="top">I see black, I see white, but what is that brown stuff in the middle?</td>', 'I see black, I see white, but what is that brown stuff in the middle?', '2004-11-17 00:11:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014751, 121812, 772, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and observation of interesting light.  The bit of architecture in the upper left corner is a bit of a distraction in the overall theme of the image.  It may have been worthwhile to crop that bit out...</td>', 'Nice composition and observation of interesting light.  The bit of architecture in the upper left corner is a bit of a distraction in the overall theme of the image.  It may have been worthwhile to crop that bit out...', '2004-11-17 00:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014752, 120539, 20102, '<td valign="top">I bet she has gorgeous color eyes. The collar is over-exposed. But you already knew that.</td>', 'I bet she has gorgeous color eyes. The collar is over-exposed. But you already knew that.', '2004-11-17 00:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014755, 122025, 25203, '<td valign="top">I don''t see black, but there is some white, and what is with all the brown stuff?</td>', 'I don''t see black, but there is some white, and what is with all the brown stuff?', '2004-11-17 00:13:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014757, 121743, 25203, '<td valign="top">I see black,and there is some white, and what is with all the brown stuff?</td>', 'I see black,and there is some white, and what is with all the brown stuff?', '2004-11-17 00:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014762, 120496, 9602, '<td valign="top">Nice effect.</td>', 'Nice effect.', '2004-11-17 00:14:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014763, 121671, 772, '<td valign="top">Excellent subject and composition for black and white.. the lighting is excellent, as is everything else about this photo.  I''m not much of a fan of humorous titles when the image itself has not obvious humor in it though...</td>', 'Excellent subject and composition for black and white.. the lighting is excellent, as is everything else about this photo.  I''m not much of a fan of humorous titles when the image itself has not obvious humor in it though...', '2004-11-17 00:14:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014764, 120887, 20102, '<td valign="top">so much white hurts the eyes. What''s that black strip at the bottom? I like the position of the beak.</td>', 'so much white hurts the eyes. What''s that black strip at the bottom? I like the position of the beak.', '2004-11-17 00:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014765, 120961, 6008, '<td valign="top">It''s a good idea and you have various shapes and textures but there are a few technical issues that let the image down. The highlight on the metal frame is blown, and there are some distracting light reflections on the bottle too. The sheet the items are on is ruffled near the apple and that is a little distracting also. Overall the image is a little static.</td>', 'It''s a good idea and you have various shapes and textures but there are a few technical issues that let the image down. The highlight on the metal frame is blown, and there are some distracting light reflections on the bottle too. The sheet the items are on is ruffled near the apple and that is a little distracting also. Overall the image is a little static.', '2004-11-17 00:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014767, 121467, 772, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject, but the available light on the scene or the exposure/post processing doesn''t provide much contrast and the overall image seems rather flat...</td>', 'Interesting subject, but the available light on the scene or the exposure/post processing doesn''t provide much contrast and the overall image seems rather flat...', '2004-11-17 00:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014769, 120704, 18197, '<td valign="top">Distracting border.</td>', 'Distracting border.', '2004-11-17 00:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014771, 121765, 18197, '<td valign="top">Focus issues and larger would be better.</td>', 'Focus issues and larger would be better.', '2004-11-17 00:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014772, 121626, 20102, '<td valign="top">grr!.. Nice exposure, kudos on not over-exposing the buckle.</td>', 'grr!.. Nice exposure, kudos on not over-exposing the buckle.', '2004-11-17 00:15:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014773, 120444, 25203, '<td valign="top">Nice subtle details makes this a great image.</td>', 'Nice subtle details makes this a great image.', '2004-11-17 00:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014777, 122211, 10432, '<td valign="top">Nice evening scene.  Seems a little under-exposed and the bottom right corner detracts a b it from the shot.</td>', 'Nice evening scene.  Seems a little under-exposed and the bottom right corner detracts a b it from the shot.', '2004-11-17 00:16:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014778, 121453, 772, '<td valign="top">I believe this photo lacks enough contrast to make it particularly appealing...</td>', 'I believe this photo lacks enough contrast to make it particularly appealing...', '2004-11-17 00:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014780, 121313, 20662, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done. The horizon line is in the upper half of the frame, good balance of light and darks and you''ve stopped the action of the boat without any blur. Good Luck! 8</td>', 'Very nicely done. The horizon line is in the upper half of the frame, good balance of light and darks and you''ve stopped the action of the boat without any blur. Good Luck! 8', '2004-11-17 00:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014783, 121885, 27293, '<td valign="top">Awesome. I wish it was in color =) Just kidding.</td>', 'Awesome. I wish it was in color =) Just kidding.', '2004-11-17 00:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014784, 121978, 772, '<td valign="top">Interesting perpsective and good tonality...  I can''t really find much meaning or intrest in the subject choice...</td>', 'Interesting perpsective and good tonality...  I can''t really find much meaning or intrest in the subject choice...', '2004-11-17 00:17:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014785, 121306, 16958, '<td valign="top">Great subject. Really eye-catching.</td>', 'Great subject. Really eye-catching.', '2004-11-17 00:17:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014788, 122116, 20102, '<td valign="top">Bill told me his friend took Mt. Rainier. Quite nice! A bit over-exposed though.</td>', 'Bill told me his friend took Mt. Rainier. Quite nice! A bit over-exposed though.', '2004-11-17 00:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014789, 120711, 28108, '<td valign="top">Nice framing, focus is set on hair insted of the face.  I don''t like the shadow on the forehead.  I do like the fade to black on the right side of the picture.  I think it still deseverves a high note.  Many good elements.</td>', 'Nice framing, focus is set on hair insted of the face.  I don''t like the shadow on the forehead.  I do like the fade to black on the right side of the picture.  I think it still deseverves a high note.  Many good elements.', '2004-11-17 00:17:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014792, 120578, 772, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and composition here... the ligh on the knee feels a little out of place...</td>', 'Nice idea and composition here... the ligh on the knee feels a little out of place...', '2004-11-17 00:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014793, 121134, 25203, '<td valign="top">a little hot.</td>', 'a little hot.', '2004-11-17 00:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014794, 122035, 6008, '<td valign="top">You''ve certainly captured black and white in black and white! The highlights on the pants are a little bright and the shadows make the eyes a little too dark. The fingers could do with a little more space above them also.  It''s an OK shot but doesnt have much impact.</td>', 'You''ve certainly captured black and white in black and white! The highlights on the pants are a little bright and the shadows make the eyes a little too dark. The fingers could do with a little more space above them also.  It''s an OK shot but doesnt have much impact.', '2004-11-17 00:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014795, 121755, 772, '<td valign="top">Cute snapshot.  This will make a nice addidtion to someone''s family album.</td>', 'Cute snapshot.  This will make a nice addidtion to someone''s family album.', '2004-11-17 00:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014796, 120837, 20102, '<td valign="top">I like the graininess. Could be just a tad more in focus.</td>', 'I like the graininess. Could be just a tad more in focus.', '2004-11-17 00:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014798, 121912, 25203, '<td valign="top">I don''t see black, and there is no white, and what is with all the brown stuff?</td>', 'I don''t see black, and there is no white, and what is with all the brown stuff?', '2004-11-17 00:19:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014800, 121250, 22533, '<td valign="top">The spoon would have looked better turned over, but I am sure you did it that for lighting or something. Great idea!</td>', 'The spoon would have looked better turned over, but I am sure you did it that for lighting or something. Great idea!', '2004-11-17 00:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014803, 121747, 25203, '<td valign="top">I don''t see black, and there is no white, and what is with all the brown stuff?</td>', 'I don''t see black, and there is no white, and what is with all the brown stuff?', '2004-11-17 00:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014808, 122064, 6008, '<td valign="top">When I first opened the image I thought there was some nice soft lighting and an interesting pose but after looking for a while I find it a little awkward. Her position on the floor and the sheet over her lower half just doesnt look natural and I dont think it adds anything to the shot. Personally, I would rather see a closer shot with the image cropped to the middle instead of there being a lot of negative space around the focal point - her.</td>', 'When I first opened the image I thought there was some nice soft lighting and an interesting pose but after looking for a while I find it a little awkward. Her position on the floor and the sheet over her lower half just doesnt look natural and I dont think it adds anything to the shot. Personally, I would rather see a closer shot with the image cropped to the middle instead of there being a lot of negative space around the focal point - her.', '2004-11-17 00:21:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014810, 122030, 28764, '<td valign="top">Cute dog</td>', 'Cute dog', '2004-11-17 00:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014813, 121516, 20774, '<td valign="top">In my opinion i think that the mountain distracts a little bit the middle of the tree. but otherwise nice photo.</td>', 'In my opinion i think that the mountain distracts a little bit the middle of the tree. but otherwise nice photo.', '2004-11-17 00:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014814, 121671, 22734, '<td valign="top">Great look in the camera shot, almost. lol Nice b/w 7</td>', 'Great look in the camera shot, almost. lol Nice b/w 7', '2004-11-17 00:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014815, 120488, 16301, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you''ll get some comments on the OOF bass not being a good idea, but I really like it, it adds depth to the image. (8)</td>', 'I''m sure you''ll get some comments on the OOF bass not being a good idea, but I really like it, it adds depth to the image. (8)', '2004-11-17 00:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014816, 121621, 10124, '<td valign="top">The great Roger Williams. Nice.</td>', 'The great Roger Williams. Nice.', '2004-11-17 00:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014817, 121487, 18194, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo.</td>', 'Very nice photo.', '2004-11-17 00:22:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014819, 121771, 20774, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract. i like the composition nice photo.</td>', 'Nice abstract. i like the composition nice photo.', '2004-11-17 00:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014820, 121866, 20774, '<td valign="top">In my opinion the foto is too dark, if it wasn''t for that it would be a great photo.</td>', 'In my opinion the foto is too dark, if it wasn''t for that it would be a great photo.', '2004-11-17 00:24:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014821, 121668, 6008, '<td valign="top">It''s an interesting shot but I find my interest is on his face and so find the vast amount of shirt to be a little excessive. If getting closer or cropping tighter around the face wasnt an option then at least cropping off some of the bottom may have helped.</td>', 'It''s an interesting shot but I find my interest is on his face and so find the vast amount of shirt to be a little excessive. If getting closer or cropping tighter around the face wasnt an option then at least cropping off some of the bottom may have helped.', '2004-11-17 00:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014824, 121060, 22533, '<td valign="top">Her belly looks slightly out of focus. Nice shot though.</td>', 'Her belly looks slightly out of focus. Nice shot though.', '2004-11-17 00:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014826, 121844, 20774, '<td valign="top">Nice photo but part of here face is a little overexposed, if it was less i guess it would fell nicer, but thats just my opinion, otherwise great capture and nice picture.</td>', 'Nice photo but part of here face is a little overexposed, if it was less i guess it would fell nicer, but thats just my opinion, otherwise great capture and nice picture.', '2004-11-17 00:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014828, 120862, 10943, '<td valign="top">Great pic!  Nice shades, contrast and focus.  I hope it does well!</td>', 'Great pic!  Nice shades, contrast and focus.  I hope it does well!', '2004-11-17 00:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014833, 121933, 28108, '<td valign="top">It should have been cropped a little more, trim out the bottom part up to the top tank (wich is the bottom in the reflection).  Fountain water looks good. Should have been shot a differant time of day to avoid the sharp diagonal shadow on the right side of the tank.  Still a really nice picture.</td>', 'It should have been cropped a little more, trim out the bottom part up to the top tank (wich is the bottom in the reflection).  Fountain water looks good. Should have been shot a differant time of day to avoid the sharp diagonal shadow on the right side of the tank.  Still a really nice picture.', '2004-11-17 00:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014834, 121744, 28967, '<td valign="top">Nice ide</td>', 'Nice ide', '2004-11-17 00:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014835, 120564, 15811, '<td valign="top">Good composition, nice and simple.  Great use of blank space -- and I absolutely love the framing (and I usually don''t like borders too much), really good idea...great shot, great presentation!</td>', 'Good composition, nice and simple.  Great use of blank space -- and I absolutely love the framing (and I usually don''t like borders too much), really good idea...great shot, great presentation!', '2004-11-17 00:27:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014836, 121811, 23913, '<td valign="top">this is a intrusting idea and image but the gray scale is lacking.</td>', 'this is a intrusting idea and image but the gray scale is lacking.', '2004-11-17 00:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014837, 120916, 29477, '<td valign="top">I like the balance between the foreground and mountains.  Would like to have seen the sky darkened slightly to have the contrast jump out more</td>', 'I like the balance between the foreground and mountains.  Would like to have seen the sky darkened slightly to have the contrast jump out more', '2004-11-17 00:27:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014838, 120613, 20774, '<td valign="top">I guess the rose could be more in focus, and i can''t find one part that is in focus, thats a shame because this would be a very nice photo.</td>', 'I guess the rose could be more in focus, and i can''t find one part that is in focus, thats a shame because this would be a very nice photo.', '2004-11-17 00:27:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014839, 122064, 20774, '<td valign="top">Just a wonderful picture love the way you played with lights and i like her pose, it gives an oriental feel. Great job.</td>', 'Just a wonderful picture love the way you played with lights and i like her pose, it gives an oriental feel. Great job.', '2004-11-17 00:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014840, 121111, 6008, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you are going to receive a lot of comments concerning the attractiveness of the image. There is certainly a good amount of texture in the image. I find the choice to have a lot of negative black space at the top and the foot to be cropped an interesting one, but it doesnt really do much for me personally. I''m sure it would be considered an artistic shot but it doesnt have much of an impact on me.</td>', 'I''m sure you are going to receive a lot of comments concerning the attractiveness of the image. There is certainly a good amount of texture in the image. I find the choice to have a lot of negative black space at the top and the foot to be cropped an interesting one, but it doesnt really do much for me personally. I''m sure it would be considered an artistic shot but it doesnt have much of an impact on me.', '2004-11-17 00:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014841, 121134, 15811, '<td valign="top">Good composition here.  Good lightness, nothing is blown out, and nothing is too dark.  good work!</td>', 'Good composition here.  Good lightness, nothing is blown out, and nothing is too dark.  good work!', '2004-11-17 00:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014847, 121744, 6008, '<td valign="top">The focus on the glass is a little soft and the white looks quite grey. A levels/curves enhancement or more light in the setup would make a significant improvement.</td>', 'The focus on the glass is a little soft and the white looks quite grey. A levels/curves enhancement or more light in the setup would make a significant improvement.', '2004-11-17 00:30:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014849, 121223, 23913, '<td valign="top">the shadow is distracting-to solve that prob. if u don''t have studio lighting give the subject just a little backlighting.<br/> <br/>also not the gray scale that i desire to see in a B&amp;W image</td>', 'the shadow is distracting-to solve that prob. if u don''t have studio lighting give the subject just a little backlighting. also not the gray scale that i desire to see in a B&W image', '2004-11-17 00:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014852, 120457, 28629, '<td valign="top">nice photo. =)</td>', 'nice photo. =)', '2004-11-17 00:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014854, 121889, 15811, '<td valign="top">Cute kid.  Very good lighting -- leaves the areas on the face nicely exposed and allows the shadows which looks really good and are not too harsh.  good job.</td>', 'Cute kid.  Very good lighting -- leaves the areas on the face nicely exposed and allows the shadows which looks really good and are not too harsh.  good job.', '2004-11-17 00:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014856, 121453, 27375, '<td valign="top">this is a really great image, i think just a little more contrast would have really brought out some more tones</td>', 'this is a really great image, i think just a little more contrast would have really brought out some more tones', '2004-11-17 00:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014857, 121651, 10124, '<td valign="top">Tear it down! Build the tunnel!<br/>also, nice shot.</td>', 'Tear it down! Build the tunnel!also, nice shot.', '2004-11-17 00:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014858, 121584, 18197, '<td valign="top">Better w/o the shadows IMO.</td>', 'Better w/o the shadows IMO.', '2004-11-17 00:32:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014859, 121011, 20210, '<td valign="top">A little too dark, even on my Mac LCD.  I think it''s a great shot, but I''m not sure it has the punch that will help it stand out.  Still, great work.</td>', 'A little too dark, even on my Mac LCD.  I think it''s a great shot, but I''m not sure it has the punch that will help it stand out.  Still, great work.', '2004-11-17 00:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014860, 121593, 29477, '<td valign="top">Great shot...I find the graffitti of the runner tends to grab my focus away from the depth and is distracting.  Great angle and natural light</td>', 'Great shot...I find the graffitti of the runner tends to grab my focus away from the depth and is distracting.  Great angle and natural light', '2004-11-17 00:32:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014862, 121955, 20774, '<td valign="top">I think its too dark. can''t really see the snow. The picture gets a little confusing.</td>', 'I think its too dark. can''t really see the snow. The picture gets a little confusing.', '2004-11-17 00:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014863, 122203, 18194, '<td valign="top">The cropping seems a bit odd, like the bottom is chopped off.</td>', 'The cropping seems a bit odd, like the bottom is chopped off.', '2004-11-17 00:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014865, 121764, 23913, '<td valign="top">IMHO this shot is lacking the grayscale of a truly good b&amp;w image.<br/>nice overall comp. though.</td>', 'IMHO this shot is lacking the grayscale of a truly good b&w image.nice overall comp. though.', '2004-11-17 00:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014867, 120911, 6008, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately the fog in this image just comes across as a very low contrast shot, although there are the foreground leaves to counter that. The image is also fairly soft. The birds are so small compared to the rest of the image that they are not really the focal point that the title suggests.</td>', 'Unfortunately the fog in this image just comes across as a very low contrast shot, although there are the foreground leaves to counter that. The image is also fairly soft. The birds are so small compared to the rest of the image that they are not really the focal point that the title suggests.', '2004-11-17 00:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014869, 122201, 18194, '<td valign="top">great subject and well shot.</td>', 'great subject and well shot.', '2004-11-17 00:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014870, 121586, 20210, '<td valign="top">Cropped a little to tightly on the left for my taste.  But a bold shot with a stunning model. Congrats.</td>', 'Cropped a little to tightly on the left for my taste.  But a bold shot with a stunning model. Congrats.', '2004-11-17 00:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014871, 121881, 10432, '<td valign="top">Sharp and neat perspective.  I like the black background behind the bench.  I''m thinking that it would be improved if it did not have the shadow on &amp; of the bench (easier said than done with the nice lighting).  Well done.</td>', 'Sharp and neat perspective.  I like the black background behind the bench.  I''m thinking that it would be improved if it did not have the shadow on & of the bench (easier said than done with the nice lighting).  Well done.', '2004-11-17 00:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014874, 121321, 27375, '<td valign="top">this is an awesome shot, i think the title doesnt really go with it, it makes me think of many other things other than innocense, but it is your shot..so who am i to say</td>', 'this is an awesome shot, i think the title doesnt really go with it, it makes me think of many other things other than innocense, but it is your shot..so who am i to say', '2004-11-17 00:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014876, 121481, 2281, '<td valign="top">I think this needs to be a bit brighter to help bring out the form a bit more. Also the bra marks on the skin are distracting. Still a nice photo (6)</td>', 'I think this needs to be a bit brighter to help bring out the form a bit more. Also the bra marks on the skin are distracting. Still a nice photo (6)', '2004-11-17 00:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014877, 122080, 20774, '<td valign="top">This is really nice.</td>', 'This is really nice.', '2004-11-17 00:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014880, 122067, 15811, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture of the sky -- I think the B&amp;W really makes that stand out.  The road is nice and soft and gives the eye something pleasant to look at -- great composition.</td>', 'Beautiful picture of the sky -- I think the B&W really makes that stand out.  The road is nice and soft and gives the eye something pleasant to look at -- great composition.', '2004-11-17 00:35:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014881, 122019, 18194, '<td valign="top">very good use of lighting on this one I think.</td>', 'very good use of lighting on this one I think.', '2004-11-17 00:36:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014882, 122090, 25952, '<td valign="top">little bit outta focus...</td>', 'little bit outta focus...', '2004-11-17 00:36:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014883, 121220, 10432, '<td valign="top">Cute capture.  Just seems a bit OOF.</td>', 'Cute capture.  Just seems a bit OOF.', '2004-11-17 00:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014884, 121578, 29477, '<td valign="top">Great shot...like the angle and natural light coming from behind.  great balance</td>', 'Great shot...like the angle and natural light coming from behind.  great balance', '2004-11-17 00:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1014885, 120961, 25952, '<td valign="top">pleasing setup, but i think a bit more light might do it well.</td>', 'pleasing setup, but i think a bit more light might do it well.', '2004-11-17 00:36:40.000000', NULL, 1),
