(1015160, 121457, 6804, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful landscape! the sky is a little bright and the foreground a bit too dark for my taste. A ND grad filter in the sky would improve this greatly. I would love to see you re-do this with that adjustment and post it again to show the detail you gain.  Still a great composition.</td>', 'This is a beautiful landscape! the sky is a little bright and the foreground a bit too dark for my taste. A ND grad filter in the sky would improve this greatly. I would love to see you re-do this with that adjustment and post it again to show the detail you gain.  Still a great composition.', '2004-11-17 01:44:57.000000', NULL, 1),
