(1015447, 120727, 20608, '<td valign="top">Going for the brown? you might just get it. too grainey no focus really looks like a webcam shot to me. I wish i could suggest something to help but i cant think of anything other than you try to remove the noise with photoshop or something.</td>', 'Going for the brown? you might just get it. too grainey no focus really looks like a webcam shot to me. I wish i could suggest something to help but i cant think of anything other than you try to remove the noise with photoshop or something.', '2004-11-17 03:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015451, 121471, 3273, '<td valign="top">Okay, except for the extreme glare on the top of his head.  Perhaps it''s a little too tightly cropped?</td>', 'Okay, except for the extreme glare on the top of his head.  Perhaps it''s a little too tightly cropped?', '2004-11-17 04:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015457, 120539, 21714, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrait. The detail is superb and your B&amp;W convertion is excellent. Wonderful B&amp;W that looks like it''s a real print.  I know you''d be limited with what you can do with Basic Editing, but I think if you are processing it again, introducing a hint of grey to the collar would help balance the tones even more.  Right now when you are looking at her eyes, you are aware of the collar.</td>', 'Beautiful portrait. The detail is superb and your B&W convertion is excellent. Wonderful B&W that looks like it''s a real print.  I know you''d be limited with what you can do with Basic Editing, but I think if you are processing it again, introducing a hint of grey to the collar would help balance the tones even more.  Right now when you are looking at her eyes, you are aware of the collar.', '2004-11-17 04:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015460, 120539, 6388, '<td valign="top">great lighting.  prolly a little sharp for Amber''s liking :)  that''s a whole lot of skin detail available there...sometimes a little softness never hurt.<br/> <br/>if this were an open challenge, I''d tell you to dodge her eyes a little so highlight them.  obviously one of her strong points.<br/> <br/>very nice capture of her expression.  great shot.</td>', 'great lighting.  prolly a little sharp for Amber''s liking :)  that''s a whole lot of skin detail available there...sometimes a little softness never hurt. if this were an open challenge, I''d tell you to dodge her eyes a little so highlight them.  obviously one of her strong points. very nice capture of her expression.  great shot.', '2004-11-17 04:21:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015464, 120444, 6388, '<td valign="top">P wants a cello :(<br/> <br/>beautful contrast.  very difficult to do under these silly basic editing rules.  you managed to get good sharpness and contrast without blowing out the highlights or losing detail in the shadows.  well done.<br/> <br/>P</td>', 'P wants a cello :( beautful contrast.  very difficult to do under these silly basic editing rules.  you managed to get good sharpness and contrast without blowing out the highlights or losing detail in the shadows.  well done. P', '2004-11-17 04:23:08.000000', NULL, 1),
