(1015663, 121832, 27482, '<td valign="top">No I refuse to give this only 3 as a rating :)  This is a pretty good shot, good contrast and sharpness so I gave it a 7, how´s that?</td>', 'No I refuse to give this only 3 as a rating :)  This is a pretty good shot, good contrast and sharpness so I gave it a 7, how´s that?', '2004-11-17 07:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015666, 121858, 27482, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately I don´t think you will do well with this shot but I hope you do, I like it very much.  The soft shadows, the composition, just everything about it.  I bet this would look very good in a very big frame up on somebodys wall.  9</td>', 'Unfortunately I don´t think you will do well with this shot but I hope you do, I like it very much.  The soft shadows, the composition, just everything about it.  I bet this would look very good in a very big frame up on somebodys wall.  9', '2004-11-17 07:21:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015667, 121369, 27482, '<td valign="top">Looks good, could be in a brochure advertising winter clothes.  Íslensk mynd?  Grunar það...</td>', 'Looks good, could be in a brochure advertising winter clothes.  Íslensk mynd?  Grunar það...', '2004-11-17 07:22:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015668, 121745, 27482, '<td valign="top">This could have been a very very good shot but unfortunately the eyes are just barely visible and so much in this shot, in my opinion, rests on his expression and because you can´t really make it out (my monitor is calibrated, by the way) it loses a lot of impact.  Anyway, what I am trying to say is that I like this shot a lot but feel that it really didn´t hit the target, but definately keep it up, this is very promising.</td>', 'This could have been a very very good shot but unfortunately the eyes are just barely visible and so much in this shot, in my opinion, rests on his expression and because you can´t really make it out (my monitor is calibrated, by the way) it loses a lot of impact.  Anyway, what I am trying to say is that I like this shot a lot but feel that it really didn´t hit the target, but definately keep it up, this is very promising.', '2004-11-17 07:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015670, 121569, 27482, '<td valign="top">Nice use of shallow DOF, it´s a good shot, only thing I want to nitpick about is that maybe you should have boosted the contrast by a bout +5 or +10 in photoshop, it seems a little bit flat.</td>', 'Nice use of shallow DOF, it´s a good shot, only thing I want to nitpick about is that maybe you should have boosted the contrast by a bout +5 or +10 in photoshop, it seems a little bit flat.', '2004-11-17 07:27:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015672, 121916, 27482, '<td valign="top">Very distracting backround, it blends in with the subject and also seems a bit out of focus...</td>', 'Very distracting backround, it blends in with the subject and also seems a bit out of focus...', '2004-11-17 07:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015673, 120995, 27161, '<td valign="top">F*cking great tree.  I really wish the picture was bigger.</td>', 'F*cking great tree.  I really wish the picture was bigger.', '2004-11-17 07:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015675, 121760, 27482, '<td valign="top">Life withouth colour indeed.  The problem with this shot for me personally is that there is nothing really interesting here and there is no real subject.  My eye just wanders and just to be frank (hope you don´t take offense for that is not my goal) this is just boring to look at.</td>', 'Life withouth colour indeed.  The problem with this shot for me personally is that there is nothing really interesting here and there is no real subject.  My eye just wanders and just to be frank (hope you don´t take offense for that is not my goal) this is just boring to look at.', '2004-11-17 07:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015676, 120539, 27482, '<td valign="top">Lovely portrait, would make most models proud to have in their portfolio but besides that it´s not exceptional either so hope that doesn´t drag your ratings down.  I gave it an 8 for what it is worth.</td>', 'Lovely portrait, would make most models proud to have in their portfolio but besides that it´s not exceptional either so hope that doesn´t drag your ratings down.  I gave it an 8 for what it is worth.', '2004-11-17 07:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015677, 121182, 24913, '<td valign="top">Nice lines and texture. A bit noisy though</td>', 'Nice lines and texture. A bit noisy though', '2004-11-17 07:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015680, 121767, 27482, '<td valign="top">The frame is very excessive and frankly, it is drawing much more attention that the photograph itself so it is very hard for me to try and rate this fairly.  I probably would have given it a higher mark with a smaller, more neutral frame.</td>', 'The frame is very excessive and frankly, it is drawing much more attention that the photograph itself so it is very hard for me to try and rate this fairly.  I probably would have given it a higher mark with a smaller, more neutral frame.', '2004-11-17 07:35:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015682, 121226, 29079, '<td valign="top">Wonderful!! I have tried so many times to get this type of capture with a local heron, but unfortunately he doesn''t give me this opportunity..Well done!</td>', 'Wonderful!! I have tried so many times to get this type of capture with a local heron, but unfortunately he doesn''t give me this opportunity..Well done!', '2004-11-17 07:35:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015685, 122070, 27482, '<td valign="top">A bit flat, could use some increase in contrast.  Also the pose looks a bit fake, you can obviously see she is awake since her head isn´t even close to resting on her hands.  That being said though this is a great wedding shot, I would have been proud to have taken it myself.  7</td>', 'A bit flat, could use some increase in contrast.  Also the pose looks a bit fake, you can obviously see she is awake since her head isn´t even close to resting on her hands.  That being said though this is a great wedding shot, I would have been proud to have taken it myself.  7', '2004-11-17 07:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015687, 121672, 19952, '<td valign="top">Outstanding portrait of an excellent B&amp;W subject. Really nice job.</td>', 'Outstanding portrait of an excellent B&W subject. Really nice job.', '2004-11-17 07:40:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015688, 121457, 24913, '<td valign="top">Beautiful effect. Maybe a little more exposure on the trees in the forground.</td>', 'Beautiful effect. Maybe a little more exposure on the trees in the forground.', '2004-11-17 07:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015690, 122088, 26487, '<td valign="top">GORGEOUS</td>', 'GORGEOUS', '2004-11-17 07:42:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015692, 121807, 29079, '<td valign="top">not sure about the background...</td>', 'not sure about the background...', '2004-11-17 07:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015694, 121735, 20204, '<td valign="top">The backlighting is a bit too strong at the top of the head.  the brightness from those highlights takes away from the subject.  good positioning, and I like the effect of the wind blowing throught hair.</td>', 'The backlighting is a bit too strong at the top of the head.  the brightness from those highlights takes away from the subject.  good positioning, and I like the effect of the wind blowing throught hair.', '2004-11-17 07:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015695, 122181, 20204, '<td valign="top">Not enough detail in the petals for me - seems to have an overall washed out feel, perhaps from a bit too aggressive levels adjustment?</td>', 'Not enough detail in the petals for me - seems to have an overall washed out feel, perhaps from a bit too aggressive levels adjustment?', '2004-11-17 07:43:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015697, 121363, 26487, '<td valign="top">This scene looks familiar to me personally. I wonder what is the glow supposed to be? I really like how the obsects stand out, just thinking that the clearness of the background distracts the main object a bit, but it works that the closer to the hat is darker. GREAT!</td>', 'This scene looks familiar to me personally. I wonder what is the glow supposed to be? I really like how the obsects stand out, just thinking that the clearness of the background distracts the main object a bit, but it works that the closer to the hat is darker. GREAT!', '2004-11-17 07:45:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015698, 122211, 20204, '<td valign="top">There''s an interesting optical illusion in this image...  It feels like its tilted counterclockwise, yet you''ve lined up the tree trunk in right-frame, and I think the horizon is level as well.  I like the silhouette in the upper right.  The leaves in the upper left are a distraction; Too little of them to contribute to the image.  Also a bit too dark overall to retain detail on the background town.</td>', 'There''s an interesting optical illusion in this image...  It feels like its tilted counterclockwise, yet you''ve lined up the tree trunk in right-frame, and I think the horizon is level as well.  I like the silhouette in the upper right.  The leaves in the upper left are a distraction; Too little of them to contribute to the image.  Also a bit too dark overall to retain detail on the background town.', '2004-11-17 07:46:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015699, 121009, 24613, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot. IMHO you should try to come up with a creative title for your entries.  I really like the shadows. 8</td>', 'This is a great shot. IMHO you should try to come up with a creative title for your entries.  I really like the shadows. 8', '2004-11-17 07:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015700, 122080, 20204, '<td valign="top">Not sure if its the overall darkenss of this image, but there doesn''t seem to be quite enough detail in the clouds to make this "work" for me.  The horizon line is also tilted clockwise.</td>', 'Not sure if its the overall darkenss of this image, but there doesn''t seem to be quite enough detail in the clouds to make this "work" for me.  The horizon line is also tilted clockwise.', '2004-11-17 07:47:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015701, 122015, 24613, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done!  Great use of shadows.  9</td>', 'Very nicely done!  Great use of shadows.  9', '2004-11-17 07:48:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015702, 121459, 19952, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful shot that works great in B&amp;W. Really nice job.</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful shot that works great in B&W. Really nice job.', '2004-11-17 07:48:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015703, 120316, 20204, '<td valign="top">Highlights are blown out all over the rock surfaces causing significant loss of detail.  the tonal range between the water and rocks is just too much for the camera to hold either in detail.  This shot needed to be taken closer to sunrise / sunset.</td>', 'Highlights are blown out all over the rock surfaces causing significant loss of detail.  the tonal range between the water and rocks is just too much for the camera to hold either in detail.  This shot needed to be taken closer to sunrise / sunset.', '2004-11-17 07:49:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015707, 121245, 24613, '<td valign="top">This shot is stunning!!  The best in the challenge, IMO.  Already in my favorites! 10</td>', 'This shot is stunning!!  The best in the challenge, IMO.  Already in my favorites! 10', '2004-11-17 07:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015708, 121541, 20204, '<td valign="top">This is different - haven''t seen too many fireworks shots that include ground details to add to interest.  I like the effect of the foreground boats.  Looks like your shutter speed was dead-on as well.  Seems like a bit too much ISO noise causes a distracting effect.</td>', 'This is different - haven''t seen too many fireworks shots that include ground details to add to interest.  I like the effect of the foreground boats.  Looks like your shutter speed was dead-on as well.  Seems like a bit too much ISO noise causes a distracting effect.', '2004-11-17 07:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015712, 121482, 20204, '<td valign="top">Reflections are a big part of the appeal of this shot, and cropping the lead goose''s is a problem here.  Seems like a bit too tight on the top/bottom crop - needs a bit more breathing room.  I would consider a vertical orientation for this shot.</td>', 'Reflections are a big part of the appeal of this shot, and cropping the lead goose''s is a problem here.  Seems like a bit too tight on the top/bottom crop - needs a bit more breathing room.  I would consider a vertical orientation for this shot.', '2004-11-17 07:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015714, 121578, 24613, '<td valign="top">Great horse, good action, lovely rider!  Would be better full size. Love the way you stopped the motion.  9</td>', 'Great horse, good action, lovely rider!  Would be better full size. Love the way you stopped the motion.  9', '2004-11-17 07:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015715, 122192, 27617, '<td valign="top">You took a picture while driving?  Have you ever heard of keeping your eyes on the road? I''m just wondering! Nice shot though.</td>', 'You took a picture while driving?  Have you ever heard of keeping your eyes on the road? I''m just wondering! Nice shot though.', '2004-11-17 07:55:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015716, 121721, 20204, '<td valign="top">I''m having trouble reconciling why this is a nude image...  With the Pooh theme, it detracts from it being a figure study.  The lighting doesn''t play to the body''s contours either.  Seems like nude just for the sake of nudity.</td>', 'I''m having trouble reconciling why this is a nude image...  With the Pooh theme, it detracts from it being a figure study.  The lighting doesn''t play to the body''s contours either.  Seems like nude just for the sake of nudity.', '2004-11-17 07:55:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015717, 120836, 27617, '<td valign="top">Wow that cat looks like it wants to eat me... creepy good job though!</td>', 'Wow that cat looks like it wants to eat me... creepy good job though!', '2004-11-17 07:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015719, 121931, 20204, '<td valign="top">Possibly hand-held?  Seems to be lacking sharpness.  I think this shot would benefit from a sunrise or sunset light ray highlighting some aspect of the composition.</td>', 'Possibly hand-held?  Seems to be lacking sharpness.  I think this shot would benefit from a sunrise or sunset light ray highlighting some aspect of the composition.', '2004-11-17 07:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015720, 121399, 20204, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Beautiful study in natural lines.  The contrast is great, sharpenss and detail is excellent as well.  Excellent work!</td>', 'Wow!  Beautiful study in natural lines.  The contrast is great, sharpenss and detail is excellent as well.  Excellent work!', '2004-11-17 07:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015722, 121269, 472, '<td valign="top">goooooorgeous</td>', 'goooooorgeous', '2004-11-17 07:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015724, 120540, 20204, '<td valign="top">I''m not finding anything visually appealing in this shot...</td>', 'I''m not finding anything visually appealing in this shot...', '2004-11-17 07:58:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015725, 120374, 29513, '<td valign="top">I like the framing here.  It focuses attention on the variation in texture as well as value.</td>', 'I like the framing here.  It focuses attention on the variation in texture as well as value.', '2004-11-17 07:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015726, 121988, 472, '<td valign="top">nice light : )</td>', 'nice light : )', '2004-11-17 07:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015727, 121496, 24613, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  The reflections are great.  Nice frame. 9</td>', 'Very nice!  The reflections are great.  Nice frame. 9', '2004-11-17 07:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015728, 121595, 472, '<td valign="top">cute : )</td>', 'cute : )', '2004-11-17 07:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015729, 122209, 472, '<td valign="top">poor camera</td>', 'poor camera', '2004-11-17 07:58:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015730, 120727, 20204, '<td valign="top">Is this from a camera phone?  The high ISO noise and tiny image size really make it difficult to enjoy this image.</td>', 'Is this from a camera phone?  The high ISO noise and tiny image size really make it difficult to enjoy this image.', '2004-11-17 07:59:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015731, 121104, 472, '<td valign="top">im giving this a low score because this is not ''black and white photography''</td>', 'im giving this a low score because this is not ''black and white photography''', '2004-11-17 07:59:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015732, 122115, 472, '<td valign="top">nice lines and dof</td>', 'nice lines and dof', '2004-11-17 07:59:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015733, 121403, 472, '<td valign="top">cool dof</td>', 'cool dof', '2004-11-17 07:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015734, 121201, 472, '<td valign="top">love the composition</td>', 'love the composition', '2004-11-17 08:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015736, 121330, 20204, '<td valign="top">The lines in this image play well with b/w, but there''s something missing...  It seems to me as though this image is too literal; I''m not finding any reward for taking a second glance because I got it all in the first glance.  technically good, but needs some additional soul.</td>', 'The lines in this image play well with b/w, but there''s something missing...  It seems to me as though this image is too literal; I''m not finding any reward for taking a second glance because I got it all in the first glance.  technically good, but needs some additional soul.', '2004-11-17 08:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015741, 121226, 26487, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!</td>', 'Beautiful!', '2004-11-17 08:03:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015743, 120961, 20204, '<td valign="top">Nice still life, good lighting.  The contrasting shapes and textures play well with the black and white treatment.</td>', 'Nice still life, good lighting.  The contrasting shapes and textures play well with the black and white treatment.', '2004-11-17 08:04:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015745, 120705, 29079, '<td valign="top">Great effect!</td>', 'Great effect!', '2004-11-17 08:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015746, 122015, 26487, '<td valign="top">simple but works!</td>', 'simple but works!', '2004-11-17 08:05:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015747, 120663, 27161, '<td valign="top">7 -  I really wish the bird on the left was in better focus.  It is a great setup.</td>', '7 -  I really wish the bird on the left was in better focus.  It is a great setup.', '2004-11-17 08:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015748, 121776, 27482, '<td valign="top">Is that Michael Moore?  Anyway not a very good shot, the highlights over his head (whoever he is) draw way too much attention and the rest of the shot is pretty dark so it´s hard to rate this anything but below average.  4</td>', 'Is that Michael Moore?  Anyway not a very good shot, the highlights over his head (whoever he is) draw way too much attention and the rest of the shot is pretty dark so it´s hard to rate this anything but below average.  4', '2004-11-17 08:05:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015749, 121638, 20204, '<td valign="top">I keep staring at this image trying to figure out what the mesh like surface is...  Very cool combination of portraiture and abstract, and good lighting.  Well done!</td>', 'I keep staring at this image trying to figure out what the mesh like surface is...  Very cool combination of portraiture and abstract, and good lighting.  Well done!', '2004-11-17 08:06:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015751, 120711, 29079, '<td valign="top">i wuold have tried to avoid the shadow on the face</td>', 'i wuold have tried to avoid the shadow on the face', '2004-11-17 08:08:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1015756, 122083, 29461, '<td valign="top">Simple and effective - great character in those hands</td>', 'Simple and effective - great character in those hands', '2004-11-17 08:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
