(1015988, 121526, 25218, '<td valign="top">this would have been a very evocative mood piece if it were larger - check out the tutorial on how to save your images for dpchallenge - it helped me a lot when I first starting submitting.</td>', 'this would have been a very evocative mood piece if it were larger - check out the tutorial on how to save your images for dpchallenge - it helped me a lot when I first starting submitting.', '2004-11-17 09:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
