(1016019, 121525, 26500, '<td valign="top">Very small.  Personally I would try to keep the dimensions above 350-400px and preferably at least one dimension at 640 so voters don''t kill your score for being small.</td>', 'Very small.  Personally I would try to keep the dimensions above 350-400px and preferably at least one dimension at 640 so voters don''t kill your score for being small.', '2004-11-17 09:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
