(1016022, 120830, 26500, '<td valign="top">Very small.  Personally I would try to keep the dimensions above 350-400px and preferably at least one dimension at 640 so voters don''t kill your score for being small.</td>', 'Very small.  Personally I would try to keep the dimensions above 350-400px and preferably at least one dimension at 640 so voters don''t kill your score for being small.', '2004-11-17 09:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1016025, 121108, 29148, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. I hate to be picky, but the single dark slat is distracting</td>', 'Nice composition. I hate to be picky, but the single dark slat is distracting', '2004-11-17 09:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1016029, 120539, 9073, '<td valign="top">Of course this photo is fantastic. My only gripe is with using a very bright shirt which takes a lot away from the face. 8</td>', 'Of course this photo is fantastic. My only gripe is with using a very bright shirt which takes a lot away from the face. 8', '2004-11-17 09:54:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1016030, 121240, 26756, '<td valign="top">You have a very beautiful subject here but I think the lighting does not do her justice.  It''s a bit harsh and casts some bad shadows accross her face.  Maybe one other soft light coming in from her right side would have helped out a bit and lessened some of the shadow.  Also where the floor and background come together in that joint is a bit distracting.  You have a nice subject to work with and I bet you get some much better pictures of her in the future.  Good effort.</td>', 'You have a very beautiful subject here but I think the lighting does not do her justice.  It''s a bit harsh and casts some bad shadows accross her face.  Maybe one other soft light coming in from her right side would have helped out a bit and lessened some of the shadow.  Also where the floor and background come together in that joint is a bit distracting.  You have a nice subject to work with and I bet you get some much better pictures of her in the future.  Good effort.', '2004-11-17 09:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1016032, 122172, 29573, '<td valign="top">I like the light reflections on the ceiling, but not sure about the rest of the photo.</td>', 'I like the light reflections on the ceiling, but not sure about the rest of the photo.', '2004-11-17 09:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1016034, 121680, 29573, '<td valign="top">interesting.........</td>', 'interesting.........', '2004-11-17 09:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
