(1016075, 120526, 29573, '<td valign="top">Like the shot........but all the white at the top keeps drawing my eyes away from the subject.  Maybe crop most of it out? Or a dark background would maybe make the subject stand out more?</td>', 'Like the shot........but all the white at the top keeps drawing my eyes away from the subject.  Maybe crop most of it out? Or a dark background would maybe make the subject stand out more?', '2004-11-17 10:17:54.000000', NULL, 1),
