(1016182, 122076, 208, '<td valign="top">This is OK as an individual shot, but would probably be a cool piece as part of a collection of candid, b&amp;w shots of a touring band. Such as for inside artwork for CD liner notes.</td>', 'This is OK as an individual shot, but would probably be a cool piece as part of a collection of candid, b&w shots of a touring band. Such as for inside artwork for CD liner notes.', '2004-11-17 10:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1016184, 120366, 1827, '<td valign="top">IMO this suffers dramatically from over processing.  It was obviously intentional, but does not suit my taste. 3</td>', 'IMO this suffers dramatically from over processing.  It was obviously intentional, but does not suit my taste. 3', '2004-11-17 10:48:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1016187, 121654, 18028, '<td valign="top">not very original...as the title states  BUT the shot is still well done, and well captured</td>', 'not very original...as the title states  BUT the shot is still well done, and well captured', '2004-11-17 10:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1016188, 121250, 6008, '<td valign="top">It''s a classic image. I think having the checkerboard either straight or an obvious exaggerated tilt would be better. As it is now it just looks kinda awkward and makes me tilt my head to manually straighten up the lines myself. The cups look a little squished together and would have likely benefited from a little more negative space around them, ie not such a tight crop. It''s a shame you couldnt get two identical cups just in the different white/black. I''m not sure what the round black thing is under the black cup but it stands out as being different from the pattern. I also think it would likely have done better without the spoon as you can see the reflection and what appears to be a flash.</td>', 'It''s a classic image. I think having the checkerboard either straight or an obvious exaggerated tilt would be better. As it is now it just looks kinda awkward and makes me tilt my head to manually straighten up the lines myself. The cups look a little squished together and would have likely benefited from a little more negative space around them, ie not such a tight crop. It''s a shame you couldnt get two identical cups just in the different white/black. I''m not sure what the round black thing is under the black cup but it stands out as being different from the pattern. I also think it would likely have done better without the spoon as you can see the reflection and what appears to be a flash.', '2004-11-17 10:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1016190, 121586, 29573, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.......</td>', 'Beautiful.......', '2004-11-17 10:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1016191, 121529, 208, '<td valign="top">Why is Dad''s nostril (which we can see waaaay up) at dead center? This is an adorable photo, though. Is there a way to make the girl more prominent in it? Even her painted nails are cute.</td>', 'Why is Dad''s nostril (which we can see waaaay up) at dead center? This is an adorable photo, though. Is there a way to make the girl more prominent in it? Even her painted nails are cute.', '2004-11-17 10:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1016193, 121645, 1827, '<td valign="top">Clever.  Nice dof choice.  would like the face a tad sharper.  Also there seem to be compression artifacts in the water. 5</td>', 'Clever.  Nice dof choice.  would like the face a tad sharper.  Also there seem to be compression artifacts in the water. 5', '2004-11-17 10:50:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1016197, 121973, 29477, '<td valign="top">I like this shot...It would have been more impactful if the names could be seen and read.</td>', 'I like this shot...It would have been more impactful if the names could be seen and read.', '2004-11-17 10:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1016199, 121158, 208, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful (and not just for the obvious reason). I like cropping out her face (though the ear is distracting), but allowing us to see her long hair falling behind her. And nice lighting, too.</td>', 'This is beautiful (and not just for the obvious reason). I like cropping out her face (though the ear is distracting), but allowing us to see her long hair falling behind her. And nice lighting, too.', '2004-11-17 10:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1016202, 122042, 29477, '<td valign="top">Great shot with the rainfall from the sand and capturing the golfball.</td>', 'Great shot with the rainfall from the sand and capturing the golfball.', '2004-11-17 10:54:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1016203, 121346, 1827, '<td valign="top">Framing is nice.  Lighting is almost perfect (would like a teensy bit less glare on the left).  A bit of noise that distracts me.  I can identify the problems, but unfortunately offer no solutions.  My own attemptt would have tielded similar results. 5 on technical merit, but giving it a 6 for the thoughtfulness in composition and particularly how the stem is lit.</td>', 'Framing is nice.  Lighting is almost perfect (would like a teensy bit less glare on the left).  A bit of noise that distracts me.  I can identify the problems, but unfortunately offer no solutions.  My own attemptt would have tielded similar results. 5 on technical merit, but giving it a 6 for the thoughtfulness in composition and particularly how the stem is lit.', '2004-11-17 10:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1016205, 121338, 208, '<td valign="top">hee hee. I chuckled for a while on seeing this. All these lines makes me wonder if it''s level, though. Just a small question on a great shot. 9</td>', 'hee hee. I chuckled for a while on seeing this. All these lines makes me wonder if it''s level, though. Just a small question on a great shot. 9', '2004-11-17 10:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1016207, 121642, 3102, '<td valign="top">A familiar view for me!  Nice job on the toning.</td>', 'A familiar view for me!  Nice job on the toning.', '2004-11-17 10:56:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1016212, 120673, 1827, '<td valign="top">For a first kiss there sure isn''t any trepidation here!  The tones are pretty flat.  5</td>', 'For a first kiss there sure isn''t any trepidation here!  The tones are pretty flat.  5', '2004-11-17 10:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1016213, 121396, 6008, '<td valign="top">The composition and crop is good. The expression makes one wonder what she is thinking but mostly as a distant observer. The image doesnt really engage the viewer and bring them in, not that that is always necessary. I''m not really sure if black and white works here. The tone makes the image feel very cold and impersonal, as if the personality has been stripped away with the color.</td>', 'The composition and crop is good. The expression makes one wonder what she is thinking but mostly as a distant observer. The image doesnt really engage the viewer and bring them in, not that that is always necessary. I''m not really sure if black and white works here. The tone makes the image feel very cold and impersonal, as if the personality has been stripped away with the color.', '2004-11-17 10:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1016214, 121363, 1827, '<td valign="top">My eye cannot stop staring at the arc of light painted above the chair.  The blinds are also distracting. 4</td>', 'My eye cannot stop staring at the arc of light painted above the chair.  The blinds are also distracting. 4', '2004-11-17 10:58:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1016216, 121613, 208, '<td valign="top">Very cool, but I would have focused on the top row rather than the second. Really like the framing. Good eye for a subject few people would consider shooting.</td>', 'Very cool, but I would have focused on the top row rather than the second. Really like the framing. Good eye for a subject few people would consider shooting.', '2004-11-17 10:59:02.000000', NULL, 1),
