(1016531, 122090, 10432, '<td valign="top">Focus too soft and I think the flowers would have looked better with a black background for the entire photo. They seem to stand out more on the left side of the shot.  It would benefit from increased contrast.</td>', 'Focus too soft and I think the flowers would have looked better with a black background for the entire photo. They seem to stand out more on the left side of the shot.  It would benefit from increased contrast.', '2004-11-17 12:17:54.000000', NULL, 1),
