(1016536, 120725, 6388, '<td valign="top">creativity points for sure (not enough of that in this challenge so far).  image quality is great; nice focus and lighting, depth is spot on.  cool camera too :).  crop is a little tight for my taste,  but i''m sure you looked at lots of options and decided this was best.  One of the better BW conversions in the challenge.  it''s a PITA in basic editing in my opinion.  well done.<br/>P</td>', 'creativity points for sure (not enough of that in this challenge so far).  image quality is great; nice focus and lighting, depth is spot on.  cool camera too :).  crop is a little tight for my taste,  but i''m sure you looked at lots of options and decided this was best.  One of the better BW conversions in the challenge.  it''s a PITA in basic editing in my opinion.  well done.P', '2004-11-17 12:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
