(1016547, 122165, 6388, '<td valign="top">the idea is there, but the execution leaves something to be desired.  the branches are very soft looking, and the lighting seems really flat.  backlit subjects can make for some great contrasty images.  I might have tried underexposing it a bit, then bumping the contrast using levels or curves.  this is just my opinion, of course - it''s all personal taste I guess, huh? :)<br/>P</td>', 'the idea is there, but the execution leaves something to be desired.  the branches are very soft looking, and the lighting seems really flat.  backlit subjects can make for some great contrasty images.  I might have tried underexposing it a bit, then bumping the contrast using levels or curves.  this is just my opinion, of course - it''s all personal taste I guess, huh? :)P', '2004-11-17 12:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1016549, 121807, 27574, '<td valign="top">Cute photo, I love the glasses and the curls.  I think it would have done even better if you cropped it to have just the girl in the photo....the lighter background is a bit distracting to me.  It has nice strong tonal range.</td>', 'Cute photo, I love the glasses and the curls.  I think it would have done even better if you cropped it to have just the girl in the photo....the lighter background is a bit distracting to me.  It has nice strong tonal range.', '2004-11-17 12:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
