(1016584, 120727, 29511, '<td valign="top">this is a gritty picture, but it works in this case, the back light also works, this is the opposite of "pro" but it really works for me... maybe if there could be more of the backlighting shinning on the top of his hat to fully uluminate his pose that would work a bit better, but good shot</td>', 'this is a gritty picture, but it works in this case, the back light also works, this is the opposite of "pro" but it really works for me... maybe if there could be more of the backlighting shinning on the top of his hat to fully uluminate his pose that would work a bit better, but good shot', '2004-11-17 12:30:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1016585, 121639, 27574, '<td valign="top">I keep seeing photos that are fantastic if only they were cropped differently....I guess everyone seeing things differently is what makes the world go round, lol. My first reaction when this one started to load was that it was outstading....then  I see the darker areas coming into view and I didn''t like it as well.  (Still a very nice photo, tho)  I cropped it differently....with just the top misty area and the top of the girl in it and loved it.  Just me I guess.</td>', 'I keep seeing photos that are fantastic if only they were cropped differently....I guess everyone seeing things differently is what makes the world go round, lol. My first reaction when this one started to load was that it was outstading....then  I see the darker areas coming into view and I didn''t like it as well.  (Still a very nice photo, tho)  I cropped it differently....with just the top misty area and the top of the girl in it and loved it.  Just me I guess.', '2004-11-17 12:31:01.000000', NULL, 1),
