(1016668, 121250, 10909, '<td valign="top">It''s not very good in sense of composition - I think, in particular, that a spoon doesn''t look very well laying like that. But it''s a first work (by order the works are placed here :) that drew my attention in sense of correspondence to the contest. Milk and coffee. Very good. 8.</td>', 'It''s not very good in sense of composition - I think, in particular, that a spoon doesn''t look very well laying like that. But it''s a first work (by order the works are placed here :) that drew my attention in sense of correspondence to the contest. Milk and coffee. Very good. 8.', '2004-11-17 12:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1016669, 122200, 24925, '<td valign="top">Whether intentional or not, I appreciate the soft focus here.  I think the left side of the photo is begging to be cropped about 5% to remove that last piece of grass...I could be wrong though.<br/> <br/>Nice, warm photo...7</td>', 'Whether intentional or not, I appreciate the soft focus here.  I think the left side of the photo is begging to be cropped about 5% to remove that last piece of grass...I could be wrong though. Nice, warm photo...7', '2004-11-17 12:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1016670, 122114, 27375, '<td valign="top">this is cute and it has interesting lighting but all the other  stuff seems to drag you away from the subject, i would have liked this better if you moved the table, slippers and the other thing and get his hair all in the shot</td>', 'this is cute and it has interesting lighting but all the other  stuff seems to drag you away from the subject, i would have liked this better if you moved the table, slippers and the other thing and get his hair all in the shot', '2004-11-17 12:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1016671, 120762, 29511, '<td valign="top">here i have been complaining about things being out of focus and here is a picture thats totally out focus.. but i love it, great proof that anything can be done and there are no "rules" ..bravo!!</td>', 'here i have been complaining about things being out of focus and here is a picture thats totally out focus.. but i love it, great proof that anything can be done and there are no "rules" ..bravo!!', '2004-11-17 12:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1016673, 121222, 27482, '<td valign="top">Þessi er bara geðveik!  Besta mynd sem ég hef nokkurntíman séð af Háteigskirkju og ég hef séð þær margar.  10 í einkunn.  Ég veit að það má svo ekki í Basic editing en ef ég væri þú myndi ég "klóna" burt ljósastaurinn niðri í hægra horninu, hann stingur dálítið í augun.<br/> <br/>For those of you who don´t speak Icelandic I am just simply drooling over this image...</td>', 'Þessi er bara geðveik!  Besta mynd sem ég hef nokkurntíman séð af Háteigskirkju og ég hef séð þær margar.  10 í einkunn.  Ég veit að það má svo ekki í Basic editing en ef ég væri þú myndi ég "klóna" burt ljósastaurinn niðri í hægra horninu, hann stingur dálítið í augun. For those of you who don´t speak Icelandic I am just simply drooling over this image...', '2004-11-17 12:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1016674, 120985, 29511, '<td valign="top">love the textures and lighting and subject.. white fleck on upper middle of cart distracts my eye pull, but none the less great shot</td>', 'love the textures and lighting and subject.. white fleck on upper middle of cart distracts my eye pull, but none the less great shot', '2004-11-17 12:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1016675, 122097, 208, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I wish there were more of the singer, but that''s a minor complaint. The lighting on him is great.</td>', 'Very nice. I wish there were more of the singer, but that''s a minor complaint. The lighting on him is great.', '2004-11-17 12:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1016676, 120473, 25024, '<td valign="top">Wonderful job - this deserves to do well. Some may criticise the stumpy effect of the fingers but the lighting, background and range of tones are excellent - well done</td>', 'Wonderful job - this deserves to do well. Some may criticise the stumpy effect of the fingers but the lighting, background and range of tones are excellent - well done', '2004-11-17 12:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
