(1016686, 122150, 24925, '<td valign="top">I think the composition is excellent!  I wish the photo was sharper, though...the background looks really washed out, which would have been fine if the bridge was bolder and fully captured my attention.  It would have taken sharpness and maybe some greater contrast to do this.</td>', 'I think the composition is excellent!  I wish the photo was sharper, though...the background looks really washed out, which would have been fine if the bridge was bolder and fully captured my attention.  It would have taken sharpness and maybe some greater contrast to do this.', '2004-11-17 12:54:16.000000', NULL, 1),
