(1017016, 122175, 3087, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of high contrast to really show the texture of the worn wood and accretions. Love that nail with the number on the head. How intriguing. An excellent image.</td>', 'Excellent use of high contrast to really show the texture of the worn wood and accretions. Love that nail with the number on the head. How intriguing. An excellent image.', '2004-11-17 14:37:41.000000', NULL, 1),
