(1017028, 122137, 208, '<td valign="top">Lots happening here that I like. Texture on the dome, fence shadow in the snow/sand (?), interesting sky.</td>', 'Lots happening here that I like. Texture on the dome, fence shadow in the snow/sand (?), interesting sky.', '2004-11-17 14:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1017030, 120763, 17033, '<td valign="top">Spanish castle magic, maybe? Nice rustic feel although a little bright on the stonework</td>', 'Spanish castle magic, maybe? Nice rustic feel although a little bright on the stonework', '2004-11-17 14:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1017031, 121306, 3087, '<td valign="top">Interesting semi-silhouette aspect yet enough detail to add interest. A great interplay of the shapes of the two boys, the net and the ball itself. Intriguing coastal location too.</td>', 'Interesting semi-silhouette aspect yet enough detail to add interest. A great interplay of the shapes of the two boys, the net and the ball itself. Intriguing coastal location too.', '2004-11-17 14:44:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1017033, 121977, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely detail to the top with the cobwebs draping their silk over the seed head. Nice use of DOF also. Not so keen on so much darkness to left side of frame.</td>', 'Lovely detail to the top with the cobwebs draping their silk over the seed head. Nice use of DOF also. Not so keen on so much darkness to left side of frame.', '2004-11-17 14:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1017034, 121610, 17033, '<td valign="top">Finally some nice tones! Great texture on the jackets too. Great portrait. well done.</td>', 'Finally some nice tones! Great texture on the jackets too. Great portrait. well done.', '2004-11-17 14:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1017035, 121941, 27496, '<td valign="top">The highlights were just blown out too much to me so she blends into the background  where she doesn''t stand out.</td>', 'The highlights were just blown out too much to me so she blends into the background  where she doesn''t stand out.', '2004-11-17 14:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1017036, 121500, 208, '<td valign="top">Cool idea. While I don''t think any single spine/ridge should be *the* focus, something probably should be *in* focus.</td>', 'Cool idea. While I don''t think any single spine/ridge should be *the* focus, something probably should be *in* focus.', '2004-11-17 14:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1017038, 122115, 3087, '<td valign="top">Absolutely terrific range of tones from such rich black to beautiful whites. Nice use of shallow DOF to direct attention to foregound leaf and it''s curled tip - also gives a delightful softness to the one at the top back. Composition is very strong indeed for me.</td>', 'Absolutely terrific range of tones from such rich black to beautiful whites. Nice use of shallow DOF to direct attention to foregound leaf and it''s curled tip - also gives a delightful softness to the one at the top back. Composition is very strong indeed for me.', '2004-11-17 14:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1017041, 121237, 3087, '<td valign="top">Sweet idea and definitely communitcates that shy, worrying nature.<br/>Exposure could be improved - too much blow out on her left foot (right as we look at it) and elsewhere too.</td>', 'Sweet idea and definitely communitcates that shy, worrying nature.Exposure could be improved - too much blow out on her left foot (right as we look at it) and elsewhere too.', '2004-11-17 14:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1017047, 121982, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great angle - wonderful angles, great light and reflections of light, wonderful sleekness of texture of the links. Very nice indeed.</td>', 'Great angle - wonderful angles, great light and reflections of light, wonderful sleekness of texture of the links. Very nice indeed.', '2004-11-17 14:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1017050, 122171, 23913, '<td valign="top">seems a little washed out taking the brightness down or the contrast up could help that.<br/> <br/>otherwise well composed</td>', 'seems a little washed out taking the brightness down or the contrast up could help that. otherwise well composed', '2004-11-17 14:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1017052, 122176, 3087, '<td valign="top">Very intimate crop - excellent composition within the frame. Something about the eyes bothers me - I want to see into them more clearly yet there''s a reflection on the one to the right of the frame which doesn''t look right.</td>', 'Very intimate crop - excellent composition within the frame. Something about the eyes bothers me - I want to see into them more clearly yet there''s a reflection on the one to the right of the frame which doesn''t look right.', '2004-11-17 14:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1017053, 121584, 208, '<td valign="top">"Fungaloid." hee hee. Nice DOF. Nice texture contrast between the fungaloid (hee hee) and tree. The word "fungaloid" makes me laugh. Sorry.</td>', '"Fungaloid." hee hee. Nice DOF. Nice texture contrast between the fungaloid (hee hee) and tree. The word "fungaloid" makes me laugh. Sorry.', '2004-11-17 14:50:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1017056, 121909, 3087, '<td valign="top">Something stark and soft about this portrait all at once. The pose and the light in his/ her eyes is so tender. The rich black background and the texture in the material give a starkness too. Wonderful portrait.</td>', 'Something stark and soft about this portrait all at once. The pose and the light in his/ her eyes is so tender. The rich black background and the texture in the material give a starkness too. Wonderful portrait.', '2004-11-17 14:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1017059, 121533, 3087, '<td valign="top">Intriguing to see this subject in black and white. Very striking (no pun intended;) and unexpected.</td>', 'Intriguing to see this subject in black and white. Very striking (no pun intended;) and unexpected.', '2004-11-17 14:52:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1017060, 122029, 23913, '<td valign="top">thats awsome and u''ve been validated so i just want to know how,how,how!!!!!!!<br/> <br/>great job awsome shot</td>', 'thats awsome and u''ve been validated so i just want to know how,how,how!!!!!!! great job awsome shot', '2004-11-17 14:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1017067, 121338, 3087, '<td valign="top">An absolutely charming portrait. This really strikes me as very professional, very intriguing, highly individualistic and just the kind of work I could see hanging in some top notch art gallery. It''s wonderful! Only -ve = the blow out on the wall to the right which could be corrected with a little spot editting after the challenge if you wanted.</td>', 'An absolutely charming portrait. This really strikes me as very professional, very intriguing, highly individualistic and just the kind of work I could see hanging in some top notch art gallery. It''s wonderful! Only -ve = the blow out on the wall to the right which could be corrected with a little spot editting after the challenge if you wanted.', '2004-11-17 14:54:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1017068, 121148, 3087, '<td valign="top">You were in London and didn''t suggest a GTG or communal shooting day?! ;o)<br/>Really conveys London weather!</td>', 'You were in London and didn''t suggest a GTG or communal shooting day?! ;o)Really conveys London weather!', '2004-11-17 14:56:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1017070, 120623, 26827, '<td valign="top">As an American, switching this left to right would have been better for me.</td>', 'As an American, switching this left to right would have been better for me.', '2004-11-17 14:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
