(1017184, 120486, 18191, '<td valign="top">I like this image for the fact that even thhough it is a long shutter speed, the highlights are not blown out in the water. However, it looks soft to me either due to slight camera shake or to a lack of USM. I think that if you cropped out the trees on the left and applied an aggresive unsharp mask, then this would be a great piece.</td>', 'I like this image for the fact that even thhough it is a long shutter speed, the highlights are not blown out in the water. However, it looks soft to me either due to slight camera shake or to a lack of USM. I think that if you cropped out the trees on the left and applied an aggresive unsharp mask, then this would be a great piece.', '2004-11-17 15:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
