(1017223, 121586, 13064, '<td valign="top">Very tasteful, works well as b&amp;w.  I like the subtle shadows. One could have been tempted to go really severe in the lighting and take away from the gentleness.</td>', 'Very tasteful, works well as b&w.  I like the subtle shadows. One could have been tempted to go really severe in the lighting and take away from the gentleness.', '2004-11-17 15:39:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1017225, 120716, 29168, '<td valign="top">The focus here seems neither "here nor there". For me, it needs to be either on the key (preferable) or the curlky ring thing (in it''s entirety, meaning a change of aperture I guess.) Contrast and brightness good though. Composition, interesting. &lt;sigh&gt; so easy to critique another person''s work! I seldom do better myself, don''t worry!</td>', 'The focus here seems neither "here nor there". For me, it needs to be either on the key (preferable) or the curlky ring thing (in it''s entirety, meaning a change of aperture I guess.) Contrast and brightness good though. Composition, interesting. <sigh> so easy to critique another person''s work! I seldom do better myself, don''t worry!', '2004-11-17 15:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
