(1017276, 121108, 18191, '<td valign="top">Wow--- Great shot. Very ineteresting background and a great study. Great tonal range on the flower and what an interesting vase. This shot is realy great. The only thing that breaks it up is where you can see through the blinds. When editing this for a print (of which it would make a great one) I would clone across those blinds. Lastly, I would make a rotation so that the horizontals are parallel to the frame itself. Very well done 9</td>', 'Wow--- Great shot. Very ineteresting background and a great study. Great tonal range on the flower and what an interesting vase. This shot is realy great. The only thing that breaks it up is where you can see through the blinds. When editing this for a print (of which it would make a great one) I would clone across those blinds. Lastly, I would make a rotation so that the horizontals are parallel to the frame itself. Very well done 9', '2004-11-17 15:53:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1017277, 122082, 20679, '<td valign="top">a bit soft. More contrast would have made it more appealing and perhaps cropping in closer especially on the right.....Textures feel they should be a little rougher to make it a grittier shot.</td>', 'a bit soft. More contrast would have made it more appealing and perhaps cropping in closer especially on the right.....Textures feel they should be a little rougher to make it a grittier shot.', '2004-11-17 15:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
