(1017531, 121671, 27244, '<td valign="top">I love malamutes!  This is a good portrait.  Generally the zebra print would be too distracting but it''s not here, it frames  the puppy well.  -8-</td>', 'I love malamutes!  This is a good portrait.  Generally the zebra print would be too distracting but it''s not here, it frames  the puppy well.  -8-', '2004-11-17 17:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
