(1017534, 121399, 7485, '<td valign="top">Classic subject! Maybe not quite enough ground/foliage to balance all these white trunks. Also, on my 2.2 gamma LCD, the image is a bit too contrasty. But still a 7.</td>', 'Classic subject! Maybe not quite enough ground/foliage to balance all these white trunks. Also, on my 2.2 gamma LCD, the image is a bit too contrasty. But still a 7.', '2004-11-17 17:02:10.000000', NULL, 1),
