(1017563, 121059, 29168, '<td valign="top">Too much color for a B&amp;W challenge me thinks. Image compression has done some damage too unfortunately. I do like the composition though.</td>', 'Too much color for a B&W challenge me thinks. Image compression has done some damage too unfortunately. I do like the composition though.', '2004-11-17 17:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
