(1017567, 121306, 22010, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot. The location is excellent. The poses (probably natural too) are great. I can''t see any way to improve this image. Good job!</td>', 'This is a great shot. The location is excellent. The poses (probably natural too) are great. I can''t see any way to improve this image. Good job!', '2004-11-17 17:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1017568, 120350, 27244, '<td valign="top">I am going to assume that the blurr effect of this is done on purpose. But how does one comment on something they cant see, or tell what they are trying to comment on?  -3-</td>', 'I am going to assume that the blurr effect of this is done on purpose. But how does one comment on something they cant see, or tell what they are trying to comment on?  -3-', '2004-11-17 17:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1017570, 121202, 29168, '<td valign="top">A little too much brightness/contrast? Skin tones seem just a little lost on this monitor. nice composition and pose though. 6.</td>', 'A little too much brightness/contrast? Skin tones seem just a little lost on this monitor. nice composition and pose though. 6.', '2004-11-17 17:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1017571, 120564, 23653, '<td valign="top">Needs to be sharper.... 6</td>', 'Needs to be sharper.... 6', '2004-11-17 17:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1017576, 120862, 22010, '<td valign="top">I like this picture alot. Just 2 things. I don''t like the turn signals in the top left of the photo. It is the epitome of an unnecessary distraction. My opinion of course. Second, the lower left seems a bit dark to me. Maybe that''s intentional and done for effect. Good luck.</td>', 'I like this picture alot. Just 2 things. I don''t like the turn signals in the top left of the photo. It is the epitome of an unnecessary distraction. My opinion of course. Second, the lower left seems a bit dark to me. Maybe that''s intentional and done for effect. Good luck.', '2004-11-17 17:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1017578, 121672, 29168, '<td valign="top">Lovely. Great crop and framing. Excellent light and contrast. Great focus and depth. One or two distractive "floating" hair highlights to left could have been cloned out perhaps. What am I saying!? "Basic editing only" Bumped from 9 to 10.</td>', 'Lovely. Great crop and framing. Excellent light and contrast. Great focus and depth. One or two distractive "floating" hair highlights to left could have been cloned out perhaps. What am I saying!? "Basic editing only" Bumped from 9 to 10.', '2004-11-17 17:11:23.000000', NULL, 1),
