(1017781, 120606, 25203, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast ratio.  Framing is a debate on this image, looks that if she was more right the image would gain intensity with the grays meeting.  If she was a little more right there would be more mystery.  My only dislike is the light falling on her mid back, a french flag is a useful too to control light.</td>', 'Nice contrast ratio.  Framing is a debate on this image, looks that if she was more right the image would gain intensity with the grays meeting.  If she was a little more right there would be more mystery.  My only dislike is the light falling on her mid back, a french flag is a useful too to control light.', '2004-11-17 18:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1017784, 120642, 27451, '<td valign="top">I think B&amp;W really suits this portrait..well done with this</td>', 'I think B&W really suits this portrait..well done with this', '2004-11-17 18:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
