(1017809, 121239, 25203, '<td valign="top">shortening the exposure time by half would hive this image the sharpness that is missing.  also i would like to see a bit more black in the sky.  5<br/> <br/>Image viewed on professional calibrated/color graded monitor set to Web Gamma range.</td>', 'shortening the exposure time by half would hive this image the sharpness that is missing.  also i would like to see a bit more black in the sky.  5 Image viewed on professional calibrated/color graded monitor set to Web Gamma range.', '2004-11-17 18:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
