(1017836, 122113, 25203, '<td valign="top">the water is a little blown out.  Try a ND-9 filter for long exposure daytime shots.  6<br/> <br/>-= Image viewed on professional calibrated/color graded monitor set to Web Gamma range.=-</td>', 'the water is a little blown out.  Try a ND-9 filter for long exposure daytime shots.  6 -= Image viewed on professional calibrated/color graded monitor set to Web Gamma range.=-', '2004-11-17 18:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
