(1017857, 121742, 18191, '<td valign="top">I think that the lighting is a little bit too harsh on the shed. This is shown by the blown highlights. Next time, maybe wait for a different (perhaps more diffuse) lighting situation.</td>', 'I think that the lighting is a little bit too harsh on the shed. This is shown by the blown highlights. Next time, maybe wait for a different (perhaps more diffuse) lighting situation.', '2004-11-17 18:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
