(1017871, 120831, 18191, '<td valign="top">I wisht ehre was a way for the foreground to be better lit. I realize that exposing for the foreground would have resulted in the sky being blown out. What you may want to invest in is a graduated neutral density filter that holds back the light of skies and allows for the forground to be properly exposed.</td>', 'I wisht ehre was a way for the foreground to be better lit. I realize that exposing for the foreground would have resulted in the sky being blown out. What you may want to invest in is a graduated neutral density filter that holds back the light of skies and allows for the forground to be properly exposed.', '2004-11-17 18:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
