(1018168, 121918, 18834, '<td valign="top">This si somewhat of  a plain picture.  If more of the fence was seen, It would look like a deep DOF picture.  Maybe if there was more to see closer, it would give the viewer more to look at</td>', 'This si somewhat of  a plain picture.  If more of the fence was seen, It would look like a deep DOF picture.  Maybe if there was more to see closer, it would give the viewer more to look at', '2004-11-17 19:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
