(1018177, 121238, 18834, '<td valign="top">I like the odd lighting, how the light source is coming from underneath.  My only criticism is that i wish the center wasn''t as dark so you could see more of what it is.</td>', 'I like the odd lighting, how the light source is coming from underneath.  My only criticism is that i wish the center wasn''t as dark so you could see more of what it is.', '2004-11-17 19:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
