(1018216, 122164, 18834, '<td valign="top">The tree is a little out of focus, and with the plain sky above, theres nothing that really stands out in the picture.  I do think that the moss on the tree is cool</td>', 'The tree is a little out of focus, and with the plain sky above, theres nothing that really stands out in the picture.  I do think that the moss on the tree is cool', '2004-11-17 19:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
