(1018220, 121362, 16965, '<td valign="top">There''s a lot of noise in there.  Have you tried running your photos through NeatImage or Helicon Noise Filter?  They are both free and easy to use, and help with that grainy apearance...unless that is what you wanted in there :) If that is the case, then good job!</td>', 'There''s a lot of noise in there.  Have you tried running your photos through NeatImage or Helicon Noise Filter?  They are both free and easy to use, and help with that grainy apearance...unless that is what you wanted in there :) If that is the case, then good job!', '2004-11-17 19:49:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018221, 120801, 24065, '<td valign="top">I love the high contrast.</td>', 'I love the high contrast.', '2004-11-17 19:49:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018222, 121888, 16965, '<td valign="top">I wish the bar didn''t visually split the dog''s head in two....  cute shot, though.</td>', 'I wish the bar didn''t visually split the dog''s head in two....  cute shot, though.', '2004-11-17 19:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018224, 121442, 18834, '<td valign="top">Great DOF.  Although the back ground is a little out of focus, I still like the shot.  The lighting in the foreground leading to the darkness in the background gives it a cool affect.  The boy seems a little out of focus as well, but it isn''t noticed easily because you cannot see his face or parts that would be noticebly blurry.</td>', 'Great DOF.  Although the back ground is a little out of focus, I still like the shot.  The lighting in the foreground leading to the darkness in the background gives it a cool affect.  The boy seems a little out of focus as well, but it isn''t noticed easily because you cannot see his face or parts that would be noticebly blurry.', '2004-11-17 19:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018225, 121933, 14763, '<td valign="top">This is nice expect for the rusted tank in the back 6</td>', 'This is nice expect for the rusted tank in the back 6', '2004-11-17 19:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018227, 121941, 24065, '<td valign="top">Love the high contrast!</td>', 'Love the high contrast!', '2004-11-17 19:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
