(1018250, 121901, 15920, '<td valign="top">Awesome timing of the shot.  It seems a bit flat, but I''m not good enough at B&amp;W to make a helpful suggestion, and I am sorry for that.  I think your crop (complete with the tree coming from the model''s back) is pretty decent.  It gives a sense space, and spontaneity (sp?)  Good luck.</td>', 'Awesome timing of the shot.  It seems a bit flat, but I''m not good enough at B&W to make a helpful suggestion, and I am sorry for that.  I think your crop (complete with the tree coming from the model''s back) is pretty decent.  It gives a sense space, and spontaneity (sp?)  Good luck.', '2004-11-17 20:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018252, 121403, 18834, '<td valign="top">it helps that  the item thats the subject is blak and white to begin with.  I like how it is specifically focused on one key</td>', 'it helps that  the item thats the subject is blak and white to begin with.  I like how it is specifically focused on one key', '2004-11-17 20:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
