(1018258, 120358, 29456, '<td valign="top">That one has a special place in my heart, he''s been through rough times,<br/>good to see him again.</td>', 'That one has a special place in my heart, he''s been through rough times,good to see him again.', '2004-11-17 20:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
