(1018273, 121399, 18834, '<td valign="top">thats what i would call a heavily wooded forest.  the black and white part plays out well because the trees are so naturally white.9.</td>', 'thats what i would call a heavily wooded forest.  the black and white part plays out well because the trees are so naturally white.9.', '2004-11-17 20:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
