(1018288, 121642, 16800, '<td valign="top">Dazzling!!  I''m a Pittsburgher, and a bridge junkie.</td>', 'Dazzling!!  I''m a Pittsburgher, and a bridge junkie.', '2004-11-17 20:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018291, 121445, 29404, '<td valign="top">very good work ......looooooooooooove it...congratulations on first place from now.......i loose for that one no big deal...good is good</td>', 'very good work ......looooooooooooove it...congratulations on first place from now.......i loose for that one no big deal...good is good', '2004-11-17 20:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018298, 121988, 15811, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot -- great subject and the focus is on.  I don''t know if that shadow on the face helps the image any, but it certainly doesn''t hurt it.  What''s that white shiney thing on the right side 1/3 of the way down?  No matter, still an awesome photo and I only saw that "thing" because I looked at this for so long.<br/> <br/>Defiately makes me stop and think -- you''ll probably get a lot of commenters.</td>', 'This is a great shot -- great subject and the focus is on.  I don''t know if that shadow on the face helps the image any, but it certainly doesn''t hurt it.  What''s that white shiney thing on the right side 1/3 of the way down?  No matter, still an awesome photo and I only saw that "thing" because I looked at this for so long. Defiately makes me stop and think -- you''ll probably get a lot of commenters.', '2004-11-17 20:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018304, 121862, 15811, '<td valign="top">That steering wheel only came on the 1974 -- just kididng.  Nice and simple -- seems the focus is a bit soft on the dashboard and dice though, which might have helped.  Great idea and it''s original.  good job!</td>', 'That steering wheel only came on the 1974 -- just kididng.  Nice and simple -- seems the focus is a bit soft on the dashboard and dice though, which might have helped.  Great idea and it''s original.  good job!', '2004-11-17 20:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018308, 121140, 9602, '<td valign="top">I think you set the contrast to high.</td>', 'I think you set the contrast to high.', '2004-11-17 20:38:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018309, 121557, 25742, '<td valign="top">light a bit too harsh on R of building.</td>', 'light a bit too harsh on R of building.', '2004-11-17 20:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018312, 122170, 15811, '<td valign="top">hrmm -- really good idea.  The sky is a tad blown out and everything''s realy dark below that.  Seems like it just rained and there''s a slight hayse in the air which messes with the lighting a lot, maybe too much for my personal taste.</td>', 'hrmm -- really good idea.  The sky is a tad blown out and everything''s realy dark below that.  Seems like it just rained and there''s a slight hayse in the air which messes with the lighting a lot, maybe too much for my personal taste.', '2004-11-17 20:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018315, 121457, 15811, '<td valign="top">Good photo, but it just seems to be missing something.  Maybe it would be better in color, I don''t know.</td>', 'Good photo, but it just seems to be missing something.  Maybe it would be better in color, I don''t know.', '2004-11-17 20:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018316, 122102, 22384, '<td valign="top">I like this photo. The contrast of the black and white gives me a feeling of the opposites in nature i.e. the good within the evil, the sadness within the joy, the ugly within the beautiful etc... I guess the amazing balance in nature that acts as a foil to enhance its opposite.<br/>This comes to mind perhaps because you chose a swan as your subject. The title of your photo doesn''t indicate that, but that is how this image struck me. Nice job!</td>', 'I like this photo. The contrast of the black and white gives me a feeling of the opposites in nature i.e. the good within the evil, the sadness within the joy, the ugly within the beautiful etc... I guess the amazing balance in nature that acts as a foil to enhance its opposite.This comes to mind perhaps because you chose a swan as your subject. The title of your photo doesn''t indicate that, but that is how this image struck me. Nice job!', '2004-11-17 20:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018318, 121104, 15811, '<td valign="top">I see a lot of blues and a brown leaf.  Sorry, but this doesn''t meet the challenge in my eyes.</td>', 'I see a lot of blues and a brown leaf.  Sorry, but this doesn''t meet the challenge in my eyes.', '2004-11-17 20:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018320, 122155, 22384, '<td valign="top">I am struck by the simple elegance and the graceful lines of this image. You use the entire value scale. I am a fan of contrast and like your use of upping the intensity of contrast in this image. It gives is a ethereal look. Beautiful.</td>', 'I am struck by the simple elegance and the graceful lines of this image. You use the entire value scale. I am a fan of contrast and like your use of upping the intensity of contrast in this image. It gives is a ethereal look. Beautiful.', '2004-11-17 20:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018321, 120848, 15811, '<td valign="top">Very good.  I like the lighting and the subject.  Cute dog.  I think that the only improvement I can think of would be to crop more off at the bottom.  Personally, right where the center part of that circular object is I''d crop it there.  Nice work.</td>', 'Very good.  I like the lighting and the subject.  Cute dog.  I think that the only improvement I can think of would be to crop more off at the bottom.  Personally, right where the center part of that circular object is I''d crop it there.  Nice work.', '2004-11-17 20:45:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018324, 120995, 23141, '<td valign="top">I''m sure everyone will say something along these lines, but I''ll say it too:  Picture looks great, but make it bigger! :)</td>', 'I''m sure everyone will say something along these lines, but I''ll say it too:  Picture looks great, but make it bigger! :)', '2004-11-17 20:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018325, 120727, 14202, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, not to sure ''bout this.  Very grainy (intentional or not), very dark on the model and hard to distinguish...sorry...it doesn''t work for me</td>', 'Hmmm, not to sure ''bout this.  Very grainy (intentional or not), very dark on the model and hard to distinguish...sorry...it doesn''t work for me', '2004-11-17 20:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018326, 122204, 15811, '<td valign="top">I like the image a lot but don''t know if I dig the clutter-looking reflection.  Otherwise, I love the shot and you did a great job.  good comosition.</td>', 'I like the image a lot but don''t know if I dig the clutter-looking reflection.  Otherwise, I love the shot and you did a great job.  good comosition.', '2004-11-17 20:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018328, 121374, 23141, '<td valign="top">Very nice tones and lighting.  Background in the upper left is a bit distracting, and I personally would have preferred more space at the top and bottom.</td>', 'Very nice tones and lighting.  Background in the upper left is a bit distracting, and I personally would have preferred more space at the top and bottom.', '2004-11-17 20:47:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018329, 121993, 15811, '<td valign="top">Focus is off, very uninteresting subject.  The date in the bottom right corner has to go haha.  good try though.</td>', 'Focus is off, very uninteresting subject.  The date in the bottom right corner has to go haha.  good try though.', '2004-11-17 20:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018330, 121525, 15811, '<td valign="top">Kind of small -- too small to tell anything really.</td>', 'Kind of small -- too small to tell anything really.', '2004-11-17 20:48:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018333, 122187, 22384, '<td valign="top">Nice variety of contrasts in this image. It is too staged for my tastes. Anyone this neat would never leave the water running unattended. It just misses that something special. The framing creates a unwelcome tension in me which is incongruent with the subject matter. As individual elements, I really like the smokey cups and the white dental floss. Those images alone and apart could make an amazing photo.<br/></td>', 'Nice variety of contrasts in this image. It is too staged for my tastes. Anyone this neat would never leave the water running unattended. It just misses that something special. The framing creates a unwelcome tension in me which is incongruent with the subject matter. As individual elements, I really like the smokey cups and the white dental floss. Those images alone and apart could make an amazing photo.', '2004-11-17 20:49:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018334, 122011, 15811, '<td valign="top">Very interesting -- looks great in b&amp;w.  Is that a mirror in the back?</td>', 'Very interesting -- looks great in b&w.  Is that a mirror in the back?', '2004-11-17 20:49:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018335, 120473, 14202, '<td valign="top">IMHO...Better with a larger DoF...</td>', 'IMHO...Better with a larger DoF...', '2004-11-17 20:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018336, 120407, 15811, '<td valign="top">crazy -- can''t really make out much.  Good effort and it looks like it took a lot of time.  Unfortunately, doesn''t seem like much of a ''photograph'' even if it is -- looks more like a drawing or painting.</td>', 'crazy -- can''t really make out much.  Good effort and it looks like it took a lot of time.  Unfortunately, doesn''t seem like much of a ''photograph'' even if it is -- looks more like a drawing or painting.', '2004-11-17 20:50:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018340, 121058, 15811, '<td valign="top">good composition</td>', 'good composition', '2004-11-17 20:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018342, 121111, 22384, '<td valign="top">Nice range of values. I don''t have a focal point, and I am unable to pick out an idea, theme, or message. The framing is interesting, I think I would turn the image so it is vertical. I kept turning my head when I looke at it. Maybe that would make the difference.</td>', 'Nice range of values. I don''t have a focal point, and I am unable to pick out an idea, theme, or message. The framing is interesting, I think I would turn the image so it is vertical. I kept turning my head when I looke at it. Maybe that would make the difference.', '2004-11-17 20:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018343, 121744, 23141, '<td valign="top">Good idea and neat execution.  Funny how you left the color.  Slightly distracting shadow in upper right.  Since this image is so perfectly balanced, I wonder how a square format would look.</td>', 'Good idea and neat execution.  Funny how you left the color.  Slightly distracting shadow in upper right.  Since this image is so perfectly balanced, I wonder how a square format would look.', '2004-11-17 20:52:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018347, 121062, 23141, '<td valign="top">Very cool image and interesting lines, though the girl looks like she''s scratching at her face.</td>', 'Very cool image and interesting lines, though the girl looks like she''s scratching at her face.', '2004-11-17 20:53:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018348, 121315, 15811, '<td valign="top">Water always seems to do really good for some reason -- it just eases the eye and gives the viewer something to focus on -- always makes you stop and think.<br/></td>', 'Water always seems to do really good for some reason -- it just eases the eye and gives the viewer something to focus on -- always makes you stop and think.', '2004-11-17 20:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018349, 121929, 26756, '<td valign="top">Underexposed in my opinion.  With this kind of light it doesn''t really give the feeling of winter too much.  Maybe a bit brighter next time.</td>', 'Underexposed in my opinion.  With this kind of light it doesn''t really give the feeling of winter too much.  Maybe a bit brighter next time.', '2004-11-17 20:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018352, 121634, 18834, '<td valign="top">I like how you got just the nose area of the cat completely in focus.  good lighting too.  not to dark, but any brighter and it would change the picture too much.9.</td>', 'I like how you got just the nose area of the cat completely in focus.  good lighting too.  not to dark, but any brighter and it would change the picture too much.9.', '2004-11-17 20:54:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018356, 121546, 22384, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea. I like the idea of lighting one person in what is usually a crowded place, but when the movie is good, you feel like you are the only one in the theater. Your subject is too washed out for me. Since you are highlighting her, I want to be able to see her in more detail. Again, I think this is a genius of an idea. Great brain work thinking it up. I think it has the potential to transcend. I imagine you do some very amazing work or certainly have the potential.</td>', 'Excellent idea. I like the idea of lighting one person in what is usually a crowded place, but when the movie is good, you feel like you are the only one in the theater. Your subject is too washed out for me. Since you are highlighting her, I want to be able to see her in more detail. Again, I think this is a genius of an idea. Great brain work thinking it up. I think it has the potential to transcend. I imagine you do some very amazing work or certainly have the potential.', '2004-11-17 20:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018358, 121914, 26756, '<td valign="top">Looks like an interesting subject and photo, not too hot for the processing.</td>', 'Looks like an interesting subject and photo, not too hot for the processing.', '2004-11-17 20:57:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018359, 122042, 23141, '<td valign="top">Nice tones, great expression, excellent capture of the ball and sand.  Would like to see the head of the club.  Regardless of whether this is an action shot or a posed one, it''s a great image. There are some minor distractions - the white brush strike above the head and some light and dark areas at the top - which you probably couldn''t help with an action shot.</td>', 'Nice tones, great expression, excellent capture of the ball and sand.  Would like to see the head of the club.  Regardless of whether this is an action shot or a posed one, it''s a great image. There are some minor distractions - the white brush strike above the head and some light and dark areas at the top - which you probably couldn''t help with an action shot.', '2004-11-17 20:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018360, 120813, 22384, '<td valign="top">Stunning idea! You lose the beauty of your flower in the lower left hand corner. The lighting is just off for what you intended. The flower in the lower right hand corner is really beautiful. I think it captures best what you were trying to achieve.</td>', 'Stunning idea! You lose the beauty of your flower in the lower left hand corner. The lighting is just off for what you intended. The flower in the lower right hand corner is really beautiful. I think it captures best what you were trying to achieve.', '2004-11-17 20:57:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018364, 121340, 29168, '<td valign="top">Nice subject and pose. She certainly is lovely :) <br/> <br/>Portraiture work is generally accepted as best when the eyes of the subject are in clear(est) focus. I tend to agree. Your photo would also be improved, in my opinion, with the contrast level reduced to enhance the shade gradient across the forehead etc. Otherise, good crop and framing. Well done. 3.</td>', 'Nice subject and pose. She certainly is lovely :)  Portraiture work is generally accepted as best when the eyes of the subject are in clear(est) focus. I tend to agree. Your photo would also be improved, in my opinion, with the contrast level reduced to enhance the shade gradient across the forehead etc. Otherise, good crop and framing. Well done. 3.', '2004-11-17 20:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018367, 122210, 26756, '<td valign="top">Cat photo, yes.  But tack sharp and great expression.</td>', 'Cat photo, yes.  But tack sharp and great expression.', '2004-11-17 21:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018369, 121862, 22384, '<td valign="top">I love the clean lines and the sparkle in the steering wheel and the instruments and knobs on the dash. The dice are a good idea, but don''t work here for me. They overpower the true elegance in this photo. The values in the elements of the car are stunning to me. Although I know what you were going for with the dice, get rid of them, pull back a bit, bring the angle around so the gauges and numbers on the instruments are visible, and crop over cutting the radio in half. See what you think then.</td>', 'I love the clean lines and the sparkle in the steering wheel and the instruments and knobs on the dash. The dice are a good idea, but don''t work here for me. They overpower the true elegance in this photo. The values in the elements of the car are stunning to me. Although I know what you were going for with the dice, get rid of them, pull back a bit, bring the angle around so the gauges and numbers on the instruments are visible, and crop over cutting the radio in half. See what you think then.', '2004-11-17 21:02:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018371, 121984, 14763, '<td valign="top">I like the Angle of the Key.  Good Job</td>', 'I like the Angle of the Key.  Good Job', '2004-11-17 21:02:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018376, 121762, 29168, '<td valign="top">Your camera has an amazing level of clarity for such a low light and long exposure. I feel the focus in this image, whilst highlighting that fact admirably, is of too narrow a field making the foreground a major distratcion. The overall lighting and choice of surface is very good however. 7.</td>', 'Your camera has an amazing level of clarity for such a low light and long exposure. I feel the focus in this image, whilst highlighting that fact admirably, is of too narrow a field making the foreground a major distratcion. The overall lighting and choice of surface is very good however. 7.', '2004-11-17 21:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018378, 121680, 29168, '<td valign="top">Simply 9. Nice.</td>', 'Simply 9. Nice.', '2004-11-17 21:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018380, 120606, 27842, '<td valign="top">Nice play of light.  Her skin looks like silk.</td>', 'Nice play of light.  Her skin looks like silk.', '2004-11-17 21:06:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018381, 121330, 23141, '<td valign="top">Ack!  I bet that kind of window would be a ''pane'' to replace, too!  How would this image have looked if you''d shot straight on (avoiding your reflection, of course) and only shown these four blocks, nothing else?</td>', 'Ack!  I bet that kind of window would be a ''pane'' to replace, too!  How would this image have looked if you''d shot straight on (avoiding your reflection, of course) and only shown these four blocks, nothing else?', '2004-11-17 21:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018382, 121586, 27842, '<td valign="top">Nice, but the light on the chest seems a little harsh.</td>', 'Nice, but the light on the chest seems a little harsh.', '2004-11-17 21:07:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018384, 121781, 13610, '<td valign="top">a lot of point for a unusual and courageous composition. Still the shot doesn''t seem of high quality not really having a clear point of focus. (6)</td>', 'a lot of point for a unusual and courageous composition. Still the shot doesn''t seem of high quality not really having a clear point of focus. (6)', '2004-11-17 21:08:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018385, 121586, 29168, '<td valign="top">Lovely pose and a rare opportunity. Great angle and framing. I felt the contrast was little too high washing out shades on the chest and near shoulder areas. (This would look softer on a CRT monitor.) 8. Good luck!</td>', 'Lovely pose and a rare opportunity. Great angle and framing. I felt the contrast was little too high washing out shades on the chest and near shoulder areas. (This would look softer on a CRT monitor.) 8. Good luck!', '2004-11-17 21:08:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018387, 122204, 14763, '<td valign="top">Wow great capture.  Love the reflection</td>', 'Wow great capture.  Love the reflection', '2004-11-17 21:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018389, 120675, 23141, '<td valign="top">Not sure what it is, but it makes for a neat piece of art!  Points off for that spot on the bottom of the image, though.</td>', 'Not sure what it is, but it makes for a neat piece of art!  Points off for that spot on the bottom of the image, though.', '2004-11-17 21:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018391, 120801, 27842, '<td valign="top">Although I think it was intentional,  this would have been better with softer tones (lower exposure).</td>', 'Although I think it was intentional,  this would have been better with softer tones (lower exposure).', '2004-11-17 21:10:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018392, 120727, 22384, '<td valign="top">The grain muddies this picture too much. I am unsure what your subject is doing. I seems to have his hand out, but I am unsure if he is reaching for me or pushing me away. I am unable to see his facial expression to judge from theat either. Great idea, though. Change the angle and clean this up and you could really have a powerful image.</td>', 'The grain muddies this picture too much. I am unsure what your subject is doing. I seems to have his hand out, but I am unsure if he is reaching for me or pushing me away. I am unable to see his facial expression to judge from theat either. Great idea, though. Change the angle and clean this up and you could really have a powerful image.', '2004-11-17 21:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018394, 121767, 15242, '<td valign="top">Too small and too hard to see</td>', 'Too small and too hard to see', '2004-11-17 21:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018395, 122156, 9668, '<td valign="top">Cool perspective and compositions. Networking hub and background objects are distracting.</td>', 'Cool perspective and compositions. Networking hub and background objects are distracting.', '2004-11-17 21:10:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018397, 121183, 6097, '<td valign="top">Simply Awesome!!!   I gave it a 10.</td>', 'Simply Awesome!!!   I gave it a 10.', '2004-11-17 21:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018399, 122074, 23141, '<td valign="top">Neat idea and nice lighting, but out of focus.</td>', 'Neat idea and nice lighting, but out of focus.', '2004-11-17 21:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018401, 122041, 27842, '<td valign="top">Shadow makes for nice composition.  Nice action..</td>', 'Shadow makes for nice composition.  Nice action..', '2004-11-17 21:11:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018402, 120601, 9668, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot (I love scenic shots like this), I''m wondering if you tried a slow shutter speed shot on this one, but still looks good with this. Composition seems a little heavy of the left.</td>', 'Lovely shot (I love scenic shots like this), I''m wondering if you tried a slow shutter speed shot on this one, but still looks good with this. Composition seems a little heavy of the left.', '2004-11-17 21:12:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018403, 121764, 22384, '<td valign="top">Nice image! The crispness of your subject, the emotive expression, the framing, and the angle of the lighting all work very well. Bravo. Great Photo!</td>', 'Nice image! The crispness of your subject, the emotive expression, the framing, and the angle of the lighting all work very well. Bravo. Great Photo!', '2004-11-17 21:12:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018404, 121767, 29513, '<td valign="top">I like the starkness of this shot in B&amp;W.  I see a lot of train shots and usually the bright colors are distracting.</td>', 'I like the starkness of this shot in B&W.  I see a lot of train shots and usually the bright colors are distracting.', '2004-11-17 21:12:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018406, 121654, 23141, '<td valign="top">Such a great idea and an awesome perspective, but not in focus.</td>', 'Such a great idea and an awesome perspective, but not in focus.', '2004-11-17 21:12:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018407, 121734, 9668, '<td valign="top">Awsome perpective, I think I like it side ways. Cool shot.</td>', 'Awsome perpective, I think I like it side ways. Cool shot.', '2004-11-17 21:13:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018408, 122016, 27842, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast and depth</td>', 'Nice contrast and depth', '2004-11-17 21:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018409, 121184, 15242, '<td valign="top">Needs sharpening and the telephone lines make it look very cluttered</td>', 'Needs sharpening and the telephone lines make it look very cluttered', '2004-11-17 21:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018410, 121504, 9668, '<td valign="top">Lovely autumn image. Dock leads the eye well.</td>', 'Lovely autumn image. Dock leads the eye well.', '2004-11-17 21:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018412, 121544, 27842, '<td valign="top">Nice nightime shot. I like the formal symetry.  It works well for this subject.</td>', 'Nice nightime shot. I like the formal symetry.  It works well for this subject.', '2004-11-17 21:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018413, 121481, 29168, '<td valign="top">Good shade and framing. Butit''s just way to dark for me. Not sure I understand the title either (but that doesn''t really count.) If lightened, yo might need to reduce contrast slightly to keep the far leg in the "gray zone".  Did you have your computer screen turned up high brightness in low light perhaps? it''s so easy to do with black and white images. What a shame. 6.</td>', 'Good shade and framing. Butit''s just way to dark for me. Not sure I understand the title either (but that doesn''t really count.) If lightened, yo might need to reduce contrast slightly to keep the far leg in the "gray zone".  Did you have your computer screen turned up high brightness in low light perhaps? it''s so easy to do with black and white images. What a shame. 6.', '2004-11-17 21:14:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018414, 121689, 28359, '<td valign="top">Nice!</td>', 'Nice!', '2004-11-17 21:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018415, 122000, 9668, '<td valign="top">I''m not quite sure what this is. Composition is good, although the thing sticking out to the left is a bit distracting.</td>', 'I''m not quite sure what this is. Composition is good, although the thing sticking out to the left is a bit distracting.', '2004-11-17 21:15:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018416, 121493, 22384, '<td valign="top">Nice subtle variation on the motif with the dark arch. Really elegant and a great study in the power of contrast. Although the arches move down, I get the feeling of upward movement. Again, that contrast makes what could have been just an average photo, a very good photo.</td>', 'Nice subtle variation on the motif with the dark arch. Really elegant and a great study in the power of contrast. Although the arches move down, I get the feeling of upward movement. Again, that contrast makes what could have been just an average photo, a very good photo.', '2004-11-17 21:15:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018417, 121973, 23141, '<td valign="top">I like this image very much, but the shot through the wreath doesn''t do it for me.  It would have been more powerful, I think, without the wreath obscuring the child and the names on the wall.  (Would be better too if names were easier to see).  But such a powerful idea!</td>', 'I like this image very much, but the shot through the wreath doesn''t do it for me.  It would have been more powerful, I think, without the wreath obscuring the child and the names on the wall.  (Would be better too if names were easier to see).  But such a powerful idea!', '2004-11-17 21:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018418, 122039, 9668, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is quite stunning. Of death and decay, you''ve done well with this one.</td>', 'Wow, this is quite stunning. Of death and decay, you''ve done well with this one.', '2004-11-17 21:15:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018419, 121466, 27842, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting</td>', 'Nice lighting', '2004-11-17 21:16:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018421, 121159, 27842, '<td valign="top">Nice composition</td>', 'Nice composition', '2004-11-17 21:16:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018424, 121060, 29513, '<td valign="top">I really like the contrasting textures.  And the translucent quality of the skin.</td>', 'I really like the contrasting textures.  And the translucent quality of the skin.', '2004-11-17 21:17:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018425, 121389, 28359, '<td valign="top">Nice!</td>', 'Nice!', '2004-11-17 21:17:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018427, 120581, 9668, '<td valign="top">Don''t quiet understand your title. Believe life is good? Believe in God? Believe is a good word though. I like the clouds in this shot but the bridge and power lines distract me.</td>', 'Don''t quiet understand your title. Believe life is good? Believe in God? Believe is a good word though. I like the clouds in this shot but the bridge and power lines distract me.', '2004-11-17 21:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018428, 122039, 27842, '<td valign="top">Very creative and well shot. Has a real emotional, kind of depressing feel.  8</td>', 'Very creative and well shot. Has a real emotional, kind of depressing feel.  8', '2004-11-17 21:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018429, 121680, 22384, '<td valign="top">These utilitarian images are a good idea. With the clock image, I tend to think of time passing so I want the image to be way over to the left in the frame instead of the right. I want the wall to be crisp and white to make the dark images stand out. Nice concept, though. Keep working the idea.</td>', 'These utilitarian images are a good idea. With the clock image, I tend to think of time passing so I want the image to be way over to the left in the frame instead of the right. I want the wall to be crisp and white to make the dark images stand out. Nice concept, though. Keep working the idea.', '2004-11-17 21:18:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018430, 121063, 9668, '<td valign="top">Would like to see the rest of her feet. Simple, subtle image. Well done.</td>', 'Would like to see the rest of her feet. Simple, subtle image. Well done.', '2004-11-17 21:18:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018431, 122059, 29168, '<td valign="top">I feel the focus should have been most clear on the hands and book. Adjusting contrast down to bring the short shadow to the left alittle (of image) and also decrease the brilliance of the light just under the book might have also improved this image. 6. Good lcuk.</td>', 'I feel the focus should have been most clear on the hands and book. Adjusting contrast down to bring the short shadow to the left alittle (of image) and also decrease the brilliance of the light just under the book might have also improved this image. 6. Good lcuk.', '2004-11-17 21:18:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018432, 121781, 9668, '<td valign="top">Nice framing, it''s so close to center that I''m wondering why it isn''t dead center. Looks like a dreary day.</td>', 'Nice framing, it''s so close to center that I''m wondering why it isn''t dead center. Looks like a dreary day.', '2004-11-17 21:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018433, 120916, 27842, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition emphasizes the height of the mountain.</td>', 'Excellent composition emphasizes the height of the mountain.', '2004-11-17 21:19:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018434, 121862, 27842, '<td valign="top">Nice retro feel</td>', 'Nice retro feel', '2004-11-17 21:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018436, 121646, 28359, '<td valign="top">Nice, I would''ve cropped just above the cross.</td>', 'Nice, I would''ve cropped just above the cross.', '2004-11-17 21:19:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018437, 121260, 23141, '<td valign="top">Might have been great contrasts and textures, but the image is too small and the (carpet?) is too bright to really appreciate your subject.  Setup looks a bit contrived.  Lighting from only the on-camera flash makes the picture look flat and dull.  Some side lights would show off the interesting textures better.  Hope that helps for your next challenge.</td>', 'Might have been great contrasts and textures, but the image is too small and the (carpet?) is too bright to really appreciate your subject.  Setup looks a bit contrived.  Lighting from only the on-camera flash makes the picture look flat and dull.  Some side lights would show off the interesting textures better.  Hope that helps for your next challenge.', '2004-11-17 21:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018438, 121889, 28359, '<td valign="top">Nice!</td>', 'Nice!', '2004-11-17 21:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018439, 122009, 15242, '<td valign="top">Not interesting or atractive and I don''t think B&amp;W makes it a better shot.</td>', 'Not interesting or atractive and I don''t think B&W makes it a better shot.', '2004-11-17 21:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018440, 120476, 27842, '<td valign="top">The transparency of the fruit is nicely captured.</td>', 'The transparency of the fruit is nicely captured.', '2004-11-17 21:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018441, 120762, 9668, '<td valign="top">This is horrible, all blurry and fuzzy. I just don''t know why you took this! (kidding)<br/>Actually, I think:<br/>This is a fresh image. Lovely use of motion and blur, but not overused to an extreme where the image is unrecognizable. Lighting is lovely. Great job.</td>', 'This is horrible, all blurry and fuzzy. I just don''t know why you took this! (kidding)Actually, I think:This is a fresh image. Lovely use of motion and blur, but not overused to an extreme where the image is unrecognizable. Lighting is lovely. Great job.', '2004-11-17 21:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018443, 120374, 27842, '<td valign="top">Looks a little flat. Could use more shadow in the background perhaps.</td>', 'Looks a little flat. Could use more shadow in the background perhaps.', '2004-11-17 21:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018444, 122020, 22384, '<td valign="top">What a stunning image. Great angle. Captivating! I love the dark images in the foreground and the brilliantly lit images behind them. Outstanding job!</td>', 'What a stunning image. Great angle. Captivating! I love the dark images in the foreground and the brilliantly lit images behind them. Outstanding job!', '2004-11-17 21:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018445, 121259, 23141, '<td valign="top">Not B&amp;W or a palette of grays.  Cute dog, but highlights are overexposed.</td>', 'Not B&W or a palette of grays.  Cute dog, but highlights are overexposed.', '2004-11-17 21:22:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018446, 122142, 29168, '<td valign="top">INteresting composition. I generally like this, but feel the brightness is too low and the contrast too high. On my screen the chin is almost completely lost in the dark creating a "stare zone" distraction. (The brain wants to see what it can not quite see. Well mine does anyhow :) Still, I like the composition and camera angle etc dso much I''m giving you a 7. Good luck! (Might be the Scotsman in me deep down somewhere! &lt;grin&gt;)</td>', 'INteresting composition. I generally like this, but feel the brightness is too low and the contrast too high. On my screen the chin is almost completely lost in the dark creating a "stare zone" distraction. (The brain wants to see what it can not quite see. Well mine does anyhow :) Still, I like the composition and camera angle etc dso much I''m giving you a 7. Good luck! (Might be the Scotsman in me deep down somewhere! <grin>)', '2004-11-17 21:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018447, 122058, 27842, '<td valign="top">Nice backlighting from (the sun?)</td>', 'Nice backlighting from (the sun?)', '2004-11-17 21:22:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018448, 120542, 9668, '<td valign="top">Maybe it''s just me, but I don''t know what BWB is. Awsome capture, nice mirroring,  great technical. 9 in my book.</td>', 'Maybe it''s just me, but I don''t know what BWB is. Awsome capture, nice mirroring,  great technical. 9 in my book.', '2004-11-17 21:22:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018451, 120900, 18191, '<td valign="top">Very dark and sultry lighting here. The low key effect fits perfectly with the mood of the photograph. The model''s pose is very stern and almost hesitant --- he looks pretty goo dto me. Good texture in the folded jacket as well. Nice work. 10.</td>', 'Very dark and sultry lighting here. The low key effect fits perfectly with the mood of the photograph. The model''s pose is very stern and almost hesitant --- he looks pretty goo dto me. Good texture in the folded jacket as well. Nice work. 10.', '2004-11-17 21:23:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018452, 121588, 9668, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of this sillhoutte. Background is a bit distracting. Great posture.</td>', 'I like the idea of this sillhoutte. Background is a bit distracting. Great posture.', '2004-11-17 21:23:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018454, 122070, 28359, '<td valign="top">Classic</td>', 'Classic', '2004-11-17 21:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018455, 121955, 15242, '<td valign="top">Too dark, needs more contrast.</td>', 'Too dark, needs more contrast.', '2004-11-17 21:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018456, 121240, 24413, '<td valign="top">Great facial expression!</td>', 'Great facial expression!', '2004-11-17 21:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018457, 120615, 9668, '<td valign="top">Wow, thes looked like Christmas lights at first. Love the composition on this one.</td>', 'Wow, thes looked like Christmas lights at first. Love the composition on this one.', '2004-11-17 21:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018458, 121637, 28359, '<td valign="top">Nice!</td>', 'Nice!', '2004-11-17 21:24:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018459, 121442, 27842, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2004-11-17 21:24:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018460, 120827, 15242, '<td valign="top">Not sure what I''m looking at?  Nice texture though.</td>', 'Not sure what I''m looking at?  Nice texture though.', '2004-11-17 21:24:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018462, 120384, 9668, '<td valign="top">Don''t quiet get it, sorry. Funny pose, shoe definatly stands out as a focal point.</td>', 'Don''t quiet get it, sorry. Funny pose, shoe definatly stands out as a focal point.', '2004-11-17 21:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018463, 122151, 26756, '<td valign="top">Beatufiul landscape shot.  Lots of character.  I like the road leading your eye from the foreground to the main subject.  Nice shot.</td>', 'Beatufiul landscape shot.  Lots of character.  I like the road leading your eye from the foreground to the main subject.  Nice shot.', '2004-11-17 21:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018464, 121623, 15242, '<td valign="top">Not a real interesting still life, and the white spot is distracting.</td>', 'Not a real interesting still life, and the white spot is distracting.', '2004-11-17 21:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018465, 121608, 27842, '<td valign="top">Excellent tonality and composition.  One of my favorites so far.</td>', 'Excellent tonality and composition.  One of my favorites so far.', '2004-11-17 21:26:30.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1018467, 122168, 15242, '<td valign="top">Nice shot for black and white.</td>', 'Nice shot for black and white.', '2004-11-17 21:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018469, 120629, 27842, '<td valign="top">Very well done.  Could use a little more light to define the form of the hand.</td>', 'Very well done.  Could use a little more light to define the form of the hand.', '2004-11-17 21:28:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018472, 121269, 15242, '<td valign="top">Crappy title, but I really like the photo and it works well in B&amp;W</td>', 'Crappy title, but I really like the photo and it works well in B&W', '2004-11-17 21:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018473, 121507, 9602, '<td valign="top">your subject seems to unnatural</td>', 'your subject seems to unnatural', '2004-11-17 21:29:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018474, 120366, 27842, '<td valign="top">The eyes look blue, or is it my imagination?</td>', 'The eyes look blue, or is it my imagination?', '2004-11-17 21:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018475, 121389, 29168, '<td valign="top">Perfect light, contrast. Perfect horizon angle (very important to me). Excellent ablance. I love this shot. 10. Well done and good luck!</td>', 'Perfect light, contrast. Perfect horizon angle (very important to me). Excellent ablance. I love this shot. 10. Well done and good luck!', '2004-11-17 21:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018476, 121481, 9602, '<td valign="top">I like the total look, I would suggest that you have your model get undressed a bit before the shoot, to allow for underwear lines to dissapear.</td>', 'I like the total look, I would suggest that you have your model get undressed a bit before the shoot, to allow for underwear lines to dissapear.', '2004-11-17 21:30:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018478, 121963, 27842, '<td valign="top">Nice symetry</td>', 'Nice symetry', '2004-11-17 21:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018479, 120852, 26756, '<td valign="top">Love that tire and the lighting of the shot. Crop is great too.  Border is a bit massive, I think I would have like to have seen that crop but larger, less border.  Interesting subject and camera angle.</td>', 'Love that tire and the lighting of the shot. Crop is great too.  Border is a bit massive, I think I would have like to have seen that crop but larger, less border.  Interesting subject and camera angle.', '2004-11-17 21:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018480, 121111, 27842, '<td valign="top">Very artistic.  Makes me curious if there is something like makeup or paint on the foot.</td>', 'Very artistic.  Makes me curious if there is something like makeup or paint on the foot.', '2004-11-17 21:32:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018481, 121374, 28359, '<td valign="top">Nice!</td>', 'Nice!', '2004-11-17 21:32:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018484, 122116, 22384, '<td valign="top">A little too much foreground in this beautiful image. Cut some of it so the the lake is more a complement to the mountain.</td>', 'A little too much foreground in this beautiful image. Cut some of it so the the lake is more a complement to the mountain.', '2004-11-17 21:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018485, 121631, 28359, '<td valign="top">Really like the shot. Nice!</td>', 'Really like the shot. Nice!', '2004-11-17 21:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018487, 120415, 23141, '<td valign="top">Such a very moody yet lovely picture.  I like it very much...  Would love to mark this higher but I''m one of those anal folks who''s voting low on images that are not strictly B&amp;W.</td>', 'Such a very moody yet lovely picture.  I like it very much...  Would love to mark this higher but I''m one of those anal folks who''s voting low on images that are not strictly B&W.', '2004-11-17 21:33:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018489, 122010, 28359, '<td valign="top">Nice</td>', 'Nice', '2004-11-17 21:33:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018490, 120995, 15242, '<td valign="top">Too small, and using the rule of thirds would have greatly improved the composition.</td>', 'Too small, and using the rule of thirds would have greatly improved the composition.', '2004-11-17 21:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018491, 121529, 29168, '<td valign="top">Great family shot! Unfortunately the high brightness and possibly compensated contrast is washing out  the girls arm and he face. With those aspects improved I''d have given this a nine, at least. For now, a 7. Good luck!</td>', 'Great family shot! Unfortunately the high brightness and possibly compensated contrast is washing out  the girls arm and he face. With those aspects improved I''d have given this a nine, at least. For now, a 7. Good luck!', '2004-11-17 21:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018492, 121635, 22384, '<td valign="top">I like the fact that you took a risk with this photo, but the image is too confusing for me, too centered. The rope leading to the anchor is and interesting element.</td>', 'I like the fact that you took a risk with this photo, but the image is too confusing for me, too centered. The rope leading to the anchor is and interesting element.', '2004-11-17 21:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018494, 120678, 29168, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition. Was it planned? The grain is great. This must have been posed to get such a clear shot at low loght levels. Well done! 8.</td>', 'Excellent composition. Was it planned? The grain is great. This must have been posed to get such a clear shot at low loght levels. Well done! 8.', '2004-11-17 21:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018496, 121487, 28359, '<td valign="top">Nice Shot!</td>', 'Nice Shot!', '2004-11-17 21:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018498, 121734, 28359, '<td valign="top">I like the angle, nice shot.</td>', 'I like the angle, nice shot.', '2004-11-17 21:38:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018503, 121049, 22384, '<td valign="top">Nice use of the diamond/square motif. This is certainly beyond your control, but the fact that the wires are not perfectly straight bothers me. The idea is brilliant because of the subject matter in the background. The tunnel of light hinting at escape and the world beyond works very well. This images takes some work on the part of the viewer in the sense that it is almost interactive. I see more elements each time I look at it, yet it isn''t cluttered. It might be easily overlooked by voters who are in a rush or unwilling to make an effort with a photo. I think it works just as well as an image that is immediately striking, if not better. Really nice work.</td>', 'Nice use of the diamond/square motif. This is certainly beyond your control, but the fact that the wires are not perfectly straight bothers me. The idea is brilliant because of the subject matter in the background. The tunnel of light hinting at escape and the world beyond works very well. This images takes some work on the part of the viewer in the sense that it is almost interactive. I see more elements each time I look at it, yet it isn''t cluttered. It might be easily overlooked by voters who are in a rush or unwilling to make an effort with a photo. I think it works just as well as an image that is immediately striking, if not better. Really nice work.', '2004-11-17 21:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018507, 121496, 23141, '<td valign="top">So very cool - an awesome picture.  Would like to see it in B&amp;W instead of the browntone.</td>', 'So very cool - an awesome picture.  Would like to see it in B&W instead of the browntone.', '2004-11-17 21:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018512, 121844, 28359, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, If you could''ve gotten a little more reflection of the nose and eye, would ''ve be great. I like anyway!</td>', 'Nice shot, If you could''ve gotten a little more reflection of the nose and eye, would ''ve be great. I like anyway!', '2004-11-17 21:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018513, 120647, 22384, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love this image. The hopefulness of having the flower face to the right, the water drops which symbolized the tears of healing for me. The values in the flower and the crispness of the petals are superb. I would crop the right edge in toward the flower a bit more so there is a feeling the moving beyond the pain is more within reach, but that is just a petty little comment. Outstanding work. Thanks for sharing it.</td>', 'I absolutely love this image. The hopefulness of having the flower face to the right, the water drops which symbolized the tears of healing for me. The values in the flower and the crispness of the petals are superb. I would crop the right edge in toward the flower a bit more so there is a feeling the moving beyond the pain is more within reach, but that is just a petty little comment. Outstanding work. Thanks for sharing it.', '2004-11-17 21:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018514, 121457, 23141, '<td valign="top">I love this view, but not the (trees? sticks?) in the foreground or the plane trails in the sky.  You may think I''m silly, but I think this would be a wonderfully serene photo if it were cropped very narrow to just the large hill in the foreground and the layers of misty hills - very little sky (just before the vapor trails start) and no trees.</td>', 'I love this view, but not the (trees? sticks?) in the foreground or the plane trails in the sky.  You may think I''m silly, but I think this would be a wonderfully serene photo if it were cropped very narrow to just the large hill in the foreground and the layers of misty hills - very little sky (just before the vapor trails start) and no trees.', '2004-11-17 21:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018515, 122184, 15242, '<td valign="top">I''m thinking this would look better in color?</td>', 'I''m thinking this would look better in color?', '2004-11-17 21:47:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018518, 121912, 15242, '<td valign="top">Not very B&amp;W in my book</td>', 'Not very B&W in my book', '2004-11-17 21:50:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018520, 121544, 28359, '<td valign="top">Nice!</td>', 'Nice!', '2004-11-17 21:51:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018521, 121525, 15242, '<td valign="top">Wayyy to small</td>', 'Wayyy to small', '2004-11-17 21:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018524, 121443, 25183, '<td valign="top">Seems slightly out of focus...I can''t quite put my finger on it.  It''s distracting.</td>', 'Seems slightly out of focus...I can''t quite put my finger on it.  It''s distracting.', '2004-11-17 21:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018525, 121629, 15242, '<td valign="top">Great subject, but I think there might be some better photos to be taken here.</td>', 'Great subject, but I think there might be some better photos to be taken here.', '2004-11-17 21:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
