(1018535, 120663, 15242, '<td valign="top">Cute moment but the shot is off.  I''m not sure if it''s out of focus of the shutter speed was too low and the chicken moved?</td>', 'Cute moment but the shot is off.  I''m not sure if it''s out of focus of the shutter speed was too low and the chicken moved?', '2004-11-17 21:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
