(1018562, 120407, 25183, '<td valign="top">I struggle with abstracts in black and white.  I dislike when I can''t make out what I''m looking at...arrggh!  I won''t knock you for it though.  I do like the overall look and it does keep my attention.</td>', 'I struggle with abstracts in black and white.  I dislike when I can''t make out what I''m looking at...arrggh!  I won''t knock you for it though.  I do like the overall look and it does keep my attention.', '2004-11-17 22:03:38.000000', NULL, 1),
