(1018576, 121009, 25183, '<td valign="top">I like the shadow of the lampost and the white lines of the bars against the darker window, but the face of the model is a bit washed out by the light source.  It is the only thing that disappoints me here.  Otherwise...nice!  One more think...I would have cropped out the roof.  It changes where my eyes are drawn completely.  I am viewing the picture now with the image cust off just above the models head. It is find this way for me....add that roof, it gets a bit busy!</td>', 'I like the shadow of the lampost and the white lines of the bars against the darker window, but the face of the model is a bit washed out by the light source.  It is the only thing that disappoints me here.  Otherwise...nice!  One more think...I would have cropped out the roof.  It changes where my eyes are drawn completely.  I am viewing the picture now with the image cust off just above the models head. It is find this way for me....add that roof, it gets a bit busy!', '2004-11-17 22:08:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018578, 120750, 27574, '<td valign="top">Wow...high scores for this one, for sure.  Wish you had left a bit more dark area on the bottom (pun intended, lol) of the photo...in other words I think it is cropped too close on the bottom (lol) oh well, you get the picture...................LOL!</td>', 'Wow...high scores for this one, for sure.  Wish you had left a bit more dark area on the bottom (pun intended, lol) of the photo...in other words I think it is cropped too close on the bottom (lol) oh well, you get the picture...................LOL!', '2004-11-17 22:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
