(1018636, 121206, 12253, '<td valign="top">Good tones, and good lines.  The one thing that doesn''t work for me is the framing in the askew (because of angle) doorway and the large amount of negative space relative to the geometric pattern presented.</td>', 'Good tones, and good lines.  The one thing that doesn''t work for me is the framing in the askew (because of angle) doorway and the large amount of negative space relative to the geometric pattern presented.', '2004-11-17 22:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018639, 121644, 12253, '<td valign="top">Love the background here; good crisp photo with good exposure.  As funny as a rude gesture can be, but perhaps funnier because of the twisted literalism.  But I hate to tell you--forks do not have a middle finger (or prong).  You needed to find a 5 toothed fork. :)</td>', 'Love the background here; good crisp photo with good exposure.  As funny as a rude gesture can be, but perhaps funnier because of the twisted literalism.  But I hate to tell you--forks do not have a middle finger (or prong).  You needed to find a 5 toothed fork. :)', '2004-11-17 22:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
