(1018689, 122151, 12253, '<td valign="top">Very nice landscape.  I like the way the rode leads into the shot, and with such interesting curves.   On the other hand, this is more difficult to appreciate in black and white because of the strong contrasts on the land and the sky make it appear very "busy".<br/> <br/>Also, either the landscape is pitched right, or the camera was inadvertently tilted.</td>', 'Very nice landscape.  I like the way the rode leads into the shot, and with such interesting curves.   On the other hand, this is more difficult to appreciate in black and white because of the strong contrasts on the land and the sky make it appear very "busy". Also, either the landscape is pitched right, or the camera was inadvertently tilted.', '2004-11-17 23:03:49.000000', NULL, 1),
