(1018691, 122046, 22384, '<td valign="top">The aninmation on the subject''s face truly makes this photo.The trick of rotating your image to give the illusion that she is suspended joyfully in the air adds the perfect complement to her expression. Great fun!</td>', 'The aninmation on the subject''s face truly makes this photo.The trick of rotating your image to give the illusion that she is suspended joyfully in the air adds the perfect complement to her expression. Great fun!', '2004-11-17 23:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
