(1018720, 122137, 9668, '<td valign="top">Cool angle to see the sunset and the frozen dome, but also the inclusion of it seems kindof random. Sunset looks cool.</td>', 'Cool angle to see the sunset and the frozen dome, but also the inclusion of it seems kindof random. Sunset looks cool.', '2004-11-17 23:14:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018721, 121240, 27842, '<td valign="top">Nice emotion but the harsh shadows are distracting</td>', 'Nice emotion but the harsh shadows are distracting', '2004-11-17 23:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018722, 120983, 27293, '<td valign="top">What about it?</td>', 'What about it?', '2004-11-17 23:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018723, 120819, 9668, '<td valign="top">I like the light patterns upon the illuminated background. Cool sillhoutte, but I wish I could see most of it or not of it.</td>', 'I like the light patterns upon the illuminated background. Cool sillhoutte, but I wish I could see most of it or not of it.', '2004-11-17 23:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018724, 121158, 27842, '<td valign="top">I think this would have been even better if you included the head in the composition.</td>', 'I think this would have been even better if you included the head in the composition.', '2004-11-17 23:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018726, 121633, 22384, '<td valign="top">Your focal point, indicated by the title, is competing with too many other things. You  have some great individual elements in this photo. All offer some excellent opportunities. I love the fact that you shot this from behind. I think the two gentlemen, shot from the same angle but framed to include both men would be a great shot. There is an excellent range of values and an interesting lighting angle in those two subjects.</td>', 'Your focal point, indicated by the title, is competing with too many other things. You  have some great individual elements in this photo. All offer some excellent opportunities. I love the fact that you shot this from behind. I think the two gentlemen, shot from the same angle but framed to include both men would be a great shot. There is an excellent range of values and an interesting lighting angle in those two subjects.', '2004-11-17 23:16:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018727, 121442, 9668, '<td valign="top">Sunlight seems a little bright in this shot. I like the posture and inquery presented by your "model." I wish that he wasn''t blurred though.</td>', 'Sunlight seems a little bright in this shot. I like the posture and inquery presented by your "model." I wish that he wasn''t blurred though.', '2004-11-17 23:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018728, 120908, 27293, '<td valign="top">this is probably the most non creative shot of the 600.</td>', 'this is probably the most non creative shot of the 600.', '2004-11-17 23:17:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018729, 121997, 12253, '<td valign="top">I''m curious what those dust spots can be.  Normally SLR dust spots are black.  So what are these?  Dead pixels?  Unfortunately, it''s going to be hard to do well in a non-editing challenge with these.  But the photo is nice, albeit a bit grainy and soft.</td>', 'I''m curious what those dust spots can be.  Normally SLR dust spots are black.  So what are these?  Dead pixels?  Unfortunately, it''s going to be hard to do well in a non-editing challenge with these.  But the photo is nice, albeit a bit grainy and soft.', '2004-11-17 23:17:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018731, 122030, 9668, '<td valign="top">Funny expression! I may have cropped this to a full fill-the-frame.</td>', 'Funny expression! I may have cropped this to a full fill-the-frame.', '2004-11-17 23:17:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018732, 120725, 27842, '<td valign="top">Very creative capture</td>', 'Very creative capture', '2004-11-17 23:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018734, 120812, 15811, '<td valign="top">hrmm i recognize the model but can''t link her to a specific photographer.  Nice work -- b&amp;w photography forces you to do different things with lighting when shooting people to produce good effects, which you''ve done here nicely.  Good composition as well.  great shot!</td>', 'hrmm i recognize the model but can''t link her to a specific photographer.  Nice work -- b&w photography forces you to do different things with lighting when shooting people to produce good effects, which you''ve done here nicely.  Good composition as well.  great shot!', '2004-11-17 23:17:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018735, 120995, 15811, '<td valign="top">good subject, but it''s pretty small.</td>', 'good subject, but it''s pretty small.', '2004-11-17 23:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018736, 121303, 9668, '<td valign="top">The fence in the foreground seems a bit distracting, title makes sense, but the photo doesn''t stand out to me. Just seems like a candid of a cemetary, not something new that makes me think.</td>', 'The fence in the foreground seems a bit distracting, title makes sense, but the photo doesn''t stand out to me. Just seems like a candid of a cemetary, not something new that makes me think.', '2004-11-17 23:18:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018737, 121649, 27842, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition and great tonality</td>', 'Excellent composition and great tonality', '2004-11-17 23:20:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018738, 121639, 27293, '<td valign="top">Oh.. with those magnificent trees and the fog and the lady, it could have been so much more creative and original and artistic and perfect for b/w... but this, unfortunately, looks like another home style snapshot kinda deal :(</td>', 'Oh.. with those magnificent trees and the fog and the lady, it could have been so much more creative and original and artistic and perfect for b/w... but this, unfortunately, looks like another home style snapshot kinda deal :(', '2004-11-17 23:20:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018739, 122124, 9668, '<td valign="top">I like this angle and concept behind it. Lighting is peculiar, but new. Nice texture, but a tad out of focus.</td>', 'I like this angle and concept behind it. Lighting is peculiar, but new. Nice texture, but a tad out of focus.', '2004-11-17 23:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018740, 121206, 22384, '<td valign="top">Rather than making me feel that this is a path leading somewhere, I feel trapped and boxed in by this piece. My eye goes directly to the corner on the near side of the arch. The tension created is suffocating rather than liberating.</td>', 'Rather than making me feel that this is a path leading somewhere, I feel trapped and boxed in by this piece. My eye goes directly to the corner on the near side of the arch. The tension created is suffocating rather than liberating.', '2004-11-17 23:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018741, 121913, 27293, '<td valign="top">boring</td>', 'boring', '2004-11-17 23:20:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018744, 120737, 9668, '<td valign="top">Ah, yes. The eye speaketh best, but you have hidden it. Exceptional composition.</td>', 'Ah, yes. The eye speaketh best, but you have hidden it. Exceptional composition.', '2004-11-17 23:21:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018745, 120852, 27293, '<td valign="top">10 10 10! I knew i wasn''t looking at these in vain! Thank you thank you!</td>', '10 10 10! I knew i wasn''t looking at these in vain! Thank you thank you!', '2004-11-17 23:21:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018747, 121459, 9668, '<td valign="top">Wow, lovely angle of this beautiful bridge. I like the subtle reflections off the sand. The wave coming in perfects it. 10</td>', 'Wow, lovely angle of this beautiful bridge. I like the subtle reflections off the sand. The wave coming in perfects it. 10', '2004-11-17 23:22:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018748, 122031, 22384, '<td valign="top">I like the element in the foreground of this photo very much. I would crop it so it is that element which fills the frame. The values are outstanding. Nice job.</td>', 'I like the element in the foreground of this photo very much. I would crop it so it is that element which fills the frame. The values are outstanding. Nice job.', '2004-11-17 23:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018749, 121744, 27842, '<td valign="top">Very creative and well executed. 9</td>', 'Very creative and well executed. 9', '2004-11-17 23:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018751, 122010, 9668, '<td valign="top">This shot looks like its been through neat image, but I don''t know.<br/>Cool composition, lovely shot of this vintage structure.</td>', 'This shot looks like its been through neat image, but I don''t know.Cool composition, lovely shot of this vintage structure.', '2004-11-17 23:23:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018752, 121216, 27842, '<td valign="top">Excellent detail</td>', 'Excellent detail', '2004-11-17 23:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018754, 121537, 9668, '<td valign="top">The whole shot seems a tad out of focus. Branches on left are a bit distracting. Awsome angle of this village!</td>', 'The whole shot seems a tad out of focus. Branches on left are a bit distracting. Awsome angle of this village!', '2004-11-17 23:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
