(1018887, 121671, 28623, '<td valign="top">This wins the prize in my opinion.  What a wonderful photograph.   Look at that beautiful face!!!  It looks as if you took some time and thought with this.</td>', 'This wins the prize in my opinion.  What a wonderful photograph.   Look at that beautiful face!!!  It looks as if you took some time and thought with this.', '2004-11-18 01:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018888, 120546, 29607, '<td valign="top">love the darkness of the water against the faded planks<br/></td>', 'love the darkness of the water against the faded planks', '2004-11-18 01:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018889, 121216, 29168, '<td valign="top">This is excellent composition. But I personally have trouble with images where the horizon angle is wrong. (You can use the measuring tool and info pane in PS to get the exact angle for correction if you weren''t aware.) This one looks to me rotated a degree or so clockwise and as such is very distracting. Otherwise it''s an excellent shot. 8. Good luck!</td>', 'This is excellent composition. But I personally have trouble with images where the horizon angle is wrong. (You can use the measuring tool and info pane in PS to get the exact angle for correction if you weren''t aware.) This one looks to me rotated a degree or so clockwise and as such is very distracting. Otherwise it''s an excellent shot. 8. Good luck!', '2004-11-18 01:45:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1018892, 122152, 15920, '<td valign="top">Great idea, just a few too many subjects.</td>', 'Great idea, just a few too many subjects.', '2004-11-18 01:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
