(1018998, 121443, 27482, '<td valign="top">I don´t get the framing here, what is with the HUGE white border on the right and the small one on the bottom.  Anyway I don´t get it (if there is anything to get at all) and it just plain ruins it for me for this looks like a promising photo.  You got good lighting, interesting subjects and although it looks a bit soft that is not neccesarily a bad thing, I probably would have given this photo 6-7 but I am one of those narrow minded fools that can´t look past the border on the right.</td>', 'I don´t get the framing here, what is with the HUGE white border on the right and the small one on the bottom.  Anyway I don´t get it (if there is anything to get at all) and it just plain ruins it for me for this looks like a promising photo.  You got good lighting, interesting subjects and although it looks a bit soft that is not neccesarily a bad thing, I probably would have given this photo 6-7 but I am one of those narrow minded fools that can´t look past the border on the right.', '2004-11-18 03:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1019000, 120812, 27482, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot, a very good portrait and I love the lighting.  I love the composition too but I think if you cropped a bit tighter it would look good too.  Anyway an easy 10 from me, hope you do well.</td>', 'Awesome shot, a very good portrait and I love the lighting.  I love the composition too but I think if you cropped a bit tighter it would look good too.  Anyway an easy 10 from me, hope you do well.', '2004-11-18 03:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
