(1019006, 121062, 27482, '<td valign="top">Good shot, excellent tones and it´s an interesting subject but then this isn´t a wow shot either.  To nitpick I think she could have been in a better pose, her hand on her face pretty much looks like she is scratching or something like that, anyway an unflattering pose IMO.  7</td>', 'Good shot, excellent tones and it´s an interesting subject but then this isn´t a wow shot either.  To nitpick I think she could have been in a better pose, her hand on her face pretty much looks like she is scratching or something like that, anyway an unflattering pose IMO.  7', '2004-11-18 03:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1019007, 120673, 27482, '<td valign="top">Good shot, not great though but it looks a bit flat, some contrast boost would help this shot a lot.</td>', 'Good shot, not great though but it looks a bit flat, some contrast boost would help this shot a lot.', '2004-11-18 03:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
