(1019142, 120487, 24951, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for these kinds of shots - abandoned buildings, windows,doors etc., but I would have enjoyed this shot even more if the concentration had been more on the window, rather than the wall.</td>', 'I''m a sucker for these kinds of shots - abandoned buildings, windows,doors etc., but I would have enjoyed this shot even more if the concentration had been more on the window, rather than the wall.', '2004-11-18 06:32:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1019146, 121228, 7560, '<td valign="top">Kitty! And I thought Tico was the only cat I knew who would do this? Does this handsome beast also sit in the sink while the water runs? :)  This is a stronger shot without the mirror in it. I''d also move the angle a tad so that there is more seperation between the fawcett and kitty.</td>', 'Kitty! And I thought Tico was the only cat I knew who would do this? Does this handsome beast also sit in the sink while the water runs? :)  This is a stronger shot without the mirror in it. I''d also move the angle a tad so that there is more seperation between the fawcett and kitty.', '2004-11-18 06:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1019148, 121000, 27524, '<td valign="top">:) you are taking lot of selfpictures...sure if im not worng.<br/>Idea is good but shadow is distracting specially if you take violett as title. Also background is too busy to make accent on female. Could try other angle or daytime.</td>', ':) you are taking lot of selfpictures...sure if im not worng.Idea is good but shadow is distracting specially if you take violett as title. Also background is too busy to make accent on female. Could try other angle or daytime.', '2004-11-18 06:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
