(1019583, 121652, 27845, '<td valign="top">The noise removal made the otherwise interesting structure on the skin disappear. A pity. I''d have placed the hand a bit lower, showing but the fingers. Nice idea not to show the eyes. The wather has to imagine your face.</td>', 'The noise removal made the otherwise interesting structure on the skin disappear. A pity. I''d have placed the hand a bit lower, showing but the fingers. Nice idea not to show the eyes. The wather has to imagine your face.', '2004-11-18 12:15:05.000000', NULL, 1),
