(1019588, 120457, 27845, '<td valign="top">This one''s funny. Thanks. I like how many texture''s are in there, without the image confusing the eye. I don''t know whether you''d have got the permission to do so, but you might have put one of the pipes on the ground. Would have made the impression of decline even stronger.</td>', 'This one''s funny. Thanks. I like how many texture''s are in there, without the image confusing the eye. I don''t know whether you''d have got the permission to do so, but you might have put one of the pipes on the ground. Would have made the impression of decline even stronger.', '2004-11-18 12:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1019591, 121626, 23962, '<td valign="top">should spark some interesting comments.</td>', 'should spark some interesting comments.', '2004-11-18 12:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1019592, 122055, 208, '<td valign="top">very moody</td>', 'very moody', '2004-11-18 12:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1019594, 121131, 26756, '<td valign="top">I really love the textures you captured here.  Great tonal detail too.  I wish there could have been a bit more separation somehow between the barrel and the wall behind it but a great shot none the less.</td>', 'I really love the textures you captured here.  Great tonal detail too.  I wish there could have been a bit more separation somehow between the barrel and the wall behind it but a great shot none the less.', '2004-11-18 12:21:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1019597, 121021, 27845, '<td valign="top">I like the shadow of the cage in the hawk''s head. A very nice way to bring something into your image that''s actually not in it.</td>', 'I like the shadow of the cage in the hawk''s head. A very nice way to bring something into your image that''s actually not in it.', '2004-11-18 12:22:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1019598, 121764, 19010, '<td valign="top">Great shot definately one of my top picks. The only complaint I have with this photo is I want to see more of it. Iess of a crop would have made me happy. Otherwise I have no complaints. Great lighting and shadows. Good contrast of skin on fur. The way the coat is being pulled up close and the bare tree is the backgroung ad a real sence of realism to the photo. great job.</td>', 'Great shot definately one of my top picks. The only complaint I have with this photo is I want to see more of it. Iess of a crop would have made me happy. Otherwise I have no complaints. Great lighting and shadows. Good contrast of skin on fur. The way the coat is being pulled up close and the bare tree is the backgroung ad a real sence of realism to the photo. great job.', '2004-11-18 12:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1019599, 121043, 23962, '<td valign="top">I''m tryiing to guess if you dropped the dice then rotated the pic. did you use a strobe?</td>', 'I''m tryiing to guess if you dropped the dice then rotated the pic. did you use a strobe?', '2004-11-18 12:23:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1019600, 121929, 208, '<td valign="top">Not enough contrast for my taste. It''s mostly all the same shade of gray.</td>', 'Not enough contrast for my taste. It''s mostly all the same shade of gray.', '2004-11-18 12:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1019601, 122053, 326, '<td valign="top">Nice one. I love the open space in this shot.</td>', 'Nice one. I love the open space in this shot.', '2004-11-18 12:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1019605, 120737, 26756, '<td valign="top">Nice dof choice to highlight her lips.  Not seeing the eyes in this shot works really well.</td>', 'Nice dof choice to highlight her lips.  Not seeing the eyes in this shot works really well.', '2004-11-18 12:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1019608, 121009, 208, '<td valign="top">This may be weird, but my favorite part of this is the lamp''s shadow.</td>', 'This may be weird, but my favorite part of this is the lamp''s shadow.', '2004-11-18 12:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1019611, 121779, 27845, '<td valign="top">Now this one took me quite some time to judge.<br/>I feel the figures should be more to the left, but I can''t tell why. Strange. I''m glad you didn''t use a chess board as surface. It would have distracted from the figures. The title fits perfectly, and the feeling of dominance is striking.<br/>I just don''t know what to make of the figures in the back. I don''t see how they would add to the athmosphere, but they''re good to fill the otherwise empty space.<br/>Very nice, 9.</td>', 'Now this one took me quite some time to judge.I feel the figures should be more to the left, but I can''t tell why. Strange. I''m glad you didn''t use a chess board as surface. It would have distracted from the figures. The title fits perfectly, and the feeling of dominance is striking.I just don''t know what to make of the figures in the back. I don''t see how they would add to the athmosphere, but they''re good to fill the otherwise empty space.Very nice, 9.', '2004-11-18 12:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1019613, 120908, 326, '<td valign="top">Nice texture. This is a good choice of subject for a black &amp; white.</td>', 'Nice texture. This is a good choice of subject for a black & white.', '2004-11-18 12:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1019614, 120521, 13648, '<td valign="top">Nice and sharp. Not sure about having two columns dead center though.</td>', 'Nice and sharp. Not sure about having two columns dead center though.', '2004-11-18 12:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1019615, 121222, 326, '<td valign="top">Very nice! Great job!</td>', 'Very nice! Great job!', '2004-11-18 12:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1019617, 121000, 27845, '<td valign="top">I had to laugh about this first. Then I realized that in the left is a tombstone. I like how the picture suggested two opposite feelings to me in but a second. But that''s about all there is to it. The shadow is annoying, because it divides the word Violett in two parts. Nice idea, though.</td>', 'I had to laugh about this first. Then I realized that in the left is a tombstone. I like how the picture suggested two opposite feelings to me in but a second. But that''s about all there is to it. The shadow is annoying, because it divides the word Violett in two parts. Nice idea, though.', '2004-11-18 12:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1019619, 121814, 23962, '<td valign="top">This is really interesting and fresh. You  are miles ahead of many on this site.</td>', 'This is really interesting and fresh. You  are miles ahead of many on this site.', '2004-11-18 12:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
