(1019676, 121814, 18834, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition.  I think its just a little too dark</td>', 'Interesting composition.  I think its just a little too dark', '2004-11-18 13:05:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1019678, 122042, 20204, '<td valign="top">What a great action shot - this could easily be Tiger Woods on the cover of S.I..  I''d have bee nervous putting myself and my glass in front of a pitching wedge, but more power to you!</td>', 'What a great action shot - this could easily be Tiger Woods on the cover of S.I..  I''d have bee nervous putting myself and my glass in front of a pitching wedge, but more power to you!', '2004-11-18 13:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1019679, 122154, 18834, '<td valign="top">It seems a little out of focus and it is very dark.  I do like the gradual shadow from right to left</td>', 'It seems a little out of focus and it is very dark.  I do like the gradual shadow from right to left', '2004-11-18 13:06:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1019681, 121997, 18834, '<td valign="top">Very grainy and out of focus.   poor quality image</td>', 'Very grainy and out of focus.   poor quality image', '2004-11-18 13:07:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1019682, 120737, 6388, '<td valign="top">Hi Taylor :)  Tell your mom she takes fabulous photos of you.<br/> <br/>P</td>', 'Hi Taylor :)  Tell your mom she takes fabulous photos of you. P', '2004-11-18 13:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1019684, 122089, 21124, '<td valign="top">I am sorry but I think that this is out of focus.<br/>Moreover the bug is not enough contrasted with the rest of the scene. This could probably be enhanced by using the channel mixer to perform the greyscale convertion.</td>', 'I am sorry but I think that this is out of focus.Moreover the bug is not enough contrasted with the rest of the scene. This could probably be enhanced by using the channel mixer to perform the greyscale convertion.', '2004-11-18 13:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1019685, 122165, 20204, '<td valign="top">You did a good job not overexposing too large an area in creating this silhouette.  the problem I see is that there is no clear focus, or path of discovery.  The "dangling" branches in the upper left ript the eyes away from the larger branch structure.  I would suggest trying some alternate croppings which perhaps draw attention to the leaves, or the symmetry of the "Y" section of the main branch near the Sun.  Think about what made you want to take this picture, and then reduce it to its most direct presentation.</td>', 'You did a good job not overexposing too large an area in creating this silhouette.  the problem I see is that there is no clear focus, or path of discovery.  The "dangling" branches in the upper left ript the eyes away from the larger branch structure.  I would suggest trying some alternate croppings which perhaps draw attention to the leaves, or the symmetry of the "Y" section of the main branch near the Sun.  Think about what made you want to take this picture, and then reduce it to its most direct presentation.', '2004-11-18 13:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1019686, 121569, 18834, '<td valign="top">Very nice rustic look.  i like the depth of field, although I think it would look nicer if more was cropped off the bottom.</td>', 'Very nice rustic look.  i like the depth of field, although I think it would look nicer if more was cropped off the bottom.', '2004-11-18 13:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1019688, 122025, 18834, '<td valign="top">too much glare coming off of the trumpet.  maybe a tissue or stocking over the flash could have reduced that</td>', 'too much glare coming off of the trumpet.  maybe a tissue or stocking over the flash could have reduced that', '2004-11-18 13:10:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1019689, 122000, 6388, '<td valign="top">this is one of the better conversions i''ve seen in this challenge.  nice a rich and deep texture, an element most have missed.  In advanced editing you could dim the reflections a little, but they''re not too bad at all.<br/>nice shot.  love the shallow DOF too.<br/> <br/>P<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-11-24 00:14:43.</i></td>', 'this is one of the better conversions i''ve seen in this challenge.  nice a rich and deep texture, an element most have missed.  In advanced editing you could dim the reflections a little, but they''re not too bad at all.nice shot.  love the shallow DOF too. P', '2004-11-18 13:10:16.000000', '2004-11-24 00:14:43.000000', 1),
(1019690, 121019, 20204, '<td valign="top">Nice use of foreground to lead the eye througout the image.  The clean texture of the pebbles is visually attractive, and the cloud reflections lend interest to the otherwise calm water.  I like the rigid symmetry of the background posts; They create a nice contrast with the softness of the rest of frame''s natural elements.  Nicely composed.</td>', 'Nice use of foreground to lead the eye througout the image.  The clean texture of the pebbles is visually attractive, and the cloud reflections lend interest to the otherwise calm water.  I like the rigid symmetry of the background posts; They create a nice contrast with the softness of the rest of frame''s natural elements.  Nicely composed.', '2004-11-18 13:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1019691, 121151, 326, '<td valign="top">Nice macro. Good composition. Good job.</td>', 'Nice macro. Good composition. Good job.', '2004-11-18 13:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1019692, 121726, 18834, '<td valign="top">good macro, although the shell towards the top is a tad out of focus</td>', 'good macro, although the shell towards the top is a tad out of focus', '2004-11-18 13:11:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1019694, 121734, 20204, '<td valign="top">Creative use of perspective makes this image stand out from being "just another building".  Great exposure as well.  Not too bright, not too dull.  I think use of b/w works very well in thie image by drawing attention to the brickwork and the silhouette of th bare-branched tree.</td>', 'Creative use of perspective makes this image stand out from being "just another building".  Great exposure as well.  Not too bright, not too dull.  I think use of b/w works very well in thie image by drawing attention to the brickwork and the silhouette of th bare-branched tree.', '2004-11-18 13:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1019695, 121864, 7291, '<td valign="top">Excellent framing.</td>', 'Excellent framing.', '2004-11-18 13:12:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1019696, 121682, 18834, '<td valign="top">It seems like the roots of the tree are not in well enough focus for them to be strongly distinguished from the background of the tree branches</td>', 'It seems like the roots of the tree are not in well enough focus for them to be strongly distinguished from the background of the tree branches', '2004-11-18 13:12:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1019697, 121888, 7291, '<td valign="top">Would have been excellent had the bar not been cutting the puppy''s head in half.</td>', 'Would have been excellent had the bar not been cutting the puppy''s head in half.', '2004-11-18 13:13:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1019698, 121970, 21124, '<td valign="top">I think that this is too lighted. I would have like the "hair" to be more black than light grey</td>', 'I think that this is too lighted. I would have like the "hair" to be more black than light grey', '2004-11-18 13:13:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1019699, 121131, 18834, '<td valign="top">Good quality, although a little dark.8.</td>', 'Good quality, although a little dark.8.', '2004-11-18 13:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1019702, 121682, 20204, '<td valign="top">Overexposure and lack of sharpness hurts the presentation of this otherwise interesting subject.  A grad filter on the top of the frame would help tremendously,  I think you needed to try to capture this at a time of day that gave better shdows on the intricate decaying roots.  The perspective works well for the composition, but I think keeping this image in color would create a better contrast between the dead tree and the living backdrop.  Obviously, it wouldn''t meet the challenge then, but its something to think about.</td>', 'Overexposure and lack of sharpness hurts the presentation of this otherwise interesting subject.  A grad filter on the top of the frame would help tremendously,  I think you needed to try to capture this at a time of day that gave better shdows on the intricate decaying roots.  The perspective works well for the composition, but I think keeping this image in color would create a better contrast between the dead tree and the living backdrop.  Obviously, it wouldn''t meet the challenge then, but its something to think about.', '2004-11-18 13:14:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1019703, 121914, 7291, '<td valign="top">Something about the post processing does not look right here.  Perhaps it over sharpenned.  You may want to try re-shooting this in IR.  Excellent setting for that.</td>', 'Something about the post processing does not look right here.  Perhaps it over sharpenned.  You may want to try re-shooting this in IR.  Excellent setting for that.', '2004-11-18 13:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1019704, 122071, 21124, '<td valign="top">I think that the border might be slightly too big.</td>', 'I think that the border might be slightly too big.', '2004-11-18 13:14:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1019705, 120564, 23478, '<td valign="top">Coll foto, I like the simplicity.</td>', 'Coll foto, I like the simplicity.', '2004-11-18 13:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1019707, 121744, 20204, '<td valign="top">Cool still life, but it''s lacking a point of interest for me.  Perhaps sparkling water in the glass, or something like that?  Technically this is well executed, but I just can''t find something to grab my attention.</td>', 'Cool still life, but it''s lacking a point of interest for me.  Perhaps sparkling water in the glass, or something like that?  Technically this is well executed, but I just can''t find something to grab my attention.', '2004-11-18 13:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1019708, 120884, 27375, '<td valign="top">what fantastic shot with the different textures and contrast between the flower and grass...quite a stunning shot but that gray border takes away from the texture in my opinion, just the simple black one would have drawn out your blacks in the picture more</td>', 'what fantastic shot with the different textures and contrast between the flower and grass...quite a stunning shot but that gray border takes away from the texture in my opinion, just the simple black one would have drawn out your blacks in the picture more', '2004-11-18 13:16:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1019711, 121631, 23478, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo, the light and shadows are great.</td>', 'Excellent photo, the light and shadows are great.', '2004-11-18 13:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1019713, 120739, 23478, '<td valign="top">The effect of the sky is very interesting.  Well done.</td>', 'The effect of the sky is very interesting.  Well done.', '2004-11-18 13:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1019714, 122150, 20204, '<td valign="top">I think the persepctive would be improved if the upper (darker) part of the bridge flowed without interruption.  Other possible improvements: use 1 stop less exposure and some sharpening.  Not totally sure about the exposure as you might loose some under-bridge detail, but I don''t think that would hurt the overall image, and may have the effect of pronouncing the lighter stone details more strongly.</td>', 'I think the persepctive would be improved if the upper (darker) part of the bridge flowed without interruption.  Other possible improvements: use 1 stop less exposure and some sharpening.  Not totally sure about the exposure as you might loose some under-bridge detail, but I don''t think that would hurt the overall image, and may have the effect of pronouncing the lighter stone details more strongly.', '2004-11-18 13:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1019716, 122081, 7291, '<td valign="top">The dark part of the pad she is sitting on looks like her right leg.  Which makes it look horribly hyper-extended.  Threw me off for a a bit.  If cropped so that she is only shown from the legs/butt on up, I think would have made a more pleasing composition.  But I''n not a pro, so what do I kow.  =)</td>', 'The dark part of the pad she is sitting on looks like her right leg.  Which makes it look horribly hyper-extended.  Threw me off for a a bit.  If cropped so that she is only shown from the legs/butt on up, I think would have made a more pleasing composition.  But I''n not a pro, so what do I kow.  =)', '2004-11-18 13:18:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1019718, 122207, 7291, '<td valign="top">LOL.  I love the title.  I''m assuming his name is Ivo.</td>', 'LOL.  I love the title.  I''m assuming his name is Ivo.', '2004-11-18 13:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1019719, 121059, 23478, '<td valign="top">A very enticing photo, the lighting is very cool.</td>', 'A very enticing photo, the lighting is very cool.', '2004-11-18 13:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1019720, 121111, 20204, '<td valign="top">Seems awkward to chop off part of the primary subject ( the foot ).</td>', 'Seems awkward to chop off part of the primary subject ( the foot ).', '2004-11-18 13:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1019722, 122143, 7291, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, but I see nothing visually interesting here.</td>', 'I''m sorry, but I see nothing visually interesting here.', '2004-11-18 13:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1019723, 120599, 27375, '<td valign="top">this is a cute shot, the dog seems slightly out of focus, but the lighting is nice.. it would have been better if you would have zoomed in past the pillows and that would also have helped to blur the background...but if your preference and intention was to get the pillows and background that would be ok too since it creates a cozy feeling but the tv and cord from the drapes takes away from that</td>', 'this is a cute shot, the dog seems slightly out of focus, but the lighting is nice.. it would have been better if you would have zoomed in past the pillows and that would also have helped to blur the background...but if your preference and intention was to get the pillows and background that would be ok too since it creates a cozy feeling but the tv and cord from the drapes takes away from that', '2004-11-18 13:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1019724, 121988, 20204, '<td valign="top">Seems like a touch of overexposure has lost detail in the fur.  The expression, and shadow on the dog''s head are great, as is the clean background created by the shadow.</td>', 'Seems like a touch of overexposure has lost detail in the fur.  The expression, and shadow on the dog''s head are great, as is the clean background created by the shadow.', '2004-11-18 13:20:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1019725, 121492, 20204, '<td valign="top">I think the perspective obscures the background path too much for this to work right.  You''d want to be up about 5 more feet or so to bring it out.</td>', 'I think the perspective obscures the background path too much for this to work right.  You''d want to be up about 5 more feet or so to bring it out.', '2004-11-18 13:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1019729, 121819, 27375, '<td valign="top">this is an intersting place and subject but it seems you needed to tilt your camera down a tad on the right side, also the house in the front is distracting</td>', 'this is an intersting place and subject but it seems you needed to tilt your camera down a tad on the right side, also the house in the front is distracting', '2004-11-18 13:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1019730, 121871, 20204, '<td valign="top">There are many detailed and interesting crops available on this building, but taking it as a whole, I think those points of interest are lost.  The expansive brick face isn''t inherently interesting to look at, yet it commands a significant amount of the frame.  The same could be said for the sky.  I''d go for an angle that accentuates the main door and window above it, leaving out the distracting elements.</td>', 'There are many detailed and interesting crops available on this building, but taking it as a whole, I think those points of interest are lost.  The expansive brick face isn''t inherently interesting to look at, yet it commands a significant amount of the frame.  The same could be said for the sky.  I''d go for an angle that accentuates the main door and window above it, leaving out the distracting elements.', '2004-11-18 13:24:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1019731, 121258, 27375, '<td valign="top">this is pretty i like the tones of the trees with the rest of the tpic</td>', 'this is pretty i like the tones of the trees with the rest of the tpic', '2004-11-18 13:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1019732, 121505, 20204, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject and expression, great use of backlighting, but I''m hung up on how tight the cropping is to her chin.</td>', 'Interesting subject and expression, great use of backlighting, but I''m hung up on how tight the cropping is to her chin.', '2004-11-18 13:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1019734, 121629, 326, '<td valign="top">What a cool old place! It is nice to find a place like this but I feel you needed to use more of its natural surroundings and a bit more contrast.</td>', 'What a cool old place! It is nice to find a place like this but I feel you needed to use more of its natural surroundings and a bit more contrast.', '2004-11-18 13:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1019735, 120673, 7291, '<td valign="top">I think this is an excellent idea that could have been excecuted a little better (IMHO).  The sports logos don''t go with the theme of the picture and the picture is lacking contrast.  Out of curiosity, I ran it through Photoshop and a simple Auto Levels worked wonders instantly.  Just a thought.</td>', 'I think this is an excellent idea that could have been excecuted a little better (IMHO).  The sports logos don''t go with the theme of the picture and the picture is lacking contrast.  Out of curiosity, I ran it through Photoshop and a simple Auto Levels worked wonders instantly.  Just a thought.', '2004-11-18 13:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
