(1019793, 122177, 20204, '<td valign="top">Neat dragon.  I think the texture on the fabric competes for attention with the bowl.  I also think the bowl itself competes with the dragon.  If you want the bowl to be your subject, a cleaner backdrop (fabric) would help.  If you wnt the dragon to be your subject, I''d suggest finding a perspective that minimizes the impression of it being a bowl.</td>', 'Neat dragon.  I think the texture on the fabric competes for attention with the bowl.  I also think the bowl itself competes with the dragon.  If you want the bowl to be your subject, a cleaner backdrop (fabric) would help.  If you wnt the dragon to be your subject, I''d suggest finding a perspective that minimizes the impression of it being a bowl.', '2004-11-18 13:38:05.000000', NULL, 1),
