(1019894, 122123, 14620, '<td valign="top">This is a very strong image.  The contrast between the subject and his surroundings is very eye catching.  The textures of the brick also add much interest to the scene.  Very nice lines.  Too bad for the people in the background, but overall, a very nice photo.  Bumping to an 8.</td>', 'This is a very strong image.  The contrast between the subject and his surroundings is very eye catching.  The textures of the brick also add much interest to the scene.  Very nice lines.  Too bad for the people in the background, but overall, a very nice photo.  Bumping to an 8.', '2004-11-18 14:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
