(1019910, 121844, 27244, '<td valign="top">I like the way that this photo flows from the bright white on the right into the dark on the left.  It pulls my eyes to follow, very well done. 9</td>', 'I like the way that this photo flows from the bright white on the right into the dark on the left.  It pulls my eyes to follow, very well done. 9', '2004-11-18 14:17:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1019911, 121011, 19010, '<td valign="top">Until I saw this shot I was convinced that humans were the only thing that looked good in B&amp;W. Great detail and definition throughout the photo. This is a very crisp and poerfull image. Proving me to completely wrong in my earlier assumptions. One of my top picks. Great Job!</td>', 'Until I saw this shot I was convinced that humans were the only thing that looked good in B&W. Great detail and definition throughout the photo. This is a very crisp and poerfull image. Proving me to completely wrong in my earlier assumptions. One of my top picks. Great Job!', '2004-11-18 14:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
