(1019952, 121637, 22734, '<td valign="top">Love those breaking waves. Look at them. One just completed and is silk smooth while the other is just breaking. I would love a better tonal balance, but all the same here is my 8 for the good catch.</td>', 'Love those breaking waves. Look at them. One just completed and is silk smooth while the other is just breaking. I would love a better tonal balance, but all the same here is my 8 for the good catch.', '2004-11-18 14:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
