(1019979, 120776, 11800, '<td valign="top">Curving lines are pleasant to look at and I like the way you framed it. A little to much contrast, imo. There are hardly any mid-tones in the picture. But that is only my opinion.</td>', 'Curving lines are pleasant to look at and I like the way you framed it. A little to much contrast, imo. There are hardly any mid-tones in the picture. But that is only my opinion.', '2004-11-18 14:34:54.000000', NULL, 1),
