(1020023, 120606, 19010, '<td valign="top">Exellent job with shadows and lighting. Attractive subject. Very nice skin tone, and seemingly perfect focus. The only complaint I have is that the face seems mishaped due to the hair and shoulder shadows covering it. Great job one of my top 10 picks.</td>', 'Exellent job with shadows and lighting. Attractive subject. Very nice skin tone, and seemingly perfect focus. The only complaint I have is that the face seems mishaped due to the hair and shoulder shadows covering it. Great job one of my top 10 picks.', '2004-11-18 14:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1020025, 121261, 11800, '<td valign="top">The tones are good. Darks, lights and lots of mid-tones. It does look a little soft and I don''t know about the tilt. Seems to be disorienting to me, like it''s running away or rejecting the viewer when I would want it to be welcoming.</td>', 'The tones are good. Darks, lights and lots of mid-tones. It does look a little soft and I don''t know about the tilt. Seems to be disorienting to me, like it''s running away or rejecting the viewer when I would want it to be welcoming.', '2004-11-18 14:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
