(1020082, 121929, 29535, '<td valign="top">It''s sparse, but that''s what makes it so mesmerising.  This shot feels so lonesome and isolated, it''s brilliant.  Actually, probably the best I''ve seen so far.  Well done.</td>', 'It''s sparse, but that''s what makes it so mesmerising.  This shot feels so lonesome and isolated, it''s brilliant.  Actually, probably the best I''ve seen so far.  Well done.', '2004-11-18 15:09:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1020084, 121668, 19010, '<td valign="top">Great shot very imaginative. The lighting on this makes it very persuasive that this is actualy a statue. Lots of lovely shadows. The gentle smile is remeinecent of early religious statues of the saints. There two keys that give it away as not being a statue. The first one i like. The eyelashes add an unrealistic and too lifelike depth to the "statue". The second wich I don''t like is the seam in the fabric along the bottom. This is a large give away that this is not an actual statue. I also find it distracting. All around great shot. One of my top 10 picks for the challenge.</td>', 'Great shot very imaginative. The lighting on this makes it very persuasive that this is actualy a statue. Lots of lovely shadows. The gentle smile is remeinecent of early religious statues of the saints. There two keys that give it away as not being a statue. The first one i like. The eyelashes add an unrealistic and too lifelike depth to the "statue". The second wich I don''t like is the seam in the fabric along the bottom. This is a large give away that this is not an actual statue. I also find it distracting. All around great shot. One of my top 10 picks for the challenge.', '2004-11-18 15:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1020086, 121472, 29535, '<td valign="top">Far too much bland sky.. and not enough foreground.  Get closer or in better sight of the building and get less sky in.  Just slightly mind you.</td>', 'Far too much bland sky.. and not enough foreground.  Get closer or in better sight of the building and get less sky in.  Just slightly mind you.', '2004-11-18 15:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1020088, 121993, 29535, '<td valign="top">Dude you left the datestamp on, which is a huge nono from the off.  Aside from that... I don''t like it really.  It''s not very well composed or exposed.  Keep trying though huh?</td>', 'Dude you left the datestamp on, which is a huge nono from the off.  Aside from that... I don''t like it really.  It''s not very well composed or exposed.  Keep trying though huh?', '2004-11-18 15:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1020092, 121587, 9977, '<td valign="top">Beautiful contrast, sharpening and gray level ...</td>', 'Beautiful contrast, sharpening and gray level ...', '2004-11-18 15:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
