(1020142, 122198, 29437, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure how to describe what I don''t like about this...  Something to do with the focus on your subject.  I want to say it should be entirely in focus, but I''m afraid you''d lose some of the ''dizzy'' in that case.  Nice nonetheless.  6.</td>', 'I''m not sure how to describe what I don''t like about this...  Something to do with the focus on your subject.  I want to say it should be entirely in focus, but I''m afraid you''d lose some of the ''dizzy'' in that case.  Nice nonetheless.  6.', '2004-11-18 15:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
