(1020159, 121140, 29437, '<td valign="top">Great subject!  Feels like an Asimov or Orwell novel.  It would be more imposing if the angle rose from right to left, I think.  I like the contrast of the stark shadows.</td>', 'Great subject!  Feels like an Asimov or Orwell novel.  It would be more imposing if the angle rose from right to left, I think.  I like the contrast of the stark shadows.', '2004-11-18 15:55:32.000000', NULL, 1),
