(1020170, 120448, 11800, '<td valign="top">Although it is centered, there are a lot of different things on either side to keep it from becoming static.  I like the 3-3-3 top to bottom and side by side. Only nit is in the post processing. To much sharpening and not as much detail as all those bricks would imply is really there.</td>', 'Although it is centered, there are a lot of different things on either side to keep it from becoming static.  I like the 3-3-3 top to bottom and side by side. Only nit is in the post processing. To much sharpening and not as much detail as all those bricks would imply is really there.', '2004-11-18 16:01:35.000000', NULL, 1),
