(1020198, 120900, 11800, '<td valign="top">Almost a tri tone. I can see sepia and the jacket has a blue tint. Ahh. You only partially desaturated it maybe? Hope you''re not being sacrificed for this heresy. I like the low key effect, and truthfully, I think it would have been stronger as a pure duotone or b/w. You did capture an intense look and the lighting is beautiful.</td>', 'Almost a tri tone. I can see sepia and the jacket has a blue tint. Ahh. You only partially desaturated it maybe? Hope you''re not being sacrificed for this heresy. I like the low key effect, and truthfully, I think it would have been stronger as a pure duotone or b/w. You did capture an intense look and the lighting is beautiful.', '2004-11-18 16:16:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1020202, 121636, 23921, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture, but bad crop.</td>', 'Beautiful picture, but bad crop.', '2004-11-18 16:17:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1020203, 121516, 21124, '<td valign="top">The subject is very nice, however I think that the composition is relatively poor.<br/>You could have tryed it in landscape mode, with the tree on the left side of the photo. Finding an angle without the triangular sign would also improve the photo.</td>', 'The subject is very nice, however I think that the composition is relatively poor.You could have tryed it in landscape mode, with the tree on the left side of the photo. Finding an angle without the triangular sign would also improve the photo.', '2004-11-18 16:17:17.000000', NULL, 1),
