(1020243, 120836, 24065, '<td valign="top">I do not object to cat photographs -- in fact I am a cat-lover.  And I think you had a great opportunity here with the cat''s "attitude" and leaves with the lines in the bricks.  This is one of those occasions where I think uring the rule of thirds and placing the cat on one of the interestions would have worked nicely. I would have rated it higher with a better composition, but do like it :)</td>', 'I do not object to cat photographs -- in fact I am a cat-lover.  And I think you had a great opportunity here with the cat''s "attitude" and leaves with the lines in the bricks.  This is one of those occasions where I think uring the rule of thirds and placing the cat on one of the interestions would have worked nicely. I would have rated it higher with a better composition, but do like it :)', '2004-11-18 16:52:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1020244, 121649, 13749, '<td valign="top">great picture, but wish the whites were a little whiter.  still, that seems like a minor detail considering how well everything else was executed - 8.</td>', 'great picture, but wish the whites were a little whiter.  still, that seems like a minor detail considering how well everything else was executed - 8.', '2004-11-18 16:52:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1020245, 121822, 29537, '<td valign="top">beautiful  eyes and a good high key</td>', 'beautiful  eyes and a good high key', '2004-11-18 16:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1020246, 121250, 22619, '<td valign="top">Great concept. Only thing I would have done differently is to not crop it so tight. Seeing more of the checkerboard pattern woul dlet the cups blend in more. Definitely a keeper though! I may even have to try something similar myself.</td>', 'Great concept. Only thing I would have done differently is to not crop it so tight. Seeing more of the checkerboard pattern woul dlet the cups blend in more. Definitely a keeper though! I may even have to try something similar myself.', '2004-11-18 16:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1020247, 122078, 29537, '<td valign="top">shorter DOF, please</td>', 'shorter DOF, please', '2004-11-18 16:55:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1020249, 121771, 13749, '<td valign="top">excellent composition - my personal taste desires a little more lighting/more white, but that''s all a matter of taste i guess.</td>', 'excellent composition - my personal taste desires a little more lighting/more white, but that''s all a matter of taste i guess.', '2004-11-18 16:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
