(1020297, 121940, 6532, '<td valign="top">Great use of "white" space... but the subject is .....boring or not of interest, IMO.  Also what is the hint of something there on the right border?  Still giving you a 5.<br/></td>', 'Great use of "white" space... but the subject is .....boring or not of interest, IMO.  Also what is the hint of something there on the right border?  Still giving you a 5.', '2004-11-18 17:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
