(1020507, 121321, 18799, '<td valign="top">The skin hghtlights are blown out and there is no detail in the dark areas - too much contrast adjustment perhaps?  Also, the hair in the face is a distraction.  I think the crop is awkward too - the area on the left doesn''t add anything to the "feel" of the photo, so in this case, the rule of thirds doesn''t work.</td>', 'The skin hghtlights are blown out and there is no detail in the dark areas - too much contrast adjustment perhaps?  Also, the hair in the face is a distraction.  I think the crop is awkward too - the area on the left doesn''t add anything to the "feel" of the photo, so in this case, the rule of thirds doesn''t work.', '2004-11-18 19:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
