(1020515, 121330, 15920, '<td valign="top">Things that are good about this image: texture on the bricks, composition, and the title is great.  It is good as is, but one thing that might improve this is to do something clever with the lighting to give the greys of the window frame a little more contrast relative to the bricks.  All in, nicely done, and, an enjoyable chuckle was had by this voter.  Thanks for that.</td>', 'Things that are good about this image: texture on the bricks, composition, and the title is great.  It is good as is, but one thing that might improve this is to do something clever with the lighting to give the greys of the window frame a little more contrast relative to the bricks.  All in, nicely done, and, an enjoyable chuckle was had by this voter.  Thanks for that.', '2004-11-18 19:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1020517, 121277, 18799, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, it''s very well composed.  The sky over the left side of the house looks a little weird, but that''s ok.  The one thing that needs improvement is the dark colors - I can''t make out any detail in the cow''s face - I would have liked to have seen the eyes.  6</td>', 'I like this shot, it''s very well composed.  The sky over the left side of the house looks a little weird, but that''s ok.  The one thing that needs improvement is the dark colors - I can''t make out any detail in the cow''s face - I would have liked to have seen the eyes.  6', '2004-11-18 19:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
