(1020615, 120911, 18799, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t really work for me.  I think the forground plant is distracting and there is not enough contrast in the remainder of the photo.  I reallize it''s fog and that''s difficult, that''s why a truely good fog photo is tough to do.  5</td>', 'Doesn''t really work for me.  I think the forground plant is distracting and there is not enough contrast in the remainder of the photo.  I reallize it''s fog and that''s difficult, that''s why a truely good fog photo is tough to do.  5', '2004-11-18 20:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1020616, 121745, 4226, '<td valign="top">Lighting idea seems good, but not enough light on the face...needs a little more light on eyes I think</td>', 'Lighting idea seems good, but not enough light on the face...needs a little more light on eyes I think', '2004-11-18 20:12:43.000000', NULL, 1),
