(1020628, 122184, 18799, '<td valign="top">It''s a little out of focus, I''m afraid.  The reflection is great - the exposure of the rock is much better than it''s counterpart.   5</td>', 'It''s a little out of focus, I''m afraid.  The reflection is great - the exposure of the rock is much better than it''s counterpart.   5', '2004-11-18 20:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
