(1020648, 121058, 27304, '<td valign="top">what a sweet sweet face and lovely eyes! LOVE the expression (how could you not hehe) this is one of those baby pictures I would hang on my wall. <br/> <br/>I don''t know if you cropped it or not, but I would have loved to see all the fingers and a bit more hair...! :) <br/> <br/>Also (after the competition) I would remove the black spot on his nose, thats the only thing that I think would need fixing...<br/> <br/>overall I like this pic gave it an 8 :)</td>', 'what a sweet sweet face and lovely eyes! LOVE the expression (how could you not hehe) this is one of those baby pictures I would hang on my wall.  I don''t know if you cropped it or not, but I would have loved to see all the fingers and a bit more hair...! :)  Also (after the competition) I would remove the black spot on his nose, thats the only thing that I think would need fixing... overall I like this pic gave it an 8 :)', '2004-11-18 20:23:19.000000', NULL, 1),
