(1020650, 121313, 18799, '<td valign="top">Sharpness and composition are very good.  Personally, I would have liked to have seen more detail in the dark areas.  5</td>', 'Sharpness and composition are very good.  Personally, I would have liked to have seen more detail in the dark areas.  5', '2004-11-18 20:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1020651, 122207, 27304, '<td valign="top">Hehe something about this picture really catches my eye. The "wrongness" in the shoot LoL. By that I mean the way we are used to see things. A buissness man in the middle of a big field holding a BALLOON!  I love it...humor...cute :) hehe <br/> <br/>Good job, gave you an 8 :)</td>', 'Hehe something about this picture really catches my eye. The "wrongness" in the shoot LoL. By that I mean the way we are used to see things. A buissness man in the middle of a big field holding a BALLOON!  I love it...humor...cute :) hehe  Good job, gave you an 8 :)', '2004-11-18 20:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1020653, 121500, 18799, '<td valign="top">There needs to be better focus for this to work</td>', 'There needs to be better focus for this to work', '2004-11-18 20:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
