(1020658, 122041, 18799, '<td valign="top">Interestnig action shot, but it should have been in focus.  Plus, the highlights are blown out rendering no details on the face or shirt.</td>', 'Interestnig action shot, but it should have been in focus.  Plus, the highlights are blown out rendering no details on the face or shirt.', '2004-11-18 20:28:41.000000', NULL, 1),
