(1020662, 121883, 18799, '<td valign="top">The post in the foreground is a major flaw, IMO.  I also think the birds are a little soft and could use more contracst to make them "pop"</td>', 'The post in the foreground is a major flaw, IMO.  I also think the birds are a little soft and could use more contracst to make them "pop"', '2004-11-18 20:30:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1020663, 122083, 18799, '<td valign="top">I think the blacks and whites in this photo are great.  I think a photo such as this should either be perfectly straight, or at an extreme angle to work.  This could use some counterclockwise rotation, IMO</td>', 'I think the blacks and whites in this photo are great.  I think a photo such as this should either be perfectly straight, or at an extreme angle to work.  This could use some counterclockwise rotation, IMO', '2004-11-18 20:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
