(1020697, 121767, 18799, '<td valign="top">I like what I can see.  It''s too small and you will suffer for that.   The border, however, is a major distraction for me.  After all that, I give you a 6.  If there were no border and the photo was larger so I could see it beter, maybe an 8 or 9.</td>', 'I like what I can see.  It''s too small and you will suffer for that.   The border, however, is a major distraction for me.  After all that, I give you a 6.  If there were no border and the photo was larger so I could see it beter, maybe an 8 or 9.', '2004-11-18 20:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1020699, 121997, 18799, '<td valign="top">Really noisy.  There are little bright spots (dead pixels in your camera?) that are very distracting.  I''m guessing this is a long exposure?  Compositionally, and emotively, I like it - just can''t get past the other issues.   5</td>', 'Really noisy.  There are little bright spots (dead pixels in your camera?) that are very distracting.  I''m guessing this is a long exposure?  Compositionally, and emotively, I like it - just can''t get past the other issues.   5', '2004-11-18 20:52:49.000000', NULL, 1),
