(1020705, 120708, 18799, '<td valign="top">I don''t get the title, but I like the different textures and light and dark elements.  8</td>', 'I don''t get the title, but I like the different textures and light and dark elements.  8', '2004-11-18 20:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
