(1021210, 121578, 25464, '<td valign="top">This is a great action shot.  A little small, and a maybe cropped a bit tight on the top.  This could have been really great if it had been a little bigger. 8.</td>', 'This is a great action shot.  A little small, and a maybe cropped a bit tight on the top.  This could have been really great if it had been a little bigger. 8.', '2004-11-19 00:12:32.000000', NULL, 1),
