(1021247, 122202, 8891, '<td valign="top">This caught my eye on the first view cause it reminds very much of something one might have seen in a 1950''s TV show. Just so clean and wholesome looking. Cute pup and great expression on the model''s face.  That said, I really wish the fence in the background was straight, but what are you going to do...the fence does catch my eye and leads me back to the subject so it sort of works.</td>', 'This caught my eye on the first view cause it reminds very much of something one might have seen in a 1950''s TV show. Just so clean and wholesome looking. Cute pup and great expression on the model''s face.  That said, I really wish the fence in the background was straight, but what are you going to do...the fence does catch my eye and leads me back to the subject so it sort of works.', '2004-11-19 00:25:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021248, 121049, 25464, '<td valign="top">Great use of a photo to sell a message or concept.  I don''t know how well it will do with the masses, but what you have done here takes true talent. 8.</td>', 'Great use of a photo to sell a message or concept.  I don''t know how well it will do with the masses, but what you have done here takes true talent. 8.', '2004-11-19 00:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
