(1021279, 121929, 28771, '<td valign="top">That looks like the scene from willow when mad martigan splits off from willow and megosh. But of course they later reunite to fight the forces of beth morda at that castle and kill that kill dragon thingy. Then in a high tower of beth morda''s castle willow, beth morda''s daughter, and that old lady witch fight for the soul of baby elora denum, which of course leads to willow performing an ameteur magic trick, leading beth morda to believe he had really transported the baby to another demension, and they she flipps out and spills the blood on herself and dies. willow goes home to a heroes welcome, fade to black with some mystical music and midgets dancing. the end.  <br/> <br/> Great atmosphere on this photo, btw.</td>', 'That looks like the scene from willow when mad martigan splits off from willow and megosh. But of course they later reunite to fight the forces of beth morda at that castle and kill that kill dragon thingy. Then in a high tower of beth morda''s castle willow, beth morda''s daughter, and that old lady witch fight for the soul of baby elora denum, which of course leads to willow performing an ameteur magic trick, leading beth morda to believe he had really transported the baby to another demension, and they she flipps out and spills the blood on herself and dies. willow goes home to a heroes welcome, fade to black with some mystical music and midgets dancing. the end.    Great atmosphere on this photo, btw.', '2004-11-19 00:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021281, 121469, 28629, '<td valign="top">This is one great photo.</td>', 'This is one great photo.', '2004-11-19 00:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021282, 121348, 28771, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of Apollo 13 when Tom Hanks and all those other dudes get trapped in space for awhile, but using their wits and resourcefulness are able to fashion crude devices to keep themselves alive while the great minds back in Houston work out ways they can return to earth on limited fuel.<br/> <br/>I love how the sky is dark but I can still see clouds. And very good details on the rocket. My childhood dream was to work for Nasa and get in tight with all those scientific types but I never had the math grades. And that''s why I always feel a little regretful when I watch the old classics like Space Camp, ET, and flight of the Navigator. Well see ya :)<br/></td>', 'Reminds me of Apollo 13 when Tom Hanks and all those other dudes get trapped in space for awhile, but using their wits and resourcefulness are able to fashion crude devices to keep themselves alive while the great minds back in Houston work out ways they can return to earth on limited fuel. I love how the sky is dark but I can still see clouds. And very good details on the rocket. My childhood dream was to work for Nasa and get in tight with all those scientific types but I never had the math grades. And that''s why I always feel a little regretful when I watch the old classics like Space Camp, ET, and flight of the Navigator. Well see ya :)', '2004-11-19 00:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021285, 121481, 28629, '<td valign="top">its just too dark.</td>', 'its just too dark.', '2004-11-19 00:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021287, 121672, 28771, '<td valign="top">Great picture. Astonding level of detail to go with a great expression.  Reminds me of this guy that works in a 711 near where I live. Every time I go into to buy a snapple or somthing hge''s like "you are a nice man" so yeah he''s kinda a wierd old guy but sometimes he lets me get stuff for free so I like to think of him as a crazy old uncle or second grandfather. I''ll probably get him a Christmas card, I''ll also get on for the crossing guard and that cute girl that works the window at Wendys.<br/></td>', 'Great picture. Astonding level of detail to go with a great expression.  Reminds me of this guy that works in a 711 near where I live. Every time I go into to buy a snapple or somthing hge''s like "you are a nice man" so yeah he''s kinda a wierd old guy but sometimes he lets me get stuff for free so I like to think of him as a crazy old uncle or second grandfather. I''ll probably get him a Christmas card, I''ll also get on for the crossing guard and that cute girl that works the window at Wendys.', '2004-11-19 00:49:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021288, 121933, 28771, '<td valign="top">The water in this photo is not terribly attractive, nor is the tank in hthe background. But you know there is a park in my town that looks pretty similar. I remmeber it weel because when I was around ten or so my friends and I would ride bikes around that area, skipping stones across the dirty pond, fishing and generally doing the things that young kids like to do. Well thats just my memory of the place that looks similar to this picture. I give it a 5.</td>', 'The water in this photo is not terribly attractive, nor is the tank in hthe background. But you know there is a park in my town that looks pretty similar. I remmeber it weel because when I was around ten or so my friends and I would ride bikes around that area, skipping stones across the dirty pond, fishing and generally doing the things that young kids like to do. Well thats just my memory of the place that looks similar to this picture. I give it a 5.', '2004-11-19 00:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
