(1021365, 121881, 28771, '<td valign="top">I like it. Looks the an element of foreshadowing in some mystery. Hmm, I wonder how this bench will factor in? I what I thought. It would be cool if there was actually a lower perspective, someone (an old lady preferrably) sitting on the bench and  a white light shining from above as the alien spaceship prepares to beam her up. I give this one a seven, because this is no ordinary park bench. This bench tells a story, literally.</td>', 'I like it. Looks the an element of foreshadowing in some mystery. Hmm, I wonder how this bench will factor in? I what I thought. It would be cool if there was actually a lower perspective, someone (an old lady preferrably) sitting on the bench and  a white light shining from above as the alien spaceship prepares to beam her up. I give this one a seven, because this is no ordinary park bench. This bench tells a story, literally.', '2004-11-19 01:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
