(1021394, 121640, 22384, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting, the framing and the contrast of the smooth texture of her skin and the fabric on her shoulder. I don''t feel that you captured any emotion from your subject. I think when an artist captures and is able to communicate the emotion of a subject, it makes a photograph transcend the 2-dimensional limits of the frame. That, for me, is the only thing that would make this photo better.</td>', 'I like the lighting, the framing and the contrast of the smooth texture of her skin and the fabric on her shoulder. I don''t feel that you captured any emotion from your subject. I think when an artist captures and is able to communicate the emotion of a subject, it makes a photograph transcend the 2-dimensional limits of the frame. That, for me, is the only thing that would make this photo better.', '2004-11-19 01:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021397, 120473, 22479, '<td valign="top">This works well in B&amp;W. Excellent contrast, detail, with minimal blown highlights.</td>', 'This works well in B&W. Excellent contrast, detail, with minimal blown highlights.', '2004-11-19 01:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021398, 122114, 22384, '<td valign="top">Nice value range. The cropping/framing of this photo makes me uneasy. The wooden bench hitting at "eye level" of your stuffed subject, intrudes and seems awkward to me. Interesting combination of textures.</td>', 'Nice value range. The cropping/framing of this photo makes me uneasy. The wooden bench hitting at "eye level" of your stuffed subject, intrudes and seems awkward to me. Interesting combination of textures.', '2004-11-19 01:44:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021400, 121224, 22384, '<td valign="top">This photo is not comfortable for me. My eye can''t find the focal point the the viewer''s mind naturally seeks.</td>', 'This photo is not comfortable for me. My eye can''t find the focal point the the viewer''s mind naturally seeks.', '2004-11-19 01:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021404, 121175, 22384, '<td valign="top">Although your subject is almost "dead center" of your piece, I like it and think it works here. I would like to see more contrast in the value range. Maybe if your subject weren''t wearing black it would make the photo more striking. Again, I find the risk you took with the framing to have worked well here. Sometimes breaking the rules of composition works well.</td>', 'Although your subject is almost "dead center" of your piece, I like it and think it works here. I would like to see more contrast in the value range. Maybe if your subject weren''t wearing black it would make the photo more striking. Again, I find the risk you took with the framing to have worked well here. Sometimes breaking the rules of composition works well.', '2004-11-19 01:49:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021406, 121104, 22479, '<td valign="top">Black and white...and blue? This almost conforms to the rules of this challenge.<br/> <br/>In combination with a lackluster composition, I cannot rate this very highly. Sorry.</td>', 'Black and white...and blue? This almost conforms to the rules of this challenge. In combination with a lackluster composition, I cannot rate this very highly. Sorry.', '2004-11-19 01:54:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021407, 121744, 22479, '<td valign="top">Nice concept but this is not a B&amp;W photo in the strictest sense. Sorry.</td>', 'Nice concept but this is not a B&W photo in the strictest sense. Sorry.', '2004-11-19 01:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021409, 121993, 22479, '<td valign="top">I think I understand what you''re trying to show here. However, on photographic merits, there is much to be desired...focus is soft, the composition is unimaginative, and lighting is poor. The date stamp feature should be turned off on your future submissions. Better luck next time.</td>', 'I think I understand what you''re trying to show here. However, on photographic merits, there is much to be desired...focus is soft, the composition is unimaginative, and lighting is poor. The date stamp feature should be turned off on your future submissions. Better luck next time.', '2004-11-19 01:57:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021410, 121059, 22479, '<td valign="top">Almost B&amp;W. A quick desaturation with your favorite image editor would have improved this entry.</td>', 'Almost B&W. A quick desaturation with your favorite image editor would have improved this entry.', '2004-11-19 01:58:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021411, 122064, 22479, '<td valign="top">The lighting, detail, focus, exposure, and framing is good. Her pose is rather unnatural and quite frightening, however.</td>', 'The lighting, detail, focus, exposure, and framing is good. Her pose is rather unnatural and quite frightening, however.', '2004-11-19 02:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021412, 121765, 22479, '<td valign="top">Not quite sure what to make of this photograph, since nothing is in focus. I think I see a pair of trees. Overall, the lack of focus makes this an unacceptable entry. Sorry.</td>', 'Not quite sure what to make of this photograph, since nothing is in focus. I think I see a pair of trees. Overall, the lack of focus makes this an unacceptable entry. Sorry.', '2004-11-19 02:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021413, 120727, 22479, '<td valign="top">Far too much grain. Subject is underexposed.</td>', 'Far too much grain. Subject is underexposed.', '2004-11-19 02:04:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021415, 122209, 22479, '<td valign="top">Focus is soft, and the border is poorly constructed. You toned this picture, which I feel disqualifies it over any other factor. Sorry.</td>', 'Focus is soft, and the border is poorly constructed. You toned this picture, which I feel disqualifies it over any other factor. Sorry.', '2004-11-19 02:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021417, 120606, 22479, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting. Model appears to be quite young. Overall too subdued mood.</td>', 'Nice lighting. Model appears to be quite young. Overall too subdued mood.', '2004-11-19 02:08:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021419, 121747, 22479, '<td valign="top">Good shot, but this is not black and white. A quick desaturation would have improved this immensely.</td>', 'Good shot, but this is not black and white. A quick desaturation would have improved this immensely.', '2004-11-19 02:09:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021422, 121525, 22479, '<td valign="top">Not quite sure what you are trying to portray, in relation to your caption. Too small, and overall unimaginative. You focused well, on a positive note.</td>', 'Not quite sure what you are trying to portray, in relation to your caption. Too small, and overall unimaginative. You focused well, on a positive note.', '2004-11-19 02:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021423, 120674, 22479, '<td valign="top">Processed far too heavily.</td>', 'Processed far too heavily.', '2004-11-19 02:13:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021426, 121148, 25623, '<td valign="top">This really has an "old world" feel to it!</td>', 'This really has an "old world" feel to it!', '2004-11-19 02:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021427, 121734, 25623, '<td valign="top">The angle killed it for me...</td>', 'The angle killed it for me...', '2004-11-19 02:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021429, 122195, 25623, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you have a hundred of this comment....  BLACK &amp; WHITE not green...</td>', 'I''m sure you have a hundred of this comment....  BLACK & WHITE not green...', '2004-11-19 02:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021432, 121578, 29241, '<td valign="top">Great photo - 10</td>', 'Great photo - 10', '2004-11-19 02:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021433, 122019, 29241, '<td valign="top">Very Nice!</td>', 'Very Nice!', '2004-11-19 02:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021437, 121033, 23478, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, a solid background would have helped make this a more striking foto.</td>', 'Nice photo, a solid background would have helped make this a more striking foto.', '2004-11-19 02:47:35.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1021441, 122082, 23478, '<td valign="top">This is a great idea, but this just seems a bit OOF.</td>', 'This is a great idea, but this just seems a bit OOF.', '2004-11-19 02:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021443, 121538, 23478, '<td valign="top">This looks like a reflection and is a very interesting foto, but the image seems a bit confusing.</td>', 'This looks like a reflection and is a very interesting foto, but the image seems a bit confusing.', '2004-11-19 02:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021444, 122088, 23478, '<td valign="top">Cute photo, the birds seem a bit OOF and the water is in focus.  Using a wider apeture can help provide a deeper DOF in a situation like this.</td>', 'Cute photo, the birds seem a bit OOF and the water is in focus.  Using a wider apeture can help provide a deeper DOF in a situation like this.', '2004-11-19 02:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021447, 122199, 23478, '<td valign="top">Very nice detail on the building.  I like the sweeping effect created by this angle.</td>', 'Very nice detail on the building.  I like the sweeping effect created by this angle.', '2004-11-19 02:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021448, 121901, 23478, '<td valign="top">Nice stop action, this is a great photo expression what kids love to do.  The photo may have benefitted from a tighter crop on the subject since there is nothing of interest or import in the background.</td>', 'Nice stop action, this is a great photo expression what kids love to do.  The photo may have benefitted from a tighter crop on the subject since there is nothing of interest or import in the background.', '2004-11-19 03:01:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021449, 121871, 23478, '<td valign="top">This would have benefitted from being a larger size. the detail and contrast is mostly lost at this smaller size.</td>', 'This would have benefitted from being a larger size. the detail and contrast is mostly lost at this smaller size.', '2004-11-19 03:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021451, 121890, 23478, '<td valign="top">The granduer projected by this angle is very impressive.  I like the skyline in the background also.</td>', 'The granduer projected by this angle is very impressive.  I like the skyline in the background also.', '2004-11-19 03:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021453, 120444, 23478, '<td valign="top">The light, shadows, and contrast are very nicely done.  They are sharp and clear without being overwhelming.  8.</td>', 'The light, shadows, and contrast are very nicely done.  They are sharp and clear without being overwhelming.  8.', '2004-11-19 03:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021454, 122184, 23478, '<td valign="top">Great shot, the reflection is perfect.</td>', 'Great shot, the reflection is perfect.', '2004-11-19 03:06:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021456, 121827, 23478, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo of the statue, the background and strong light hightlight the subject very well.</td>', 'Excellent photo of the statue, the background and strong light hightlight the subject very well.', '2004-11-19 03:07:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021458, 121541, 23478, '<td valign="top">Well done multiple exposure (I assume).  The bursting foireworks and the silouetted foreground work well together.</td>', 'Well done multiple exposure (I assume).  The bursting foireworks and the silouetted foreground work well together.', '2004-11-19 03:08:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021459, 121976, 28196, '<td valign="top">Overexposed and too distracting background. It would have worked much better without the flash.</td>', 'Overexposed and too distracting background. It would have worked much better without the flash.', '2004-11-19 03:09:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021460, 121347, 23478, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, the detail works well with the lighting.</td>', 'Nice photo, the detail works well with the lighting.', '2004-11-19 03:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021462, 122198, 23478, '<td valign="top">Nice macro.  The crop here works well with this image.</td>', 'Nice macro.  The crop here works well with this image.', '2004-11-19 03:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021463, 122170, 23478, '<td valign="top">Great photo, I like the effect of the mist and light.  The shadows create interest.</td>', 'Great photo, I like the effect of the mist and light.  The shadows create interest.', '2004-11-19 03:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021464, 121245, 28196, '<td valign="top">Just beautiful. Great composition and superb contrast. Is there a person fishing beneath this small house or I''m hallucinating?</td>', 'Just beautiful. Great composition and superb contrast. Is there a person fishing beneath this small house or I''m hallucinating?', '2004-11-19 03:15:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021465, 121148, 23478, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo, the greys created by the mist are captivating.</td>', 'Very nice photo, the greys created by the mist are captivating.', '2004-11-19 03:15:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021466, 121091, 23478, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo, maybe could have removed whatever was on the corner of the fireplace mantle.  The lighting is good and the texture of the walls creates subtle shadows.  Well done.</td>', 'Interesting photo, maybe could have removed whatever was on the corner of the fireplace mantle.  The lighting is good and the texture of the walls creates subtle shadows.  Well done.', '2004-11-19 03:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021467, 122194, 28196, '<td valign="top">Great photo. Little more of his leg would be better to show his relaxed pose - now there is some unnatural tension...</td>', 'Great photo. Little more of his leg would be better to show his relaxed pose - now there is some unnatural tension...', '2004-11-19 03:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021468, 121703, 28196, '<td valign="top">Flash from it''s worst side, no composition and idealess... Is there any particular reason why you have sent this one?</td>', 'Flash from it''s worst side, no composition and idealess... Is there any particular reason why you have sent this one?', '2004-11-19 03:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021470, 121564, 28196, '<td valign="top">Great composition, subtle sepia suits very well...</td>', 'Great composition, subtle sepia suits very well...', '2004-11-19 03:25:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021472, 120737, 28196, '<td valign="top">Nice. Overexposed hat is bit distracting though, and I see no perticular reason for so much space below the chin.</td>', 'Nice. Overexposed hat is bit distracting though, and I see no perticular reason for so much space below the chin.', '2004-11-19 03:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021473, 121636, 23478, '<td valign="top">Great photo, the background and lighting provide an interesting perspective.</td>', 'Great photo, the background and lighting provide an interesting perspective.', '2004-11-19 03:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021476, 121505, 23478, '<td valign="top">This photo is very good. The backlighting and facial expression are winners.</td>', 'This photo is very good. The backlighting and facial expression are winners.', '2004-11-19 03:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021477, 120830, 28875, '<td valign="top">I did the same thing on my last challenge, to small!</td>', 'I did the same thing on my last challenge, to small!', '2004-11-19 03:34:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021479, 121242, 23478, '<td valign="top">Good lighting and background, I really like the effect created by the varoius shades of grey.</td>', 'Good lighting and background, I really like the effect created by the varoius shades of grey.', '2004-11-19 03:35:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021481, 121610, 23478, '<td valign="top">Great candid photo, I like the genuine expressions.  Maybe crop it a bit more at the top.  8.</td>', 'Great candid photo, I like the genuine expressions.  Maybe crop it a bit more at the top.  8.', '2004-11-19 03:36:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021482, 121526, 28875, '<td valign="top">It''s to small, I did the same thing last time, you will get a low score.</td>', 'It''s to small, I did the same thing last time, you will get a low score.', '2004-11-19 03:37:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021485, 121340, 28875, '<td valign="top">Sorry, out of focus!</td>', 'Sorry, out of focus!', '2004-11-19 03:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021487, 121155, 28875, '<td valign="top">I like the Photo, but, it''s out of focus!</td>', 'I like the Photo, but, it''s out of focus!', '2004-11-19 03:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021488, 121058, 28875, '<td valign="top">Cheeky, very nice.</td>', 'Cheeky, very nice.', '2004-11-19 03:44:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021489, 121637, 23478, '<td valign="top">I have looked at this photo about five times.  This is on the edge of being a superb photo, the shades and lighting are cool.  I think it may have benefitted from a higher shutter speed to stop the motion of the water a bit better.  In any case, nice photo.</td>', 'I have looked at this photo about five times.  This is on the edge of being a superb photo, the shades and lighting are cool.  I think it may have benefitted from a higher shutter speed to stop the motion of the water a bit better.  In any case, nice photo.', '2004-11-19 03:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021494, 120801, 23478, '<td valign="top">Great photo I like the expression on the boy''s face.  The contrast is very good. 9.</td>', 'Great photo I like the expression on the boy''s face.  The contrast is very good. 9.', '2004-11-19 03:52:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021495, 121546, 23478, '<td valign="top">This is an interestng idea.  It seems OOF and very grainy.</td>', 'This is an interestng idea.  It seems OOF and very grainy.', '2004-11-19 03:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021497, 122053, 23478, '<td valign="top">Nice use of negative space.  The dark ground and the person being clothed in dark clothes helps add impact to this foto.</td>', 'Nice use of negative space.  The dark ground and the person being clothed in dark clothes helps add impact to this foto.', '2004-11-19 03:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021499, 121283, 23478, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot and a good use of B&amp;W.</td>', 'Interesting shot and a good use of B&W.', '2004-11-19 03:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021501, 121481, 28196, '<td valign="top">Very intriguing photo and well composed. It took me a whil ''till I figured that the center part isn''t a shadow but a towel (very nicely done). The only thing that bugs me are the stripes from underware, if shot only 5min later this would have been perfect...</td>', 'Very intriguing photo and well composed. It took me a whil ''till I figured that the center part isn''t a shadow but a towel (very nicely done). The only thing that bugs me are the stripes from underware, if shot only 5min later this would have been perfect...', '2004-11-19 04:02:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021505, 121345, 16046, '<td valign="top">Really cool</td>', 'Really cool', '2004-11-19 04:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021528, 120477, 93, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen this before..  Is this a reshoot, or just another photo from the shoot you did for the framing challenge?  (I do know that it''s different.)   <br/>Anyway, as for the photo itself, it''s a little noisy, and could have used a touch more contrast and clarity on the boat.</td>', 'I''ve seen this before..  Is this a reshoot, or just another photo from the shoot you did for the framing challenge?  (I do know that it''s different.)   Anyway, as for the photo itself, it''s a little noisy, and could have used a touch more contrast and clarity on the boat.', '2004-11-19 04:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021530, 121021, 93, '<td valign="top">The shadow on the eye (not the cage line shadows, which I believe are probably intentional), is quite distracting for me.  Other than that, it''s quite a nice photograph.</td>', 'The shadow on the eye (not the cage line shadows, which I believe are probably intentional), is quite distracting for me.  Other than that, it''s quite a nice photograph.', '2004-11-19 04:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021531, 121941, 93, '<td valign="top">Just not in focus enough for my tastes.  I really like the overall look and feel though. When I attempt this type of photography, it never *ever* looks even half this good.</td>', 'Just not in focus enough for my tastes.  I really like the overall look and feel though. When I attempt this type of photography, it never *ever* looks even half this good.', '2004-11-19 04:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021532, 121366, 93, '<td valign="top">yuck. lol<br/>Interesting subject.  I would have liked to have seen more context though.  Something to connect it to the fishing life?</td>', 'yuck. lolInteresting subject.  I would have liked to have seen more context though.  Something to connect it to the fishing life?', '2004-11-19 04:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021534, 121901, 93, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully captured candid image. A touch over-exposed.</td>', 'Wonderfully captured candid image. A touch over-exposed.', '2004-11-19 04:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021536, 121623, 93, '<td valign="top">Really over-exposed on the ball.   Metallic-type objects like that are notoriously hard to photograph.  Shooting from lower down, at a different angle, would probably have helped greatly.</td>', 'Really over-exposed on the ball.   Metallic-type objects like that are notoriously hard to photograph.  Shooting from lower down, at a different angle, would probably have helped greatly.', '2004-11-19 04:59:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021537, 120635, 93, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective.  Nice textures, but a little over-exposed I think.</td>', 'Interesting perspective.  Nice textures, but a little over-exposed I think.', '2004-11-19 04:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021538, 121735, 93, '<td valign="top">Nicely backlit.  Did you use fill flash?  That or a reflector could have helped get more light and detail into her face and eyes.</td>', 'Nicely backlit.  Did you use fill flash?  That or a reflector could have helped get more light and detail into her face and eyes.', '2004-11-19 05:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021540, 122113, 93, '<td valign="top">Nice exposure on this long exposure shot.  I know from experience how hard it is to do this in B&amp;W.</td>', 'Nice exposure on this long exposure shot.  I know from experience how hard it is to do this in B&W.', '2004-11-19 05:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021542, 122047, 93, '<td valign="top">Nice and simple. I like that you''ve minimized the shadow.</td>', 'Nice and simple. I like that you''ve minimized the shadow.', '2004-11-19 05:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021544, 121668, 93, '<td valign="top">What an amazing tonal range on this.  The lighting and exposure are simply wonderful. Good job.</td>', 'What an amazing tonal range on this.  The lighting and exposure are simply wonderful. Good job.', '2004-11-19 05:03:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021546, 121457, 93, '<td valign="top">I *love* how the background looks.. that in itself would have been a worthy photograph.  However, the foreground is just a little too dark and uninteresting, and takes away from the rest of it for me.  The silhouette of the tree on the left breaks the beauty of the misty hills.</td>', 'I *love* how the background looks.. that in itself would have been a worthy photograph.  However, the foreground is just a little too dark and uninteresting, and takes away from the rest of it for me.  The silhouette of the tree on the left breaks the beauty of the misty hills.', '2004-11-19 05:04:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021549, 121791, 27482, '<td valign="top">Just way way way too much contrast for me.  Personally I would almost call this digital art more than a photograph but because of that I believe this would probably do well at an art exhibit.</td>', 'Just way way way too much contrast for me.  Personally I would almost call this digital art more than a photograph but because of that I believe this would probably do well at an art exhibit.', '2004-11-19 05:08:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021552, 122015, 93, '<td valign="top">Why can''t I ever make simple shadows look this interesting? :)</td>', 'Why can''t I ever make simple shadows look this interesting? :)', '2004-11-19 05:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021553, 122188, 93, '<td valign="top">very nice capture.  For a minute I thought you actually added that text. haha.<br/> <br/>I''m a little put off by the amount of space at the bottom, but it''s really a nice photograph to look at. I''d like to see this one in color, as well.</td>', 'very nice capture.  For a minute I thought you actually added that text. haha. I''m a little put off by the amount of space at the bottom, but it''s really a nice photograph to look at. I''d like to see this one in color, as well.', '2004-11-19 05:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021567, 120350, 27482, '<td valign="top">You are probably going somewhere with this image but I just don´t plain get it.  All I see is a silhouette of a figure and everything out of focus and also see lots of artefacts so the quality is poor too boost so it´s very hard not to give this a very ver low rating, wich is exactly what I did.  No offense intended, I just personally hate it when people rate low and don´t give a reason as to why.</td>', 'You are probably going somewhere with this image but I just don´t plain get it.  All I see is a silhouette of a figure and everything out of focus and also see lots of artefacts so the quality is poor too boost so it´s very hard not to give this a very ver low rating, wich is exactly what I did.  No offense intended, I just personally hate it when people rate low and don´t give a reason as to why.', '2004-11-19 05:24:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021571, 121767, 93, '<td valign="top">a little too small, and a little dark.</td>', 'a little too small, and a little dark.', '2004-11-19 05:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021572, 120725, 93, '<td valign="top">HAHAHAHA.. I love it.</td>', 'HAHAHAHA.. I love it.', '2004-11-19 05:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021573, 121772, 93, '<td valign="top">wow.  Simplicity, when done well, always pulls a high vote from me.  Nice job, I really like looking at this.</td>', 'wow.  Simplicity, when done well, always pulls a high vote from me.  Nice job, I really like looking at this.', '2004-11-19 05:29:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021575, 121020, 93, '<td valign="top">I don''t really like the lens flare from the lamp, but other than that, it''s a nice capture.</td>', 'I don''t really like the lens flare from the lamp, but other than that, it''s a nice capture.', '2004-11-19 05:30:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021578, 120636, 93, '<td valign="top">interesting.  Definitely a unique vantage point.  Could have used a touch more clarity and a little less noise, but I''ll give you the kudos for imagination.</td>', 'interesting.  Definitely a unique vantage point.  Could have used a touch more clarity and a little less noise, but I''ll give you the kudos for imagination.', '2004-11-19 05:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021581, 120578, 93, '<td valign="top">A nice attempt with nude portraiture.  Lighting is the weak point here, I believe.  Too much of your model is in shadow, and the knee, being blown out, is far too distracting.   I''d have loved to have seen much more detail and light on the form of the body.  As it is, I''m just left wanting.</td>', 'A nice attempt with nude portraiture.  Lighting is the weak point here, I believe.  Too much of your model is in shadow, and the knee, being blown out, is far too distracting.   I''d have loved to have seen much more detail and light on the form of the body.  As it is, I''m just left wanting.', '2004-11-19 05:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021584, 121610, 93, '<td valign="top">This has a very gentle and nostalgic feel.  Good job.</td>', 'This has a very gentle and nostalgic feel.  Good job.', '2004-11-19 05:38:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021587, 121595, 93, '<td valign="top">Very interesting, and a nice capture.  The only flaw is the glare in the glass, which, I know, is impossible to manage with any decency with frontal lighting.</td>', 'Very interesting, and a nice capture.  The only flaw is the glare in the glass, which, I know, is impossible to manage with any decency with frontal lighting.', '2004-11-19 05:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
