(1021648, 120985, 6630, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo.  I love the contrast and the subject is in fact very suited for black and white.  The spider web is a nice touch.  I like the shallow DOF too.  Good luck.<br/>June</td>', 'This is a great photo.  I love the contrast and the subject is in fact very suited for black and white.  The spider web is a nice touch.  I like the shallow DOF too.  Good luck.June', '2004-11-19 06:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021650, 121761, 6630, '<td valign="top">I am a sucker for forest pictures, and while I always said that nature pictures are better in color, this proves me wrong.  I love it.  It has great contrast.  Best of luck.<br/>June</td>', 'I am a sucker for forest pictures, and while I always said that nature pictures are better in color, this proves me wrong.  I love it.  It has great contrast.  Best of luck.June', '2004-11-19 06:31:55.000000', NULL, 1),
