(1021783, 121823, 25742, '<td valign="top">to be honest I find this subject very boring. from a technical point of view there are a few things I''d like to mention (not that I''m anything more than a novice at this): slight halo-ing around edges (esp on staples) suggest too much sharpening (USM). the shadow are both too strong and not sharp enough</td>', 'to be honest I find this subject very boring. from a technical point of view there are a few things I''d like to mention (not that I''m anything more than a novice at this): slight halo-ing around edges (esp on staples) suggest too much sharpening (USM). the shadow are both too strong and not sharp enough', '2004-11-19 08:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
