(1021854, 122174, 8891, '<td valign="top">This really made an impression on me during my first walk through. 2 little nits: It is pretty straight but it appears to be a little off at the top which could be fixed with a very slight CCW rotation, or, since it is so slight, a small crop and I would have centered it more. Those are outweighed for me by the abstractness and great tones and details of the wood grain.  Good Luck.</td>', 'This really made an impression on me during my first walk through. 2 little nits: It is pretty straight but it appears to be a little off at the top which could be fixed with a very slight CCW rotation, or, since it is so slight, a small crop and I would have centered it more. Those are outweighed for me by the abstractness and great tones and details of the wood grain.  Good Luck.', '2004-11-19 09:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
