(1021863, 121269, 19010, '<td valign="top">Great shades and textures. This is one of my favorites of the challenge. I only see a few things I would like to have seen done differently, and those are just a matter of personal taste. Photrgaphicly I see no flaws. Good lighting, Great focus, good contrast and balance. I "personaly" would like to have seen the pants made of denim. I feel this would have added a nice texture that you could have easily acoplished in this lighting. Next I would like to have see a little  of the models face. And last of all I think the polka dots on the bra are a little akward. But like I said thats just a matter of personal taste. Great shot. I look forward to seeing more like this.</td>', 'Great shades and textures. This is one of my favorites of the challenge. I only see a few things I would like to have seen done differently, and those are just a matter of personal taste. Photrgaphicly I see no flaws. Good lighting, Great focus, good contrast and balance. I "personaly" would like to have seen the pants made of denim. I feel this would have added a nice texture that you could have easily acoplished in this lighting. Next I would like to have see a little  of the models face. And last of all I think the polka dots on the bra are a little akward. But like I said thats just a matter of personal taste. Great shot. I look forward to seeing more like this.', '2004-11-19 09:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
