(1021933, 121822, 26526, '<td valign="top">I really like how this photograph cropped. Excellent detail, focus just on the eyes. Very well done.</td>', 'I really like how this photograph cropped. Excellent detail, focus just on the eyes. Very well done.', '2004-11-19 10:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021934, 121268, 2170, '<td valign="top">would be more effective w/o the stand</td>', 'would be more effective w/o the stand', '2004-11-19 10:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021936, 121771, 26526, '<td valign="top">Superb detail, sharp focus. Like the lines and use of shadows.  I like this photograph tilted. Usually I don''t like photos that are tilted but the composition, cropping, you used for this one really works! Great in b&amp;w.</td>', 'Superb detail, sharp focus. Like the lines and use of shadows.  I like this photograph tilted. Usually I don''t like photos that are tilted but the composition, cropping, you used for this one really works! Great in b&w.', '2004-11-19 10:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021937, 120812, 26526, '<td valign="top">Lovely b&amp;w portrait. Perfect lighting on the face. I like the dark background.</td>', 'Lovely b&w portrait. Perfect lighting on the face. I like the dark background.', '2004-11-19 10:48:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021942, 121671, 26526, '<td valign="top">A great b&amp;w photograph. I would call it a busy photo, but the dog''s markings blend in perfectly with the background. Makes it more interesting than a solid background. Title fits.</td>', 'A great b&w photograph. I would call it a busy photo, but the dog''s markings blend in perfectly with the background. Makes it more interesting than a solid background. Title fits.', '2004-11-19 10:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021949, 121155, 4226, '<td valign="top">I think  you took this photo from the first view point...this might have been better if you took it from a  littler higher point, plus a little different angle, which you find it furhter up the road ... I wanted to get this one, but then thought it looks better in color .... nice capture though</td>', 'I think  you took this photo from the first view point...this might have been better if you took it from a  littler higher point, plus a little different angle, which you find it furhter up the road ... I wanted to get this one, but then thought it looks better in color .... nice capture though', '2004-11-19 10:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021950, 121460, 26526, '<td valign="top">A really nice photograph in b&amp;w. I like the composition, draws one eye to the windmill in the background. Slightly oversharpened, just my opinion. Well done!</td>', 'A really nice photograph in b&w. I like the composition, draws one eye to the windmill in the background. Slightly oversharpened, just my opinion. Well done!', '2004-11-19 10:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021957, 121469, 26526, '<td valign="top">Like the composition, the blind lines across the face. A great brooding portrait in b&amp;w.</td>', 'Like the composition, the blind lines across the face. A great brooding portrait in b&w.', '2004-11-19 11:02:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021959, 121844, 26526, '<td valign="top">Everything about this photograph is well done. Like the composition, the lighting, and the focus.</td>', 'Everything about this photograph is well done. Like the composition, the lighting, and the focus.', '2004-11-19 11:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021981, 122171, 6630, '<td valign="top">I think this picture needs a little more contrast.</td>', 'I think this picture needs a little more contrast.', '2004-11-19 11:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021984, 120713, 6630, '<td valign="top">This is a nice picture, I like the arches.  Maybe a little more contrast would be give it a kick.</td>', 'This is a nice picture, I like the arches.  Maybe a little more contrast would be give it a kick.', '2004-11-19 11:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021991, 121492, 6630, '<td valign="top">There''s lack of contrast in this picture.  It could benefit from some.</td>', 'There''s lack of contrast in this picture.  It could benefit from some.', '2004-11-19 11:23:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021993, 121453, 6630, '<td valign="top">Nice picture.  I think it would look better if it had a more contrast.<br/>June</td>', 'Nice picture.  I think it would look better if it had a more contrast.June', '2004-11-19 11:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021998, 121148, 6630, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of this photograph.  I think cropping some of the negative space on top would help as well as adding contrast and some sharpness, it is a little too Neat Imaged, or whatever noise reduction program you use, for me.<br/>June</td>', 'I like the idea of this photograph.  I think cropping some of the negative space on top would help as well as adding contrast and some sharpness, it is a little too Neat Imaged, or whatever noise reduction program you use, for me.June', '2004-11-19 11:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1021999, 120848, 29362, '<td valign="top">that''s very nice, maybe a quarter crop off the bottom would slightly improve it.</td>', 'that''s very nice, maybe a quarter crop off the bottom would slightly improve it.', '2004-11-19 11:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022000, 120727, 6630, '<td valign="top">More noise than it needs.</td>', 'More noise than it needs.', '2004-11-19 11:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022003, 121222, 19010, '<td valign="top">Well I like it. It''s the best lanscape shot of the challenge IMO. I unfortunately just havn''t found a lanscape shot in B&amp;W that I didn''t think would look better in color. (my own included). But this one has good focus and shadows. It is also interesting to look at.</td>', 'Well I like it. It''s the best lanscape shot of the challenge IMO. I unfortunately just havn''t found a lanscape shot in B&W that I didn''t think would look better in color. (my own included). But this one has good focus and shadows. It is also interesting to look at.', '2004-11-19 11:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022004, 121745, 29362, '<td valign="top">like the space you left on the right, nicely litfor the moody eyes.</td>', 'like the space you left on the right, nicely litfor the moody eyes.', '2004-11-19 11:29:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022006, 122151, 6630, '<td valign="top">This is very nice, but I''ve commented a lot on this challenge, I think it could benefit from a little more contrast.   The horizon is also tillted.</td>', 'This is very nice, but I''ve commented a lot on this challenge, I think it could benefit from a little more contrast.   The horizon is also tillted.', '2004-11-19 11:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022013, 121879, 23312, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast of the building and the sky - and the details in the bricks - good job!</td>', 'I like the contrast of the building and the sky - and the details in the bricks - good job!', '2004-11-19 11:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022015, 121487, 3273, '<td valign="top">This shot is really quite eerie.  The softness and tones are great.  I like this a lot!</td>', 'This shot is really quite eerie.  The softness and tones are great.  I like this a lot!', '2004-11-19 11:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022017, 122188, 28337, '<td valign="top">the person at the end seems to be out of place a bit.</td>', 'the person at the end seems to be out of place a bit.', '2004-11-19 11:41:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022018, 120763, 28337, '<td valign="top">Awesome! I love the contrasts and the shape... This is what a b/w is all about</td>', 'Awesome! I love the contrasts and the shape... This is what a b/w is all about', '2004-11-19 11:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022021, 120647, 28337, '<td valign="top">the background could have been better</td>', 'the background could have been better', '2004-11-19 11:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022025, 121823, 23312, '<td valign="top">I like the simple, geometric layout and the side lighting.  For some reason the paperclips being in the shadow of the staples really bothers me - it seems to break the "rules" of the rest of the layout.</td>', 'I like the simple, geometric layout and the side lighting.  For some reason the paperclips being in the shadow of the staples really bothers me - it seems to break the "rules" of the rest of the layout.', '2004-11-19 11:48:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022029, 122191, 23312, '<td valign="top">I like the expression - I''m not so sure about the stuff on either side - I think that the blur tends to be a barrier for the eye to get to the person.  Maybe you could have opened up a 1/2 stop or so too.</td>', 'I like the expression - I''m not so sure about the stuff on either side - I think that the blur tends to be a barrier for the eye to get to the person.  Maybe you could have opened up a 1/2 stop or so too.', '2004-11-19 11:56:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022032, 121791, 25024, '<td valign="top">Fabulous image - it would have been even better if the additional pixels could have been eliminated particularly those on the outer edges  of the hands but its still gorgeous - weel done.</td>', 'Fabulous image - it would have been even better if the additional pixels could have been eliminated particularly those on the outer edges  of the hands but its still gorgeous - weel done.', '2004-11-19 11:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022035, 122207, 14202, '<td valign="top">This photo really works for me...the lighting, tones and the perfect expression on the models face...Priceless.  Well done</td>', 'This photo really works for me...the lighting, tones and the perfect expression on the models face...Priceless.  Well done', '2004-11-19 12:00:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022037, 121647, 23312, '<td valign="top">I think the frost should be a bit brighter - interesting composition and detail but a bit too dull grey.</td>', 'I think the frost should be a bit brighter - interesting composition and detail but a bit too dull grey.', '2004-11-19 12:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022038, 121883, 28540, '<td valign="top">I really like the highlighting in the background. It makes the picture seem "jungley."</td>', 'I really like the highlighting in the background. It makes the picture seem "jungley."', '2004-11-19 12:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022039, 122059, 28540, '<td valign="top">Nice concept, I really like the contrast. The movement of the book is a little distracting.</td>', 'Nice concept, I really like the contrast. The movement of the book is a little distracting.', '2004-11-19 12:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022041, 122183, 28540, '<td valign="top">what a neat idea! I haven''t grasped the creative concept part of photography yet, thanks for the inspiration =) I think I would substitute a yellow crayon for the green one though, since red, blue, and yellow are the three primary colors.</td>', 'what a neat idea! I haven''t grasped the creative concept part of photography yet, thanks for the inspiration =) I think I would substitute a yellow crayon for the green one though, since red, blue, and yellow are the three primary colors.', '2004-11-19 12:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022042, 122015, 3697, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of shadow and lines, which is amplified by being black and white. I really like it.</td>', 'Very nice use of shadow and lines, which is amplified by being black and white. I really like it.', '2004-11-19 12:08:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022043, 122182, 28540, '<td valign="top">nice shadows and contrast!</td>', 'nice shadows and contrast!', '2004-11-19 12:08:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022046, 122081, 28540, '<td valign="top">I really like this photograph, except for the very bottom. The color of whatever she is sitting on is too close to the color of her jeans. It was just confusing for a minute. A little cropping could do the trick. But, very sharp!</td>', 'I really like this photograph, except for the very bottom. The color of whatever she is sitting on is too close to the color of her jeans. It was just confusing for a minute. A little cropping could do the trick. But, very sharp!', '2004-11-19 12:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022051, 120542, 25024, '<td valign="top">Lovely study - if only he''d been farther from the reeds to let you isolate him more - great shot</td>', 'Lovely study - if only he''d been farther from the reeds to let you isolate him more - great shot', '2004-11-19 12:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022055, 121363, 28540, '<td valign="top">I really like the idea of the shades. It is an excellent background for black and white. The chair is a little dark and kind of hard to see against the shade though. The picture becomes a little jumbled around the back of the chair.</td>', 'I really like the idea of the shades. It is an excellent background for black and white. The chair is a little dark and kind of hard to see against the shade though. The picture becomes a little jumbled around the back of the chair.', '2004-11-19 12:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022056, 121347, 25024, '<td valign="top">Very powerful - in every sense - just wish the focus wasn''t ever so slightly soft close up. Hope you do well with this</td>', 'Very powerful - in every sense - just wish the focus wasn''t ever so slightly soft close up. Hope you do well with this', '2004-11-19 12:14:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022057, 121844, 28540, '<td valign="top">how beautiful!  I especially like the reflective surface.</td>', 'how beautiful!  I especially like the reflective surface.', '2004-11-19 12:14:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022062, 120444, 25024, '<td valign="top">Simple but so effective - well done!</td>', 'Simple but so effective - well done!', '2004-11-19 12:15:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022063, 121657, 28540, '<td valign="top">not really fond of the angle, but the flowers are pretty=)</td>', 'not really fond of the angle, but the flowers are pretty=)', '2004-11-19 12:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022064, 121011, 25024, '<td valign="top">Very striking - good focus - love the highlights</td>', 'Very striking - good focus - love the highlights', '2004-11-19 12:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022068, 122019, 28540, '<td valign="top">the dark hair really brings the focus to the faces, it''s very nice they are surrounded by white. It is a very relaxing picture.</td>', 'the dark hair really brings the focus to the faces, it''s very nice they are surrounded by white. It is a very relaxing picture.', '2004-11-19 12:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022069, 121779, 25024, '<td valign="top">A very powerful image, well executed</td>', 'A very powerful image, well executed', '2004-11-19 12:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022070, 121930, 28540, '<td valign="top">shadows always look nice in black and white.</td>', 'shadows always look nice in black and white.', '2004-11-19 12:17:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022077, 121250, 25024, '<td valign="top">Good shot, if I had a criticism it just feels a little too literal - nstill a good shot, well done</td>', 'Good shot, if I had a criticism it just feels a little too literal - nstill a good shot, well done', '2004-11-19 12:20:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022078, 121747, 28540, '<td valign="top">not b&amp;w?</td>', 'not b&w?', '2004-11-19 12:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
