(1022082, 120606, 25024, '<td valign="top">love this sort of shot, excellent lighting, well done<br/></td>', 'love this sort of shot, excellent lighting, well done', '2004-11-19 12:20:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022086, 120737, 25024, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot, I like the crop and the ''hiddenness''<br/></td>', 'Lovely shot, I like the crop and the ''hiddenness''', '2004-11-19 12:22:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022088, 120355, 28097, '<td valign="top">Good lighting ... very good .. thats a nice portrait</td>', 'Good lighting ... very good .. thats a nice portrait', '2004-11-19 12:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022091, 121993, 27482, '<td valign="top">I do not want to sound condescending or insult you in any way but I find this photo awful.  First of all, the date.  Just plain having the date in the picture absolutely and utterly ruins it for me personally.  Secondly, the ligthing is awful.  Flash exposure just barely lights up your feet and nothing else, gives off harsh and ugly shadows and the rest of the frame is totally dark and while having negative space can be useful in composing a shot, this time it´s just dead space doing nothing for the shot.  Thirdly the subject, it´s not interesting at all, it´s just your feet up on a table.  Again, I apologize if I offend you for that is not my intention but I make a point out of not giving a 1 and not explaining why.  Hope you keep it up though, things can only improve.</td>', 'I do not want to sound condescending or insult you in any way but I find this photo awful.  First of all, the date.  Just plain having the date in the picture absolutely and utterly ruins it for me personally.  Secondly, the ligthing is awful.  Flash exposure just barely lights up your feet and nothing else, gives off harsh and ugly shadows and the rest of the frame is totally dark and while having negative space can be useful in composing a shot, this time it´s just dead space doing nothing for the shot.  Thirdly the subject, it´s not interesting at all, it´s just your feet up on a table.  Again, I apologize if I offend you for that is not my intention but I make a point out of not giving a 1 and not explaining why.  Hope you keep it up though, things can only improve.', '2004-11-19 12:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022094, 121533, 25024, '<td valign="top">Simple and effective, if the background had been truly black might have been even better?</td>', 'Simple and effective, if the background had been truly black might have been even better?', '2004-11-19 12:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022096, 121858, 29535, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of light and shade.</td>', 'Excellent use of light and shade.', '2004-11-19 12:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022098, 120848, 28097, '<td valign="top">great lighting and composition..good job</td>', 'great lighting and composition..good job', '2004-11-19 12:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022099, 120740, 29666, '<td valign="top">Amazingggggggggggg DOF</td>', 'Amazingggggggggggg DOF', '2004-11-19 12:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022100, 121228, 25024, '<td valign="top">Lovely setting, focus, and crop, - if that white could have been even whiter - who knows?</td>', 'Lovely setting, focus, and crop, - if that white could have been even whiter - who knows?', '2004-11-19 12:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022102, 121403, 27482, '<td valign="top">Clever use of DOF, I admire the shot but still something is missing.  It´s not really that interesting to me but this picture is technically very good.  Excellent ligthing, good DOF and sharp as a whistle.  (8)</td>', 'Clever use of DOF, I admire the shot but still something is missing.  It´s not really that interesting to me but this picture is technically very good.  Excellent ligthing, good DOF and sharp as a whistle.  (8)', '2004-11-19 12:27:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022104, 122175, 25024, '<td valign="top">Love the textures - this would have looked even better with some acute lighting</td>', 'Love the textures - this would have looked even better with some acute lighting', '2004-11-19 12:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022106, 121491, 29535, '<td valign="top">It''s a bit crooked, iof it wasn''t it''d be a great shot.</td>', 'It''s a bit crooked, iof it wasn''t it''d be a great shot.', '2004-11-19 12:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022108, 120564, 25024, '<td valign="top">I adore the simplicity, lighting, and stark graphics of this shot - well done</td>', 'I adore the simplicity, lighting, and stark graphics of this shot - well done', '2004-11-19 12:29:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022114, 121779, 27482, '<td valign="top">Very clever idea and well executed with good even lighting.  I think you could explore this idea some more, perhaps aligning the pawns in a circle around them, as if they were spectators in a schoolyard fight.  (8)</td>', 'Very clever idea and well executed with good even lighting.  I think you could explore this idea some more, perhaps aligning the pawns in a circle around them, as if they were spectators in a schoolyard fight.  (8)', '2004-11-19 12:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022120, 121219, 29535, '<td valign="top">It isn''t really a photo of anything interesting... and it doesn''t benefit nor lose out wiht black and white.  Not much of a show of how black and white can improve the right photograph.</td>', 'It isn''t really a photo of anything interesting... and it doesn''t benefit nor lose out wiht black and white.  Not much of a show of how black and white can improve the right photograph.', '2004-11-19 12:34:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022122, 122155, 28097, '<td valign="top">its beautifull, but to me i think it needs to be in more contrast with the background</td>', 'its beautifull, but to me i think it needs to be in more contrast with the background', '2004-11-19 12:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022124, 121941, 29535, '<td valign="top">The light is far too harsh, too dark in half and far too light in the other.</td>', 'The light is far too harsh, too dark in half and far too light in the other.', '2004-11-19 12:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022126, 121721, 29535, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand why she has to be naked.</td>', 'I don''t understand why she has to be naked.', '2004-11-19 12:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
