(1022190, 121586, 19010, '<td valign="top">hmm good lighting I like the shadows around the neck and shouldes. Good DoF and subject. The pose dosn''t quite work for me. I suppose however that getting a pregnate woman to pose fo hours, until you find just the right one would be close to suicidal. The phot oalso looks a little soft but I thing I like it considering the subject.</td>', 'hmm good lighting I like the shadows around the neck and shouldes. Good DoF and subject. The pose dosn''t quite work for me. I suppose however that getting a pregnate woman to pose fo hours, until you find just the right one would be close to suicidal. The phot oalso looks a little soft but I thing I like it considering the subject.', '2004-11-19 13:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
