(1022270, 121214, 19010, '<td valign="top">Im just not impressed with this photo. Perhaps if my monitor was properly calibrated I might see somthing that I missed. I  have to agree with one aspect of the photo however. Its is definatly B&amp;W in a modern world. One of the few examples naturaly occuring. Perhaps if the stars were brighter and showed a crisp image of a constalation I was familiar with. This shot would do a lttle better. But as is it''s just not exciting to me.</td>', 'Im just not impressed with this photo. Perhaps if my monitor was properly calibrated I might see somthing that I missed. I  have to agree with one aspect of the photo however. Its is definatly B&W in a modern world. One of the few examples naturaly occuring. Perhaps if the stars were brighter and showed a crisp image of a constalation I was familiar with. This shot would do a lttle better. But as is it''s just not exciting to me.', '2004-11-19 14:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022271, 120642, 26756, '<td valign="top">I think you succeeded in conveying a bit of your subject''s personality with this portrait.  The background is great and contrasts perfectly with the rest of the shot.  The shoulders are blown out highlights but I think that works here too.  Might eve be better this way.  Nice shot.</td>', 'I think you succeeded in conveying a bit of your subject''s personality with this portrait.  The background is great and contrasts perfectly with the rest of the shot.  The shoulders are blown out highlights but I think that works here too.  Might eve be better this way.  Nice shot.', '2004-11-19 14:24:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022280, 121060, 19010, '<td valign="top">great lighting and shadows. This image is very crisp and clean. You are able to see alot of fine details in the skin, especialy on the hands.  The only complaint I have on this paticular photo is the fabric. While very well defined, I feel that perhaps a more natural positioning of the cloth would have looked better. However this is definately a good shot and a great example of focus and lighting. This should score well in this challenge.<br/> <br/>Keep up the great work</td>', 'great lighting and shadows. This image is very crisp and clean. You are able to see alot of fine details in the skin, especialy on the hands.  The only complaint I have on this paticular photo is the fabric. While very well defined, I feel that perhaps a more natural positioning of the cloth would have looked better. However this is definately a good shot and a great example of focus and lighting. This should score well in this challenge. Keep up the great work', '2004-11-19 14:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022283, 121443, 11518, '<td valign="top">Probably would have been better if they were looking at the camera.  Nice pose though.  The woman in the back is slightly out of focus/soft.  A smaller aperture would solve that problem.</td>', 'Probably would have been better if they were looking at the camera.  Nice pose though.  The woman in the back is slightly out of focus/soft.  A smaller aperture would solve that problem.', '2004-11-19 14:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022284, 122058, 19010, '<td valign="top">while not an outright breathtaking photo. This is still a very good photo. This is a very crisp shot. It hs decent lighting with the esception of the light that runs along the edge of the face. The child in the photo is smiling and having fun wich is always a plus.  Definately above average in quality. Just not excitng IMO.Keep Up the good work.</td>', 'while not an outright breathtaking photo. This is still a very good photo. This is a very crisp shot. It hs decent lighting with the esception of the light that runs along the edge of the face. The child in the photo is smiling and having fun wich is always a plus.  Definately above average in quality. Just not excitng IMO.Keep Up the good work.', '2004-11-19 14:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022287, 121844, 11518, '<td valign="top">Beautiful tones and capture.  My pick for a ribbon.  Lovely expression, nice detail in the hair.  Well done. 10+</td>', 'Beautiful tones and capture.  My pick for a ribbon.  Lovely expression, nice detail in the hair.  Well done. 10+', '2004-11-19 14:38:35.000000', NULL, 1),
