(1022292, 121129, 19010, '<td valign="top">The photo is too over exposed. It definately could have used more lines, if you were  going for an artistic pen and ink type look I think you were looking for. As is I cant see enough details to tell me what it is I''m looking at.  Its a bear holding somthing is about all I can tell.</td>', 'The photo is too over exposed. It definately could have used more lines, if you were  going for an artistic pen and ink type look I think you were looking for. As is I cant see enough details to tell me what it is I''m looking at.  Its a bear holding somthing is about all I can tell.', '2004-11-19 14:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
