(1022295, 121265, 28260, '<td valign="top">I love this camera!  It is the first camera I learned to take photos with when I was in the Navy.<br/>As for this shot, great, nice contrast and good detail in the shadows as well.</td>', 'I love this camera!  It is the first camera I learned to take photos with when I was in the Navy.As for this shot, great, nice contrast and good detail in the shadows as well.', '2004-11-19 14:44:06.000000', NULL, 1),
