(1022298, 120350, 19010, '<td valign="top">this photo is way out of focus. I''m not sure if this was bone on purpose or not. I just dont like it. I think you were going for a poltergiest theme with this but I have been wrong befor. I think that this could have gone from a poor shot to a ribbon winner IMO with better focus and lighting.</td>', 'this photo is way out of focus. I''m not sure if this was bone on purpose or not. I just dont like it. I think you were going for a poltergiest theme with this but I have been wrong befor. I think that this could have gone from a poor shot to a ribbon winner IMO with better focus and lighting.', '2004-11-19 14:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022306, 120702, 19010, '<td valign="top">great shot. The soft lighting on such a pretty face is wonderfull. I''m not sure if the choice to use "what i''m assuming is" a birch tree was intentional or not. I feel that it works astoundingly well adding its own contrast to the B&amp;W. The eyes are also very bright and well defined drawing me directly to the subject. One of my top picks of the challenge keep up the wonderfull work.</td>', 'great shot. The soft lighting on such a pretty face is wonderfull. I''m not sure if the choice to use "what i''m assuming is" a birch tree was intentional or not. I feel that it works astoundingly well adding its own contrast to the B&W. The eyes are also very bright and well defined drawing me directly to the subject. One of my top picks of the challenge keep up the wonderfull work.', '2004-11-19 14:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
