(1022514, 122180, 9939, '<td valign="top">Well, I don''t get it. Is he reading the book to figure out how to play chess? Also, the highlight on his head and the shadow behind it bother me. Sorry, just doesn''t work for me.</td>', 'Well, I don''t get it. Is he reading the book to figure out how to play chess? Also, the highlight on his head and the shadow behind it bother me. Sorry, just doesn''t work for me.', '2004-11-19 16:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
