(1022856, 121464, 25397, '<td valign="top">I don''t know why but the picture of the person (Jesus?) in the window holding the kid is really, really, really creepy.</td>', 'I don''t know why but the picture of the person (Jesus?) in the window holding the kid is really, really, really creepy.', '2004-11-19 19:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
