(1022862, 121459, 29460, '<td valign="top">Nice shore line, nice focus</td>', 'Nice shore line, nice focus', '2004-11-19 19:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022864, 122168, 4285, '<td valign="top">Looks like Newfoundland.</td>', 'Looks like Newfoundland.', '2004-11-19 19:16:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022866, 121781, 29460, '<td valign="top">The repition just gets jumbled and dosent go any where.</td>', 'The repition just gets jumbled and dosent go any where.', '2004-11-19 19:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022867, 121807, 11800, '<td valign="top">I have no idea what that thing is behind her, but I have to tell you that you have a gem of a model. Black and white is the perfect medium for her. Not to sure about the hand inside the coat. The picture looks so 1950ish. It''s wonderful.</td>', 'I have no idea what that thing is behind her, but I have to tell you that you have a gem of a model. Black and white is the perfect medium for her. Not to sure about the hand inside the coat. The picture looks so 1950ish. It''s wonderful.', '2004-11-19 19:17:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022879, 120862, 29460, '<td valign="top">Crop the top, and it needs more dynamism</td>', 'Crop the top, and it needs more dynamism', '2004-11-19 19:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022889, 122137, 29460, '<td valign="top">I like it</td>', 'I like it', '2004-11-19 19:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022891, 121021, 29460, '<td valign="top">I want to see the cage, trap him in there rather than just suggesting it.</td>', 'I want to see the cage, trap him in there rather than just suggesting it.', '2004-11-19 19:33:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022894, 121755, 29460, '<td valign="top">very kitsch, more contrast, negative space, off center focal point.....</td>', 'very kitsch, more contrast, negative space, off center focal point.....', '2004-11-19 19:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022898, 121131, 29460, '<td valign="top">Show some negative space.  the barrel fades into the wood work behind it.</td>', 'Show some negative space.  the barrel fades into the wood work behind it.', '2004-11-19 19:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022904, 121830, 29460, '<td valign="top">There is no focal point, its very active and yet has not movement, dynamism or direction.  you need better lines and placement to move through the picture. Look at the frescos in you picture, look at the sculpture, they will show you how to use negative space and movement.</td>', 'There is no focal point, its very active and yet has not movement, dynamism or direction.  you need better lines and placement to move through the picture. Look at the frescos in you picture, look at the sculpture, they will show you how to use negative space and movement.', '2004-11-19 19:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022906, 122153, 29460, '<td valign="top">Well done.</td>', 'Well done.', '2004-11-19 19:49:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022911, 122167, 7252, '<td valign="top">Too monotone. An increase in contrast would work wonders as would a strong central subject.</td>', 'Too monotone. An increase in contrast would work wonders as would a strong central subject.', '2004-11-19 19:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022913, 121372, 29460, '<td valign="top">inspire me, give me a a reason here, just legos and shadows, even as well done as this is, has a hard time being seen as high art.  Tell a story with your composition and you will have a wonderful picture.</td>', 'inspire me, give me a a reason here, just legos and shadows, even as well done as this is, has a hard time being seen as high art.  Tell a story with your composition and you will have a wonderful picture.', '2004-11-19 19:54:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022917, 120497, 29460, '<td valign="top">Furyu</td>', 'Furyu', '2004-11-19 19:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022923, 121383, 29460, '<td valign="top">Im sorry, the butt and balls dont do it for me, and unfortunatly thats what Im looking at, the face is good, the other cat in the background wonderful, nice focus, nice contrast,  and I know that its hard to capture animals right (they are so much more difficult to pose than people).  But I still cant get away from the b''s.</td>', 'Im sorry, the butt and balls dont do it for me, and unfortunatly thats what Im looking at, the face is good, the other cat in the background wonderful, nice focus, nice contrast,  and I know that its hard to capture animals right (they are so much more difficult to pose than people).  But I still cant get away from the b''s.', '2004-11-19 20:00:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022924, 121238, 11800, '<td valign="top">I''m not to keen on the centered straight down composition.  I would suggest placing the center of the leaves on the upper left third.</td>', 'I''m not to keen on the centered straight down composition.  I would suggest placing the center of the leaves on the upper left third.', '2004-11-19 20:01:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022925, 121347, 29460, '<td valign="top">Its too confined, you could box it in, a little movement, raise or lower the fist about an inch and keep the arm where it is, and it would be superb.</td>', 'Its too confined, you could box it in, a little movement, raise or lower the fist about an inch and keep the arm where it is, and it would be superb.', '2004-11-19 20:01:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022930, 120829, 29460, '<td valign="top">Interesting, I want it to be cleaner, but then I feel that it would lose something as well.  <br/>Perhaps you did this peice the best it can be done, but I still want to see more of the conflict.</td>', 'Interesting, I want it to be cleaner, but then I feel that it would lose something as well.  Perhaps you did this peice the best it can be done, but I still want to see more of the conflict.', '2004-11-19 20:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022931, 120995, 29460, '<td valign="top">Put the tree more off center, include more negative space.</td>', 'Put the tree more off center, include more negative space.', '2004-11-19 20:06:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022933, 121263, 29460, '<td valign="top">I would have focused more on the shadow than the chair.  And whats that B&amp; W doing down there.</td>', 'I would have focused more on the shadow than the chair.  And whats that B& W doing down there.', '2004-11-19 20:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022934, 121629, 11800, '<td valign="top">Looks just like the house Steve Martin lived in in the movie "The Jerk". If you haven''t seen it, it starts out with "I was born a poe black boy." And it shows him on the porch with all his family around. They are all black. Not trying to be racist, this picture reminded me of the movie. It''s one of my all time favorite movies.<br/>Anyway. This house is a worthy subject for b/w. Good job.</td>', 'Looks just like the house Steve Martin lived in in the movie "The Jerk". If you haven''t seen it, it starts out with "I was born a poe black boy." And it shows him on the porch with all his family around. They are all black. Not trying to be racist, this picture reminded me of the movie. It''s one of my all time favorite movies.Anyway. This house is a worthy subject for b/w. Good job.', '2004-11-19 20:07:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022935, 122058, 29513, '<td valign="top">I see the trade off you had to make.  Sort of loose the curve of the top of her(?) head in the sky or stand up a bit to get it against the trees and loose this angle.  Tought choice.</td>', 'I see the trade off you had to make.  Sort of loose the curve of the top of her(?) head in the sky or stand up a bit to get it against the trees and loose this angle.  Tought choice.', '2004-11-19 20:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022936, 121527, 29460, '<td valign="top">Magnificent</td>', 'Magnificent', '2004-11-19 20:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022938, 121557, 29460, '<td valign="top">Nice subject matter.</td>', 'Nice subject matter.', '2004-11-19 20:07:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022939, 120861, 29460, '<td valign="top">This light house was made for pictures.</td>', 'This light house was made for pictures.', '2004-11-19 20:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022940, 121911, 29460, '<td valign="top">Techincally well done, but its still a door.</td>', 'Techincally well done, but its still a door.', '2004-11-19 20:09:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022941, 121807, 29513, '<td valign="top">I like the organic against the linear artificial stuff.  Too bad her coat wan''t just the little bit lighter.</td>', 'I like the organic against the linear artificial stuff.  Too bad her coat wan''t just the little bit lighter.', '2004-11-19 20:09:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022944, 120478, 29460, '<td valign="top">Watch your lines, they move away from the peice from the center, and those lines that do move in, are on the other side and are broken up by the columns.</td>', 'Watch your lines, they move away from the peice from the center, and those lines that do move in, are on the other side and are broken up by the columns.', '2004-11-19 20:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022946, 122124, 11800, '<td valign="top">Classic subject. Interesting composition. Excellent tonal range. The only thing I would question is the decision to leave the dark area to the right. I''m not to good with negative space, I prefer to fill the frame so if I question it, it doen''t mean it''s wrong.</td>', 'Classic subject. Interesting composition. Excellent tonal range. The only thing I would question is the decision to leave the dark area to the right. I''m not to good with negative space, I prefer to fill the frame so if I question it, it doen''t mean it''s wrong.', '2004-11-19 20:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022950, 121260, 10432, '<td valign="top">The photo would have more impact if the image size was larger.  The subject seems in focus, but it is hard to tell.<br/>The composition and subject placement is not very interesting.  Perhaps trying different arrangements of the pumpkins and a closer crop might improve this photo.</td>', 'The photo would have more impact if the image size was larger.  The subject seems in focus, but it is hard to tell.The composition and subject placement is not very interesting.  Perhaps trying different arrangements of the pumpkins and a closer crop might improve this photo.', '2004-11-19 20:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022952, 121844, 29513, '<td valign="top">I would love to see her reflexion, too.</td>', 'I would love to see her reflexion, too.', '2004-11-19 20:16:53.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1022953, 122192, 10432, '<td valign="top">I think this would be improved if the image in the mirror was more recognizable and in focus.</td>', 'I think this would be improved if the image in the mirror was more recognizable and in focus.', '2004-11-19 20:17:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022957, 121745, 29513, '<td valign="top">Nicely done "dark" picture.  Maybe just a touch more light on the face.  Let us see the expresion just a little more.</td>', 'Nicely done "dark" picture.  Maybe just a touch more light on the face.  Let us see the expresion just a little more.', '2004-11-19 20:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022960, 120798, 29460, '<td valign="top">wow, nice, not kitsch, very well done.</td>', 'wow, nice, not kitsch, very well done.', '2004-11-19 20:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022962, 121001, 10432, '<td valign="top">Image seems tilted.  Not a bad shot, but not overly interesting subject.  Maybe a different perspective or angle would make this more appealing.</td>', 'Image seems tilted.  Not a bad shot, but not overly interesting subject.  Maybe a different perspective or angle would make this more appealing.', '2004-11-19 20:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022973, 121644, 2741, '<td valign="top">Very Original. I like the message. LOL.  The shadow gives an extra feel to the photo. 10</td>', 'Very Original. I like the message. LOL.  The shadow gives an extra feel to the photo. 10', '2004-11-19 20:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022976, 121644, 29513, '<td valign="top">I just can''t help disliking this photograph.  I have been avoiding making a comment on it because of that.  But I guess it is good because it provokes such a strongly emotional response.</td>', 'I just can''t help disliking this photograph.  I have been avoiding making a comment on it because of that.  But I guess it is good because it provokes such a strongly emotional response.', '2004-11-19 20:26:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022977, 122082, 10432, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject - especially appropriate for B&amp;W.  However, the image looks a bit tilted.  I think it could use a bump in brightness and contrast.  I would prefer the first wheel not be cut off and the electrical conduit on the right cropped out.  BOL</td>', 'Interesting subject - especially appropriate for B&W.  However, the image looks a bit tilted.  I think it could use a bump in brightness and contrast.  I would prefer the first wheel not be cut off and the electrical conduit on the right cropped out.  BOL', '2004-11-19 20:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022993, 122012, 28227, '<td valign="top">Enter your comment here, and then javascript: do_vote(4)<br/> 4 cast your vote...</td>', 'Enter your comment here, and then javascript: do_vote(4) 4 cast your vote...', '2004-11-19 20:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1022997, 122204, 29460, '<td valign="top">Interesting, but not original.  Something like this which has been dont so many times, in so many media,  must be done, so much better than something original.</td>', 'Interesting, but not original.  Something like this which has been dont so many times, in so many media,  must be done, so much better than something original.', '2004-11-19 20:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023001, 121369, 29460, '<td valign="top">a new take to the "sad girl in the snow" pictures that Ive seen.  Nicely done,  I especially like his jacket and how it holds the snow, and thats what defines him from the background.</td>', 'a new take to the "sad girl in the snow" pictures that Ive seen.  Nicely done,  I especially like his jacket and how it holds the snow, and thats what defines him from the background.', '2004-11-19 20:36:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023019, 121373, 29460, '<td valign="top">Its a tree, its a good tree, and well done, but still a tree</td>', 'Its a tree, its a good tree, and well done, but still a tree', '2004-11-19 20:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023022, 121306, 29460, '<td valign="top">alright, now thats a good shot.  Arrrgh, the irony, I hate myself.</td>', 'alright, now thats a good shot.  Arrrgh, the irony, I hate myself.', '2004-11-19 20:45:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023025, 120526, 25355, '<td valign="top">You''re going to get a few comments about the shadow on the wall ... oh, I guess this is one of them. I bet the umbrella was red ... they''re always red, it seems.</td>', 'You''re going to get a few comments about the shadow on the wall ... oh, I guess this is one of them. I bet the umbrella was red ... they''re always red, it seems.', '2004-11-19 20:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023031, 121680, 29460, '<td valign="top">I want the white to be whiter.</td>', 'I want the white to be whiter.', '2004-11-19 20:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023032, 121823, 29460, '<td valign="top">I''ll give you kudos for trying, but Im not feeling it.  it needs more of a focal point or points, so it can engage the viewer.  It is an interesting study in light and shadow though, especially with the art supplies.  You went out on a limb here, good job, keep trying.</td>', 'I''ll give you kudos for trying, but Im not feeling it.  it needs more of a focal point or points, so it can engage the viewer.  It is an interesting study in light and shadow though, especially with the art supplies.  You went out on a limb here, good job, keep trying.', '2004-11-19 20:55:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023035, 121988, 16800, '<td valign="top">Goldens........Don''t ya just love em''?  Nice Shot!</td>', 'Goldens........Don''t ya just love em''?  Nice Shot!', '2004-11-19 20:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023037, 121524, 29460, '<td valign="top">Get the focus out of the center.  Here is a trick, divide the composition equally into a tick-tack-toe board, where the lines meet, but your points of focus.  This should be your rule, rules are made to be broken, but you have to know when and why.  Technically a good peice.</td>', 'Get the focus out of the center.  Here is a trick, divide the composition equally into a tick-tack-toe board, where the lines meet, but your points of focus.  This should be your rule, rules are made to be broken, but you have to know when and why.  Technically a good peice.', '2004-11-19 20:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023042, 121676, 20204, '<td valign="top">I''m not nuts about the square aspect ratio for this work, but it''s a catching and unique subject.  Excellent job with retaining detail in the ground texture.</td>', 'I''m not nuts about the square aspect ratio for this work, but it''s a catching and unique subject.  Excellent job with retaining detail in the ground texture.', '2004-11-19 21:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023043, 121870, 29460, '<td valign="top">If you filled the picture with the bear, you whould have made him into negative space, this way with the upper right corner the way it is, that is the negative space, and there is too much bear.</td>', 'If you filled the picture with the bear, you whould have made him into negative space, this way with the upper right corner the way it is, that is the negative space, and there is too much bear.', '2004-11-19 21:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023047, 122192, 20204, '<td valign="top">The evenness of the blurring is nice - it has the appearance (as confirmed by the title) of being intentional.  The b/w treatment creates an interesting emphasis on the mirror and the ... guardrails?  Interesting work.  I''m not crazy about the blurred aesthetics, but you made me stop and think, and I definitely think this is creative.</td>', 'The evenness of the blurring is nice - it has the appearance (as confirmed by the title) of being intentional.  The b/w treatment creates an interesting emphasis on the mirror and the ... guardrails?  Interesting work.  I''m not crazy about the blurred aesthetics, but you made me stop and think, and I definitely think this is creative.', '2004-11-19 21:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023048, 122083, 20204, '<td valign="top">I like the light reflections on the piano''s woodwork, and the panoramic format lends itself well to the subject.  I would suggest rotating the keyboard to align it with the lower image frame.</td>', 'I like the light reflections on the piano''s woodwork, and the panoramic format lends itself well to the subject.  I would suggest rotating the keyboard to align it with the lower image frame.', '2004-11-19 21:05:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023051, 121929, 25742, '<td valign="top">rétt sunnan Hafnarfjalls?</td>', 'rétt sunnan Hafnarfjalls?', '2004-11-19 21:06:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023056, 121483, 20204, '<td valign="top">Nice clean background, and the grainy quality works with the simplicity of the image.  The longer I look at it the more I see an optical illusion with the perspective...  Interesting.  I''d like to see a bit more detail in the wood (more lighting), but perhaps this is what you were going for.</td>', 'Nice clean background, and the grainy quality works with the simplicity of the image.  The longer I look at it the more I see an optical illusion with the perspective...  Interesting.  I''d like to see a bit more detail in the wood (more lighting), but perhaps this is what you were going for.', '2004-11-19 21:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023057, 120840, 25742, '<td valign="top">Reykjavíkurhöfn?</td>', 'Reykjavíkurhöfn?', '2004-11-19 21:07:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023058, 122047, 20204, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast, clean background.  I find the perspective to be a bit too direct though.  Perhaps there is amore artistic angle, or some shadow play to be had from this subject?</td>', 'Nice contrast, clean background.  I find the perspective to be a bit too direct though.  Perhaps there is amore artistic angle, or some shadow play to be had from this subject?', '2004-11-19 21:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023060, 121642, 20204, '<td valign="top">I liek your use of the frame - foreground leading to background, and the reflections in the water.  Nice work.</td>', 'I liek your use of the frame - foreground leading to background, and the reflections in the water.  Nice work.', '2004-11-19 21:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023062, 121765, 29460, '<td valign="top">I want more contrast, more focus, perhaps this fuzzyness whould have worked in a color picture, but here it dosent hold you, there is nothing to capture your eyes, they just slide away.</td>', 'I want more contrast, more focus, perhaps this fuzzyness whould have worked in a color picture, but here it dosent hold you, there is nothing to capture your eyes, they just slide away.', '2004-11-19 21:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023064, 121595, 20204, '<td valign="top">The only thing I can say about this is the reflection on the glass is a distraction from an otherwise great image.  This is a great creative twist from the many still lifes which include a glass.  The sparkling water / bubbles is a great touch that sets this apart.</td>', 'The only thing I can say about this is the reflection on the glass is a distraction from an otherwise great image.  This is a great creative twist from the many still lifes which include a glass.  The sparkling water / bubbles is a great touch that sets this apart.', '2004-11-19 21:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023065, 120429, 29460, '<td valign="top">nice a close, good contrast, good negative space, nice story. well done peice.</td>', 'nice a close, good contrast, good negative space, nice story. well done peice.', '2004-11-19 21:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023070, 120821, 29460, '<td valign="top">More contrast, or possibly just a darker image, right now it just all fades  into the background.</td>', 'More contrast, or possibly just a darker image, right now it just all fades  into the background.', '2004-11-19 21:12:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023072, 121639, 20204, '<td valign="top">Very unique portraiture.  I would like to see this same scene captured with the lens a touch lowerto bring the foreground subject into more balance with the background.  I love how all the elements work together though - this is a great b/w shot which color would surely detract from.</td>', 'Very unique portraiture.  I would like to see this same scene captured with the lens a touch lowerto bring the foreground subject into more balance with the background.  I love how all the elements work together though - this is a great b/w shot which color would surely detract from.', '2004-11-19 21:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023073, 121346, 26472, '<td valign="top">Very elegant and graceful. Reminds me of the florals taken by Robert Mapplethorpe. 10</td>', 'Very elegant and graceful. Reminds me of the florals taken by Robert Mapplethorpe. 10', '2004-11-19 21:12:20.000000', NULL, 1),
