(1023076, 121389, 20204, '<td valign="top">Just added to my favorites.  I love the contrast you''ve held throughout this image - the detail in the grass is excellent, and the clean backdrop set behind the boat tops it off.  One of my favorites so far - thanks for sharing it!</td>', 'Just added to my favorites.  I love the contrast you''ve held throughout this image - the detail in the grass is excellent, and the clean backdrop set behind the boat tops it off.  One of my favorites so far - thanks for sharing it!', '2004-11-19 21:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
