(1023106, 121827, 25742, '<td valign="top">for statues/sculputes check (or Czech) out the work of Jozef Sudek. More shadows on the sculpure itself would add more life and texture and interest to it, bit flat as it is.</td>', 'for statues/sculputes check (or Czech) out the work of Jozef Sudek. More shadows on the sculpure itself would add more life and texture and interest to it, bit flat as it is.', '2004-11-19 21:20:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023107, 121158, 26472, '<td valign="top">I really enjoy the subject of your shot, it''s a very unique way to shoot a nude. The sharpest focus in the shot, however, seems to be at her neck. I would have perfered a central point of focus or a deeper DOF. Tones are a little flat and I wish I could see the expression on her face. Overall, this gets a 7 from me. Good work.</td>', 'I really enjoy the subject of your shot, it''s a very unique way to shoot a nude. The sharpest focus in the shot, however, seems to be at her neck. I would have perfered a central point of focus or a deeper DOF. Tones are a little flat and I wish I could see the expression on her face. Overall, this gets a 7 from me. Good work.', '2004-11-19 21:20:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023109, 121901, 20204, '<td valign="top">I think this image would work so well in a vertical format to cut down on distractions.  This is a classic "decisive moment" shot.  Well executed - I just suggest reconsidering your crop.</td>', 'I think this image would work so well in a vertical format to cut down on distractions.  This is a classic "decisive moment" shot.  Well executed - I just suggest reconsidering your crop.', '2004-11-19 21:20:58.000000', NULL, 1),
