(1023137, 120486, 20204, '<td valign="top">Almost surreal.  I wish the trees were less prominant on the left, but I like the detail throughout the image - wish I could see it larger and study it better (that''s a compliment!).</td>', 'Almost surreal.  I wish the trees were less prominant on the left, but I like the detail throughout the image - wish I could see it larger and study it better (that''s a compliment!).', '2004-11-19 21:28:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023139, 121539, 26472, '<td valign="top">Lovely abstract. The bright spot in the front distracts me from all the texture on the sides, however. Noisy in the dark areas, but I know that can''t always be helped depending on the camera. I think I would have perferred not such a tight crop so that the full oval of the main element could be seen. I''d also like to see more of the bead-like texture, as to me, that''s the most interesting part of the shot. 5</td>', 'Lovely abstract. The bright spot in the front distracts me from all the texture on the sides, however. Noisy in the dark areas, but I know that can''t always be helped depending on the camera. I think I would have perferred not such a tight crop so that the full oval of the main element could be seen. I''d also like to see more of the bead-like texture, as to me, that''s the most interesting part of the shot. 5', '2004-11-19 21:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023140, 122166, 12674, '<td valign="top">Dark Side of the Moon, Born to Run, Jackson Browne, Stardust...good idea!</td>', 'Dark Side of the Moon, Born to Run, Jackson Browne, Stardust...good idea!', '2004-11-19 21:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023141, 122151, 20204, '<td valign="top">The tilted horizon a bit disconcerting, but what a dramatic sky!  And the foreground tones are really interesting as well.  Rotate it, and this would be a killer shot!</td>', 'The tilted horizon a bit disconcerting, but what a dramatic sky!  And the foreground tones are really interesting as well.  Rotate it, and this would be a killer shot!', '2004-11-19 21:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
