(1023147, 122188, 26472, '<td valign="top">Wonderful use of DOF and composition. I''d love to see this in person. Although the image leads me through the shot to the door, I''m very glad you included the figure in the background as well. It gives me a sense of the overall size. Excellent work. If you haven''t mentioned it in your comments, please let us know where you took this. 10</td>', 'Wonderful use of DOF and composition. I''d love to see this in person. Although the image leads me through the shot to the door, I''m very glad you included the figure in the background as well. It gives me a sense of the overall size. Excellent work. If you haven''t mentioned it in your comments, please let us know where you took this. 10', '2004-11-19 21:33:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023148, 121832, 20204, '<td valign="top">Really wild perspective!  I would have never thought to find a subject in this.  Nice contrast thoughout -  Great work!</td>', 'Really wild perspective!  I would have never thought to find a subject in this.  Nice contrast thoughout -  Great work!', '2004-11-19 21:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023150, 121655, 12674, '<td valign="top">Great concept...a bit dark overall...might''ve been good to highlight the head of the beer.  Spend more time experimenting with the lighting.  I picked up a cheap little halogen spot lamp from Home Depot that is adjustable in intensity and very handy for shots like this.</td>', 'Great concept...a bit dark overall...might''ve been good to highlight the head of the beer.  Spend more time experimenting with the lighting.  I picked up a cheap little halogen spot lamp from Home Depot that is adjustable in intensity and very handy for shots like this.', '2004-11-19 21:35:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023152, 121924, 20204, '<td valign="top">Great subject.  I''m a little confused about why you''ve chosen to crop part of its branch structure on the left, and leave whitespace on the right.  Would be nice to keep it all in the frame.</td>', 'Great subject.  I''m a little confused about why you''ve chosen to crop part of its branch structure on the left, and leave whitespace on the right.  Would be nice to keep it all in the frame.', '2004-11-19 21:35:26.000000', NULL, 1),
