(1023165, 121064, 20204, '<td valign="top">A bit more range between the highlights and shadows than I''d like to see in this subject.  Seems like some highlights were blown, and detai lost in the shadows.</td>', 'A bit more range between the highlights and shadows than I''d like to see in this subject.  Seems like some highlights were blown, and detai lost in the shadows.', '2004-11-19 21:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
