(1023778, 121459, 27767, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast of the foamy white waves against the dark water and opposing hills. Good placement of bridge in shot too.</td>', 'I like the contrast of the foamy white waves against the dark water and opposing hills. Good placement of bridge in shot too.', '2004-11-20 05:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
