(1023918, 121345, 3724, '<td valign="top">Great piece of glass.......  low angle is a nice view of it.  I rather like the background of tree branches timidly poking up through it.  Sky/cloud back adds another unique dimension to this fragil fountain.  Real interesting foto.</td>', 'Great piece of glass.......  low angle is a nice view of it.  I rather like the background of tree branches timidly poking up through it.  Sky/cloud back adds another unique dimension to this fragil fountain.  Real interesting foto.', '2004-11-20 09:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023934, 121222, 29362, '<td valign="top">that''s pretty good. i take it it was a sunny day, the front of the building looks super smooth with the light hitting it, nice shadows on the curve of the tiles.</td>', 'that''s pretty good. i take it it was a sunny day, the front of the building looks super smooth with the light hitting it, nice shadows on the curve of the tiles.', '2004-11-20 09:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023935, 121781, 29362, '<td valign="top">aaaah pylons, ive taken a few myself, something about them i just love.</td>', 'aaaah pylons, ive taken a few myself, something about them i just love.', '2004-11-20 09:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023937, 121306, 22384, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Great line in the post that holds up the basketball hoop, the arch of the ball, and the shooter''s arm which completes the arch. The stance of the observer adds just the right interest. This is a fantastic shot. Your title is perfect. Nice job!<br/></td>', 'Nice shot. Great line in the post that holds up the basketball hoop, the arch of the ball, and the shooter''s arm which completes the arch. The stance of the observer adds just the right interest. This is a fantastic shot. Your title is perfect. Nice job!', '2004-11-20 09:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023938, 121578, 29362, '<td valign="top">fantastic action shot.</td>', 'fantastic action shot.', '2004-11-20 09:38:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023941, 121534, 29362, '<td valign="top">very effective lighting creating fantastic shadows, nice shot.</td>', 'very effective lighting creating fantastic shadows, nice shot.', '2004-11-20 09:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023942, 121335, 11800, '<td valign="top">Great subject, well taken.</td>', 'Great subject, well taken.', '2004-11-20 09:41:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023945, 120642, 22384, '<td valign="top">Great job capturing the values of the human face. Your subjects "halo" of hair adds interest complemented nicely by his scruffy beard.  I would like to see some sort of connection with the subject. He seems to be disconnected and neutral.  It doesn''t have to be much, in fact it shouldn''t be, just a subtle indication of thought or emotion. I don''t like all the white space at the right of the frame. Crop closer and fill the frame with your subject''s face.</td>', 'Great job capturing the values of the human face. Your subjects "halo" of hair adds interest complemented nicely by his scruffy beard.  I would like to see some sort of connection with the subject. He seems to be disconnected and neutral.  It doesn''t have to be much, in fact it shouldn''t be, just a subtle indication of thought or emotion. I don''t like all the white space at the right of the frame. Crop closer and fill the frame with your subject''s face.', '2004-11-20 09:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023946, 121514, 29362, '<td valign="top">very creative, must have taken patience to set up. distance between each ring looks remarkably even, like the dof too.</td>', 'very creative, must have taken patience to set up. distance between each ring looks remarkably even, like the dof too.', '2004-11-20 09:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023947, 121601, 22384, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea. I am one of those people who ususally  need a focal point for a picture to work.</td>', 'Interesting idea. I am one of those people who ususally  need a focal point for a picture to work.', '2004-11-20 09:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023949, 121982, 29362, '<td valign="top">thats a lovely composition, the hoops look very shiny too, love the light reflections on them.</td>', 'thats a lovely composition, the hoops look very shiny too, love the light reflections on them.', '2004-11-20 09:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023952, 121770, 22384, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. I want at least one of the birds to be in focus, crisp and clear, either the one nearest the camera or the bird that is third closest the the right side of your frame. I like how you framed this shot.</td>', 'Nice composition. I want at least one of the birds to be in focus, crisp and clear, either the one nearest the camera or the bird that is third closest the the right side of your frame. I like how you framed this shot.', '2004-11-20 09:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023953, 121525, 25355, '<td valign="top">No, it was her ribs that got broken.</td>', 'No, it was her ribs that got broken.', '2004-11-20 09:46:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023954, 121104, 6179, '<td valign="top">Not true black and white. There are still color components in this photo. Would have been better if you converted to greyscale.</td>', 'Not true black and white. There are still color components in this photo. Would have been better if you converted to greyscale.', '2004-11-20 09:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023960, 120798, 22384, '<td valign="top">Nice crisp image. Great range of values. The fact that your subject is slightly in the shadow and the focus is a little softer complements his hesitant expression. You made a connection with your subject that the viewer can feel. I would crop this closer. The subject''s highly lit  clearly focused left shoulder distracts from the really powerful elements in this photo. Nice job.</td>', 'Nice crisp image. Great range of values. The fact that your subject is slightly in the shadow and the focus is a little softer complements his hesitant expression. You made a connection with your subject that the viewer can feel. I would crop this closer. The subject''s highly lit  clearly focused left shoulder distracts from the really powerful elements in this photo. Nice job.', '2004-11-20 09:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023963, 121265, 22384, '<td valign="top">Stunning photo. The angle of the shot and the fact that it is facing left, looking back, are really nice touches.The crisp line and tight focus are fantastic. I would have titled this "looking back."</td>', 'Stunning photo. The angle of the shot and the fact that it is facing left, looking back, are really nice touches.The crisp line and tight focus are fantastic. I would have titled this "looking back."', '2004-11-20 09:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023965, 121570, 11800, '<td valign="top">Classical study with good exposure control.  I can''t help but mention that the upper right part looks much like an eye. It could have been exploited to the photographers advantage by having more focus on it. It''s an good enough photo as is but that might have made it exceptional.</td>', 'Classical study with good exposure control.  I can''t help but mention that the upper right part looks much like an eye. It could have been exploited to the photographers advantage by having more focus on it. It''s an good enough photo as is but that might have made it exceptional.', '2004-11-20 09:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023966, 120504, 22384, '<td valign="top">Brilliant idea and framing. The highly lit lower right corner is distracting for me. The subject''s fist on the left is really a nice element with very interesting line and shadow. The cropping is the strongest feature of this piece. The shadow around 3/4 of the outside edge works really well, too. You have some really powerful elements in this photo.</td>', 'Brilliant idea and framing. The highly lit lower right corner is distracting for me. The subject''s fist on the left is really a nice element with very interesting line and shadow. The cropping is the strongest feature of this piece. The shadow around 3/4 of the outside edge works really well, too. You have some really powerful elements in this photo.', '2004-11-20 09:57:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023972, 120836, 29362, '<td valign="top">that cat looks positively evil! brilliant picture i love it.</td>', 'that cat looks positively evil! brilliant picture i love it.', '2004-11-20 10:02:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023979, 121301, 29362, '<td valign="top">you should have been making movies in germany in the 20''s, that''s impressive.</td>', 'you should have been making movies in germany in the 20''s, that''s impressive.', '2004-11-20 10:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023981, 121306, 25355, '<td valign="top">Perfectly frozen in time, this image. I love the way the boys are looking at a seemingly motionless ball - will it hang thee forever or ... score 10 points?</td>', 'Perfectly frozen in time, this image. I love the way the boys are looking at a seemingly motionless ball - will it hang thee forever or ... score 10 points?', '2004-11-20 10:06:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023982, 122114, 11800, '<td valign="top">This has an excellent tonal range, one of the best in the challenge as far as that goes. And the subject matter is pretty classical. All of the different textures are a pleasure to look at. I feel the composition is what really lets the excellent study down.</td>', 'This has an excellent tonal range, one of the best in the challenge as far as that goes. And the subject matter is pretty classical. All of the different textures are a pleasure to look at. I feel the composition is what really lets the excellent study down.', '2004-11-20 10:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1023989, 121671, 11800, '<td valign="top">Very original backdrop that fits perfectly with the dog and the title. A nice clear shot that doesn''t rely on usm for definition. One of the best in the challenge for me.</td>', 'Very original backdrop that fits perfectly with the dog and the title. A nice clear shot that doesn''t rely on usm for definition. One of the best in the challenge for me.', '2004-11-20 10:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
