(1024021, 121622, 23053, '<td valign="top">Hmmm...I''m not sure about this shot, but I don''t know what to look at.  For me, it lacks a focal point, not that it''s not in focus, but...I don''t know, I need some coffee.</td>', 'Hmmm...I''m not sure about this shot, but I don''t know what to look at.  For me, it lacks a focal point, not that it''s not in focus, but...I don''t know, I need some coffee.', '2004-11-20 10:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
