(1024122, 120837, 23053, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites so far...I''m probably 40 shots into this...but I''ll give you a 9.  This is a great shot that is simple but filled with interesting details and composition that have kept me looking at it for a few minutes now.  So, good job and congratulations.</td>', 'One of my favorites so far...I''m probably 40 shots into this...but I''ll give you a 9.  This is a great shot that is simple but filled with interesting details and composition that have kept me looking at it for a few minutes now.  So, good job and congratulations.', '2004-11-20 11:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024123, 120801, 18191, '<td valign="top">Good use of the high key effect. Very balanced tonality.</td>', 'Good use of the high key effect. Very balanced tonality.', '2004-11-20 11:49:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024124, 122053, 18191, '<td valign="top">I love the use of positive space here. Strinkingly beautiful!</td>', 'I love the use of positive space here. Strinkingly beautiful!', '2004-11-20 11:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024125, 121504, 25590, '<td valign="top">The  picture seems a little too busy for me, although i like it, my eyes can;t seem to concentrate enough, good shot  though</td>', 'The  picture seems a little too busy for me, although i like it, my eyes can;t seem to concentrate enough, good shot  though', '2004-11-20 11:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024126, 121182, 23053, '<td valign="top">Kick ASS...oh, excuse me...Kick BOTTOM!  The contrast is nice, great depth.</td>', 'Kick ASS...oh, excuse me...Kick BOTTOM!  The contrast is nice, great depth.', '2004-11-20 11:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024127, 120737, 18191, '<td valign="top">Interesting viewpoint for a portrait. Very moody and well photographed.</td>', 'Interesting viewpoint for a portrait. Very moody and well photographed.', '2004-11-20 11:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024130, 120496, 25590, '<td valign="top">Very abstract, and intriging, i like it, very very creative-6</td>', 'Very abstract, and intriging, i like it, very very creative-6', '2004-11-20 11:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024131, 122195, 7485, '<td valign="top">Okay, a duotone and B&amp;W are not the same thing so this is in the wrong challenge, but still an excellent photo. Those luminous cornice-lines are just great. Even better if the very top was as sharp as the rest. 6 (8 if it were B&amp;W).</td>', 'Okay, a duotone and B&W are not the same thing so this is in the wrong challenge, but still an excellent photo. Those luminous cornice-lines are just great. Even better if the very top was as sharp as the rest. 6 (8 if it were B&W).', '2004-11-20 11:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024132, 120870, 11800, '<td valign="top">former comment deleted<br/>edit:Let me know when you decide to participate.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-11-27 15:09:19.</i></td>', 'former comment deletededit:Let me know when you decide to participate.', '2004-11-20 11:53:01.000000', '2004-11-27 15:09:19.000000', 1),
(1024133, 121621, 25590, '<td valign="top">Good composition and point of view. the picture would be a lot more interesting if there was a more dramatic sky, but there''s not much u can do about that</td>', 'Good composition and point of view. the picture would be a lot more interesting if there was a more dramatic sky, but there''s not much u can do about that', '2004-11-20 11:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024136, 121202, 7485, '<td valign="top">Needs more light on her hair, so you can really see those lovely curls. Backlighting would probably have worked well.</td>', 'Needs more light on her hair, so you can really see those lovely curls. Backlighting would probably have worked well.', '2004-11-20 11:55:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024137, 121889, 25590, '<td valign="top">over done neat image, good portrait however-6</td>', 'over done neat image, good portrait however-6', '2004-11-20 11:56:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024140, 122137, 18177, '<td valign="top">fantastic! 10¨!</td>', 'fantastic! 10¨!', '2004-11-20 11:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024141, 121791, 7485, '<td valign="top">Bold idea, but needs to be cleaner to work as a pure graphic. Try making an advanced-editing copy for your-self, with the noise between the hands edited out.</td>', 'Bold idea, but needs to be cleaner to work as a pure graphic. Try making an advanced-editing copy for your-self, with the noise between the hands edited out.', '2004-11-20 11:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024143, 121500, 7485, '<td valign="top">Don''t thorns kind''a have to be in sharp focus to get the effect?</td>', 'Don''t thorns kind''a have to be in sharp focus to get the effect?', '2004-11-20 12:00:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024144, 121751, 27845, '<td valign="top">Are you serious? I dont''t wanna look like that! ;)<br/>Very impressive.</td>', 'Are you serious? I dont''t wanna look like that! ;)Very impressive.', '2004-11-20 12:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024145, 120526, 7485, '<td valign="top">Like the composition, but lighting is too flat</td>', 'Like the composition, but lighting is too flat', '2004-11-20 12:02:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024146, 122137, 7485, '<td valign="top">Wow, now there''s a new perspective on Perlan! 8</td>', 'Wow, now there''s a new perspective on Perlan! 8', '2004-11-20 12:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024149, 120350, 7485, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, but the lack of contrast (on a 1.8 gamma monitor, like most Macs) really ruins the mystique. 4</td>', 'Interesting idea, but the lack of contrast (on a 1.8 gamma monitor, like most Macs) really ruins the mystique. 4', '2004-11-20 12:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024150, 120836, 26756, '<td valign="top">The space above the cat isn''t all that interesting, but it looks like you have some nice contrasts and detail happening in the leaves at the bottom, and some nice tonal range in the tiles.  I think a tighter shot focusing from the cat down would have been more interesting.</td>', 'The space above the cat isn''t all that interesting, but it looks like you have some nice contrasts and detail happening in the leaves at the bottom, and some nice tonal range in the tiles.  I think a tighter shot focusing from the cat down would have been more interesting.', '2004-11-20 12:11:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024151, 120477, 26526, '<td valign="top">Great composition in this framed shot. Like how one''s eye drawn to the boat. Excellent dof. Well done!</td>', 'Great composition in this framed shot. Like how one''s eye drawn to the boat. Excellent dof. Well done!', '2004-11-20 12:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024152, 121743, 7485, '<td valign="top">Very interesting idea and nicely executed! Too bad that you''re score will get killied for submitting a duotone to a B&amp;W challenge. Ironically, I don''t think the tint helps the photo either. 6</td>', 'Very interesting idea and nicely executed! Too bad that you''re score will get killied for submitting a duotone to a B&W challenge. Ironically, I don''t think the tint helps the photo either. 6', '2004-11-20 12:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024155, 121369, 27260, '<td valign="top">Looks like something you''d find in a catalogue, I like it. 9</td>', 'Looks like something you''d find in a catalogue, I like it. 9', '2004-11-20 12:17:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024156, 121564, 7485, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous shot. Too bad your score will suffer from submitting a tinted duotone to a B&amp;W challenge. 7</td>', 'Gorgeous shot. Too bad your score will suffer from submitting a tinted duotone to a B&W challenge. 7', '2004-11-20 12:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024158, 121263, 27260, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the artistic shadows.</td>', 'Nice capture of the artistic shadows.', '2004-11-20 12:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024161, 121346, 7485, '<td valign="top">Very graceful! An interesting photo to compare on 1.8 (Mac) and 2.2 (Windows) monitors. In this case I think the 1.8 version looks much better. 8</td>', 'Very graceful! An interesting photo to compare on 1.8 (Mac) and 2.2 (Windows) monitors. In this case I think the 1.8 version looks much better. 8', '2004-11-20 12:21:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024162, 120673, 7485, '<td valign="top">In serious need for level adjustment, the shadows are way to light.</td>', 'In serious need for level adjustment, the shadows are way to light.', '2004-11-20 12:24:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024167, 122081, 7485, '<td valign="top">Would be such an excellent portrait (a 9 or 10) if the thing she''s sitting on were cropped away. As is, a 6.</td>', 'Would be such an excellent portrait (a 9 or 10) if the thing she''s sitting on were cropped away. As is, a 6.', '2004-11-20 12:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024169, 120727, 7485, '<td valign="top">Too small, and the grainy effect really doesn''t do it for me. (And if you hadn''t added the noise, the image would have compressed much better, so you wouldn''t have needed to crop it below 640!) 2</td>', 'Too small, and the grainy effect really doesn''t do it for me. (And if you hadn''t added the noise, the image would have compressed much better, so you wouldn''t have needed to crop it below 640!) 2', '2004-11-20 12:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024172, 122041, 7485, '<td valign="top">Great action shot, but highlights are blown and there''s too much blur. 2</td>', 'Great action shot, but highlights are blown and there''s too much blur. 2', '2004-11-20 12:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024188, 121973, 18194, '<td valign="top">The writing on the wall seems just a little too dark.  My monitor is calibrated to the strip at the bottom so I don''t think it is a problem with that.  Other then that it is a very good photo.</td>', 'The writing on the wall seems just a little too dark.  My monitor is calibrated to the strip at the bottom so I don''t think it is a problem with that.  Other then that it is a very good photo.', '2004-11-20 13:05:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024191, 122041, 18194, '<td valign="top">Good timing on the photo.  The photo could be larger. The whites are a bit blown out and over all the contrast seems a bit low.</td>', 'Good timing on the photo.  The photo could be larger. The whites are a bit blown out and over all the contrast seems a bit low.', '2004-11-20 13:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024192, 121443, 6405, '<td valign="top">Blond lady''s face is out of focus,and "dark" tones are weak,4</td>', 'Blond lady''s face is out of focus,and "dark" tones are weak,4', '2004-11-20 13:12:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024194, 121812, 6405, '<td valign="top">Beautiful b/w tones,nice use of light,subject will get you low scores,7</td>', 'Beautiful b/w tones,nice use of light,subject will get you low scores,7', '2004-11-20 13:13:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024197, 121054, 18194, '<td valign="top">Overall a very nice photo. It does look like there is a bit of aliasing in the photo which I would guess occurred when you resized.  This can be seen on the horizontal lines on the barge.  Not knowing what you used to resize I cant really say how to avoid this but in many programs that are choices for the re-sampling method when re-sizing.</td>', 'Overall a very nice photo. It does look like there is a bit of aliasing in the photo which I would guess occurred when you resized.  This can be seen on the horizontal lines on the barge.  Not knowing what you used to resize I cant really say how to avoid this but in many programs that are choices for the re-sampling method when re-sizing.', '2004-11-20 13:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024201, 120727, 8315, '<td valign="top">sorry this is terrible .</td>', 'sorry this is terrible .', '2004-11-20 13:18:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024202, 121871, 18194, '<td valign="top">I like the subject and the angle of this shot. I am sure you have heard alreay but this is a very small photo.  The crop seems a bit tight.</td>', 'I like the subject and the angle of this shot. I am sure you have heard alreay but this is a very small photo.  The crop seems a bit tight.', '2004-11-20 13:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024203, 120629, 18194, '<td valign="top">Nice use of lighting.</td>', 'Nice use of lighting.', '2004-11-20 13:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024205, 122027, 18194, '<td valign="top">The subject matter is good as is the framing.  The photo seems overly dark to me however.</td>', 'The subject matter is good as is the framing.  The photo seems overly dark to me however.', '2004-11-20 13:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024206, 121245, 8315, '<td valign="top">What a fantastic photo...Very well done 10 .</td>', 'What a fantastic photo...Very well done 10 .', '2004-11-20 13:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024209, 121131, 18194, '<td valign="top">Good job capturing the feel of the wood</td>', 'Good job capturing the feel of the wood', '2004-11-20 13:25:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024210, 120705, 27375, '<td valign="top">this is a very good shot, perfection!</td>', 'this is a very good shot, perfection!', '2004-11-20 13:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024213, 121481, 18194, '<td valign="top">This could have been a good photo but it is very dark, looking at the histogram there are no pixel higher then 150.  It is also much smaller then it could be. I might also be a good idea to give your model just a bit more time without the bra so that the lines from it are not so visible. I do like the play of light and shadow.</td>', 'This could have been a good photo but it is very dark, looking at the histogram there are no pixel higher then 150.  It is also much smaller then it could be. I might also be a good idea to give your model just a bit more time without the bra so that the lines from it are not so visible. I do like the play of light and shadow.', '2004-11-20 13:30:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024215, 122123, 27375, '<td valign="top">wow! i love this shot excellent</td>', 'wow! i love this shot excellent', '2004-11-20 13:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024216, 121546, 27375, '<td valign="top">very cool shot</td>', 'very cool shot', '2004-11-20 13:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024217, 121526, 18194, '<td valign="top">This is really too small to see what is going on in the photo.</td>', 'This is really too small to see what is going on in the photo.', '2004-11-20 13:33:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024218, 122152, 11800, '<td valign="top">It''s a good concept but a little to cluttered. Looks like a nice group of photos there.</td>', 'It''s a good concept but a little to cluttered. Looks like a nice group of photos there.', '2004-11-20 13:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024219, 121976, 18194, '<td valign="top">Cute photo. The focus seem soft to me.  It is also a good idea to make the photo as large as posible.</td>', 'Cute photo. The focus seem soft to me.  It is also a good idea to make the photo as large as posible.', '2004-11-20 13:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024221, 121764, 27375, '<td valign="top">very nice and crisp</td>', 'very nice and crisp', '2004-11-20 13:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024222, 121541, 27375, '<td valign="top">fantastic! wonderful capture</td>', 'fantastic! wonderful capture', '2004-11-20 13:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024223, 120642, 27375, '<td valign="top">Awesome! nice composition and lighting is fantastic</td>', 'Awesome! nice composition and lighting is fantastic', '2004-11-20 13:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024225, 122080, 18194, '<td valign="top">This could stand a little level adjusting, to me at least.</td>', 'This could stand a little level adjusting, to me at least.', '2004-11-20 13:39:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024226, 122207, 27375, '<td valign="top">this is such a great shot...this would be good for people that work in offices to hang up with a caption like "go to your happy place" what a creative mind behind this ..well done!</td>', 'this is such a great shot...this would be good for people that work in offices to hang up with a caption like "go to your happy place" what a creative mind behind this ..well done!', '2004-11-20 13:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024227, 121512, 11800, '<td valign="top">whimsical. Good exposure.  It doesn''t look like there is anything within the frame that would have upset the mood of the picture if the dof had been increased. It''s a good picture that would have been better with more in focus. Love the title.</td>', 'whimsical. Good exposure.  It doesn''t look like there is anything within the frame that would have upset the mood of the picture if the dof had been increased. It''s a good picture that would have been better with more in focus. Love the title.', '2004-11-20 13:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024228, 120407, 18194, '<td valign="top">I can''t tell what I am looking at.</td>', 'I can''t tell what I am looking at.', '2004-11-20 13:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024229, 122090, 27375, '<td valign="top">this is a cool flower but it seems out of focus, the background is distracting and the light is a bit harsh</td>', 'this is a cool flower but it seems out of focus, the background is distracting and the light is a bit harsh', '2004-11-20 13:41:25.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1024231, 120900, 27375, '<td valign="top">seems to have color in it but it is a nice shot with a good composition</td>', 'seems to have color in it but it is a nice shot with a good composition', '2004-11-20 13:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024232, 120822, 18194, '<td valign="top">I know that rock.  I love the view point of this, hope you kept the camera dry.</td>', 'I know that rock.  I love the view point of this, hope you kept the camera dry.', '2004-11-20 13:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024233, 121483, 18194, '<td valign="top">Way small and kind of dark.</td>', 'Way small and kind of dark.', '2004-11-20 13:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024234, 122182, 18194, '<td valign="top">I think you did a good job on the framing on this. Nice photo.</td>', 'I think you did a good job on the framing on this. Nice photo.', '2004-11-20 13:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024236, 121237, 11800, '<td valign="top">Wonderful and the perfect expression for the title.</td>', 'Wonderful and the perfect expression for the title.', '2004-11-20 13:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024238, 120540, 27375, '<td valign="top">i think this is a good subject but if you would have possibly tried this at a different angle, and composition it would have been a little more interesting...you should try to crop out all the things that dont help the picture any..for example..to the right of the tree and in front of the tree</td>', 'i think this is a good subject but if you would have possibly tried this at a different angle, and composition it would have been a little more interesting...you should try to crop out all the things that dont help the picture any..for example..to the right of the tree and in front of the tree', '2004-11-20 13:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024242, 120679, 18194, '<td valign="top">The vertical strips in the sky seem very odd.</td>', 'The vertical strips in the sky seem very odd.', '2004-11-20 13:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024245, 121929, 18194, '<td valign="top">I like the feel of the cloud against the mountains.    This could really use some level adjustment to brighten it.</td>', 'I like the feel of the cloud against the mountains.    This could really use some level adjustment to brighten it.', '2004-11-20 13:56:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024246, 121631, 18194, '<td valign="top">I like the crisp feel of this photo.</td>', 'I like the crisp feel of this photo.', '2004-11-20 13:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024248, 121129, 12792, '<td valign="top">Fun idea!  Love the title!</td>', 'Fun idea!  Love the title!', '2004-11-20 14:00:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024249, 121260, 18194, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to have seen this larger.  The lighting of the forground is a bit distracting to the main subject.</td>', 'I would have liked to have seen this larger.  The lighting of the forground is a bit distracting to the main subject.', '2004-11-20 14:00:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024250, 121668, 12792, '<td valign="top">Excelent image... I love the way it does feel alive!</td>', 'Excelent image... I love the way it does feel alive!', '2004-11-20 14:00:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024252, 122047, 11800, '<td valign="top">This would be a great product shot. Hardly any shadows. <br/>Imo, for this challenge, I wanted to see lots of texture and shadows to give volume to the subject.</td>', 'This would be a great product shot. Hardly any shadows. Imo, for this challenge, I wanted to see lots of texture and shadows to give volume to the subject.', '2004-11-20 14:02:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024253, 120350, 18197, '<td valign="top">The focus on this is so soft that is is essentially a B&amp;W abstract. It seems to me this is risky on this site if you''re going for votes, but I like risk takers.</td>', 'The focus on this is so soft that is is essentially a B&W abstract. It seems to me this is risky on this site if you''re going for votes, but I like risk takers.', '2004-11-20 14:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024256, 122064, 18194, '<td valign="top">very good photo, good use of lighting. I would have liked to see you use the full 640 for the height.</td>', 'very good photo, good use of lighting. I would have liked to see you use the full 640 for the height.', '2004-11-20 14:06:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024258, 121767, 18194, '<td valign="top">You have started with a small photo and then made it smaller by putting a very large boarder around it.  It is hard to see much detail in this.</td>', 'You have started with a small photo and then made it smaller by putting a very large boarder around it.  It is hard to see much detail in this.', '2004-11-20 14:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024261, 120701, 12792, '<td valign="top">Nice thought,  but the image feels out of ballence (can''t spell it).</td>', 'Nice thought,  but the image feels out of ballence (can''t spell it).', '2004-11-20 14:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024263, 121472, 18194, '<td valign="top">To me it looks like too much unsharp mask was used, I see bright lines around the roof.</td>', 'To me it looks like too much unsharp mask was used, I see bright lines around the roof.', '2004-11-20 14:15:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024264, 121913, 12792, '<td valign="top">Some perspective correction, may have helped.  I would love to see this in a selinium blue print!</td>', 'Some perspective correction, may have helped.  I would love to see this in a selinium blue print!', '2004-11-20 14:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024267, 121901, 18194, '<td valign="top">Great timing on this shot.</td>', 'Great timing on this shot.', '2004-11-20 14:17:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024268, 121140, 12792, '<td valign="top">Truely black and white.. very little grey   Nice as a study in contrast!</td>', 'Truely black and white.. very little grey   Nice as a study in contrast!', '2004-11-20 14:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024269, 121453, 12792, '<td valign="top">Fences can be alluring, can''t they?</td>', 'Fences can be alluring, can''t they?', '2004-11-20 14:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024270, 120557, 18194, '<td valign="top">This could stand to use just a little adjustment on the levels, getting the whites all the way to full white.</td>', 'This could stand to use just a little adjustment on the levels, getting the whites all the way to full white.', '2004-11-20 14:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024272, 121928, 12792, '<td valign="top">I like the way the grain/noise effect and the flat lighting gave your image a feeling of moment... of a new print.  Good work!</td>', 'I like the way the grain/noise effect and the flat lighting gave your image a feeling of moment... of a new print.  Good work!', '2004-11-20 14:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024274, 121670, 18194, '<td valign="top">Cute photo. I like the view point. This could stand a bit better focus and a bit more depth of field.<br/></td>', 'Cute photo. I like the view point. This could stand a bit better focus and a bit more depth of field.', '2004-11-20 14:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024278, 120539, 18194, '<td valign="top">I like the range of tones in this photo very much.</td>', 'I like the range of tones in this photo very much.', '2004-11-20 14:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024280, 122206, 12792, '<td valign="top">I really liked the idea, and frankly struggled with my rating of this image.  I feel that the warf and the boat are in competiion for my attention, with no defined subject.  I find myself wishing that the warf could acecentuate the boat in some manor.<br/>Good idea.</td>', 'I really liked the idea, and frankly struggled with my rating of this image.  I feel that the warf and the boat are in competiion for my attention, with no defined subject.  I find myself wishing that the warf could acecentuate the boat in some manor.Good idea.', '2004-11-20 14:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024281, 121912, 12792, '<td valign="top">The image balance is good... the level does not work for me at all and distracts from what would have been an excelent entry (IMHO).  Good luck!</td>', 'The image balance is good... the level does not work for me at all and distracts from what would have been an excelent entry (IMHO).  Good luck!', '2004-11-20 14:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024283, 121865, 12792, '<td valign="top">Excelent blending, and composition!  The model''s blond hair works very well with the foreground (right frame) Zone 8/9 and the background''s bare blac of zone 1.  Nice work!</td>', 'Excelent blending, and composition!  The model''s blond hair works very well with the foreground (right frame) Zone 8/9 and the background''s bare blac of zone 1.  Nice work!', '2004-11-20 14:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024284, 121524, 12792, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but it could have been a bit more intimate by: 1) coming closer the young lady''s face; or 2) lowering the exposure of both face/shirt and the back ground (to maintain the grey balance).</td>', 'I like the idea, but it could have been a bit more intimate by: 1) coming closer the young lady''s face; or 2) lowering the exposure of both face/shirt and the back ground (to maintain the grey balance).', '2004-11-20 14:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024289, 122187, 12792, '<td valign="top">Oddly enough, I think that I''d have prefered a static sinc w/o running water.  The water gives motion to an otherwise nice still life.  That said, as I imagine the water stream not being there, it becomes out of ballance?  I''m not sure which would have been the better course.  Great idea.</td>', 'Oddly enough, I think that I''d have prefered a static sinc w/o running water.  The water gives motion to an otherwise nice still life.  That said, as I imagine the water stream not being there, it becomes out of ballance?  I''m not sure which would have been the better course.  Great idea.', '2004-11-20 14:28:21.000000', NULL, 1),
