(1024585, 121185, 21621, '<td valign="top">I like this shot very much, might benefit from a tighter crop at the top, as the sky tends to dominate.  Great work.</td>', 'I like this shot very much, might benefit from a tighter crop at the top, as the sky tends to dominate.  Great work.', '2004-11-20 18:35:54.000000', NULL, 1),
