(1024595, 120478, 29437, '<td valign="top">Great idea, but the city is almost too hard to find.  I think the juxtaposition would work better if the cityscape were a touch more obvious.  Still, a nice photo.</td>', 'Great idea, but the city is almost too hard to find.  I think the juxtaposition would work better if the cityscape were a touch more obvious.  Still, a nice photo.', '2004-11-20 18:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
