(1024597, 121255, 20115, '<td valign="top">yes</td>', 'yes', '2004-11-20 18:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024600, 120632, 11800, '<td valign="top">This is an intriguing idea. It looks like water glasses were involved also. I think if the light were moved up so it wasn''t in the frame and the camera moved in closer, it would have made a really neat optical illusion. As it is there is to much wasted space.</td>', 'This is an intriguing idea. It looks like water glasses were involved also. I think if the light were moved up so it wasn''t in the frame and the camera moved in closer, it would have made a really neat optical illusion. As it is there is to much wasted space.', '2004-11-20 18:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024601, 122124, 29437, '<td valign="top">I think this subject would be more poignant if you''d picked a more definitive part of the church (I''m guessing it''s a church from your title).</td>', 'I think this subject would be more poignant if you''d picked a more definitive part of the church (I''m guessing it''s a church from your title).', '2004-11-20 18:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024604, 122104, 29437, '<td valign="top">I really want something more to happen with this picture, some added dynamic.  A technically well done shot, however.</td>', 'I really want something more to happen with this picture, some added dynamic.  A technically well done shot, however.', '2004-11-20 18:51:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024607, 122175, 29437, '<td valign="top">Nice subject.  With something like this, I almost want the picture to be more macro, though.  Really make the nail impressive and imposing.  Maybe I''m young, but 1951 should carry a little weight.  :-)  Still, nice picture.</td>', 'Nice subject.  With something like this, I almost want the picture to be more macro, though.  Really make the nail impressive and imposing.  Maybe I''m young, but 1951 should carry a little weight.  :-)  Still, nice picture.', '2004-11-20 18:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024609, 121363, 29437, '<td valign="top">I think I would''ve cut out the bottom of the vertical blinds.  I love the lines they make in the backdrop, but the light spilling in at the bottom kind of ruins the mood for me.  I want the hat to feel more jazz and blues and less ''Motel 6.''  Personal opinion, though.  This photo was a great idea.</td>', 'I think I would''ve cut out the bottom of the vertical blinds.  I love the lines they make in the backdrop, but the light spilling in at the bottom kind of ruins the mood for me.  I want the hat to feel more jazz and blues and less ''Motel 6.''  Personal opinion, though.  This photo was a great idea.', '2004-11-20 18:57:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024610, 121491, 29437, '<td valign="top">The diagonal down in the backdrop is really imbalancing for me.  Nice idea, but I feel like falling over.  ;-)</td>', 'The diagonal down in the backdrop is really imbalancing for me.  Nice idea, but I feel like falling over.  ;-)', '2004-11-20 18:58:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024612, 121779, 29437, '<td valign="top">Just too centered on the white king.  A good concept and balance of shades (especially with the grey of pawns in the background) and I like the subject.</td>', 'Just too centered on the white king.  A good concept and balance of shades (especially with the grey of pawns in the background) and I like the subject.', '2004-11-20 19:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024613, 121445, 9668, '<td valign="top">Amazing macro! The reflection is a bit distracting, but I don''t know how it could be much differerent. Great DOF.</td>', 'Amazing macro! The reflection is a bit distracting, but I don''t know how it could be much differerent. Great DOF.', '2004-11-20 19:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024617, 121570, 9668, '<td valign="top">Intriguing abstract, looks like a glass water splash. Too bad about the miss-speeling in the title. Lighting may be a little more interesting from a different angle, good composition though.</td>', 'Intriguing abstract, looks like a glass water splash. Too bad about the miss-speeling in the title. Lighting may be a little more interesting from a different angle, good composition though.', '2004-11-20 19:06:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024619, 122207, 28771, '<td valign="top">should have colored the balloon</td>', 'should have colored the balloon', '2004-11-20 19:07:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024620, 121108, 9668, '<td valign="top">Great shot, awsome compostion. The middle sting urks me a bit, stunning idea.</td>', 'Great shot, awsome compostion. The middle sting urks me a bit, stunning idea.', '2004-11-20 19:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024621, 121283, 28771, '<td valign="top">Nice. 5</td>', 'Nice. 5', '2004-11-20 19:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024622, 121001, 28771, '<td valign="top">Decent. 5</td>', 'Decent. 5', '2004-11-20 19:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024623, 121593, 9668, '<td valign="top">Great leading lines, nice shadow detail.</td>', 'Great leading lines, nice shadow detail.', '2004-11-20 19:07:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024624, 120822, 28771, '<td valign="top">Looks like a Thomas Robinson. Very nice.</td>', 'Looks like a Thomas Robinson. Very nice.', '2004-11-20 19:08:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024625, 121970, 21621, '<td valign="top">The detail is really fantastic, needs more contrast though, good work.</td>', 'The detail is really fantastic, needs more contrast though, good work.', '2004-11-20 19:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024626, 121941, 11270, '<td valign="top">This would of been better with a completly white background so you could see the shoulders....but still a very nice shot....8</td>', 'This would of been better with a completly white background so you could see the shoulders....but still a very nice shot....8', '2004-11-20 19:08:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024627, 120457, 28771, '<td valign="top">I like the cadence.</td>', 'I like the cadence.', '2004-11-20 19:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024628, 121636, 29437, '<td valign="top">This is quite possibly the most interesting picture of a daisy I''ve ever seen.</td>', 'This is quite possibly the most interesting picture of a daisy I''ve ever seen.', '2004-11-20 19:08:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024629, 122064, 9668, '<td valign="top">Pose seems unnatural, nice lighting.</td>', 'Pose seems unnatural, nice lighting.', '2004-11-20 19:08:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024630, 121347, 28771, '<td valign="top">Not right for b/w IMO</td>', 'Not right for b/w IMO', '2004-11-20 19:08:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024631, 121021, 28771, '<td valign="top">Good job</td>', 'Good job', '2004-11-20 19:08:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024634, 122207, 9668, '<td valign="top">This is awsome. I love the randomness of it: a business man with a balloon standing in a field. Makes me laugh.</td>', 'This is awsome. I love the randomness of it: a business man with a balloon standing in a field. Makes me laugh.', '2004-11-20 19:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024635, 120581, 28771, '<td valign="top">I like the sky, so I''ll give it a 5. I saw a bridge like this when I was walking through North Jersey. Air''s actually better up there than you might think; there''s lichen growing on all the trees and you don''t hear the stray cats choking on their own breath. It''s pretty nice.</td>', 'I like the sky, so I''ll give it a 5. I saw a bridge like this when I was walking through North Jersey. Air''s actually better up there than you might think; there''s lichen growing on all the trees and you don''t hear the stray cats choking on their own breath. It''s pretty nice.', '2004-11-20 19:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024637, 121222, 11270, '<td valign="top">love the sky....a very nice shot...10</td>', 'love the sky....a very nice shot...10', '2004-11-20 19:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024639, 120829, 9668, '<td valign="top">it may have been a bit better if you hadn''t included the structure to the left. Awsome idea, lovely architexture.</td>', 'it may have been a bit better if you hadn''t included the structure to the left. Awsome idea, lovely architexture.', '2004-11-20 19:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024640, 120822, 21621, '<td valign="top">Very nice, might be better if the rocks were not centered, good work.</td>', 'Very nice, might be better if the rocks were not centered, good work.', '2004-11-20 19:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024641, 120504, 9668, '<td valign="top">Lovly image, screams soft at me. Image size could be a bit bigger, but maybe that isn''t possible (?).</td>', 'Lovly image, screams soft at me. Image size could be a bit bigger, but maybe that isn''t possible (?).', '2004-11-20 19:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024643, 121601, 9668, '<td valign="top">I''m my rememberence, infared has a little deeper detail then that (I could be wrong though), but I like the idea.</td>', 'I''m my rememberence, infared has a little deeper detail then that (I could be wrong though), but I like the idea.', '2004-11-20 19:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024644, 122042, 28771, '<td valign="top">Ah, good timing. Or perhaps a clever setup? My brother used to be all gung ho about golf a while a ago. Then he picked up a meat cleaver and became a cook instead. He makes fantastic lasagna. My gosh, people used to make all kinds of excuses to eat dinner at my house, which led to some rather unusual encounters of the hungry kind.</td>', 'Ah, good timing. Or perhaps a clever setup? My brother used to be all gung ho about golf a while a ago. Then he picked up a meat cleaver and became a cook instead. He makes fantastic lasagna. My gosh, people used to make all kinds of excuses to eat dinner at my house, which led to some rather unusual encounters of the hungry kind.', '2004-11-20 19:13:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024645, 121470, 28771, '<td valign="top">Now why is this face somehow familiar?? Very wll-maintained and manly stubble on this fellow. I''ll bet all the ladies swoon over his irreverent sexiness. Although there is some weird effect going on with the hair in the upper right, I am forced to give this a 7.</td>', 'Now why is this face somehow familiar?? Very wll-maintained and manly stubble on this fellow. I''ll bet all the ladies swoon over his irreverent sexiness. Although there is some weird effect going on with the hair in the upper right, I am forced to give this a 7.', '2004-11-20 19:14:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024646, 122020, 9668, '<td valign="top">This shot glistens with mechanical beauty. Nice special filter for this one, I would guess.</td>', 'This shot glistens with mechanical beauty. Nice special filter for this one, I would guess.', '2004-11-20 19:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024648, 122150, 21621, '<td valign="top">I like the composition here, might benefit from a little more space below the near pillars, also the focus could be sharper.  Good work.</td>', 'I like the composition here, might benefit from a little more space below the near pillars, also the focus could be sharper.  Good work.', '2004-11-20 19:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024649, 121825, 9668, '<td valign="top">Seems to much of an unnatural pose, lighting isn''t that interesting. Maybe if you had a different angle of the lighting and a bit more this would stand out alot more.</td>', 'Seems to much of an unnatural pose, lighting isn''t that interesting. Maybe if you had a different angle of the lighting and a bit more this would stand out alot more.', '2004-11-20 19:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024650, 122181, 28771, '<td valign="top">I like it.  In the sixth grade I picked a similar flower for my crush, Shawa David. I gave her the flower at recess one day and she took me behind a tree and kissed me on the cheek, but one of her friends saw and ran to tell everybody and after that Shawna wouldn''t speak to me anymore.</td>', 'I like it.  In the sixth grade I picked a similar flower for my crush, Shawa David. I gave her the flower at recess one day and she took me behind a tree and kissed me on the cheek, but one of her friends saw and ran to tell everybody and after that Shawna wouldn''t speak to me anymore.', '2004-11-20 19:16:38.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1024652, 121588, 29437, '<td valign="top">Beautiful idea, but the subject is just too centered.</td>', 'Beautiful idea, but the subject is just too centered.', '2004-11-20 19:17:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024655, 121631, 28771, '<td valign="top">Yes it is certainly a barn. Good detail. You can just see the oldness of it. Too bad they are of a dying breed, often left to rot alongside highways or torn down when some suit wants to build a trashy strip mall.</td>', 'Yes it is certainly a barn. Good detail. You can just see the oldness of it. Too bad they are of a dying breed, often left to rot alongside highways or torn down when some suit wants to build a trashy strip mall.', '2004-11-20 19:18:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024657, 122041, 21621, '<td valign="top">Nice action shot, I really like the shadow, slightly over exposed, also the file size is only 65k.  Good work.</td>', 'Nice action shot, I really like the shadow, slightly over exposed, also the file size is only 65k.  Good work.', '2004-11-20 19:19:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024661, 121148, 9668, '<td valign="top">Lovely mysterious image, awsome city scape. Seems to be a doutone, yellow tinted, but that''s all good =).</td>', 'Lovely mysterious image, awsome city scape. Seems to be a doutone, yellow tinted, but that''s all good =).', '2004-11-20 19:20:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024662, 120582, 28771, '<td valign="top">A pipe, eh? Well only a true pimp can get away with something like that. Were I to meet a man such as this I would ask him how mnay wives has he gone though. The answer would likely be "3". Nice picture.</td>', 'A pipe, eh? Well only a true pimp can get away with something like that. Were I to meet a man such as this I would ask him how mnay wives has he gone though. The answer would likely be "3". Nice picture.', '2004-11-20 19:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024663, 120582, 9668, '<td valign="top">Great portrait, tells a story. Seems a bit noisy.</td>', 'Great portrait, tells a story. Seems a bit noisy.', '2004-11-20 19:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024667, 121259, 16255, '<td valign="top">Not B&amp;W.</td>', 'Not B&W.', '2004-11-20 19:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024668, 121812, 9668, '<td valign="top">Nice take on the challenge. Suggestions: crop or change angle to not include the edge of tile on upper left, take out the shadow on the top somehow. Otherwise an excellent image.</td>', 'Nice take on the challenge. Suggestions: crop or change angle to not include the edge of tile on upper left, take out the shadow on the top somehow. Otherwise an excellent image.', '2004-11-20 19:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024670, 121454, 9668, '<td valign="top">Lovely reflective image, nice angle and composition. Only thing to me though, is that is seems a tad out of focus.</td>', 'Lovely reflective image, nice angle and composition. Only thing to me though, is that is seems a tad out of focus.', '2004-11-20 19:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
