(1024675, 122039, 11800, '<td valign="top">very interesting treatment. I think I like it. The limited number of colors(grays in this case) make for a desolate mood.</td>', 'very interesting treatment. I think I like it. The limited number of colors(grays in this case) make for a desolate mood.', '2004-11-20 19:24:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024676, 122199, 28771, '<td valign="top">Good angle, goog mix of light and shadow, good shapes = good photo. 6.  But have you seen the hands that reaped what you''ve sown? It''s strange how at a certain angle and lighting you could place an object and a photo of that object in a position that would make it hard to determine which was the real one. I wonder if someday there will be cameras that can capture something completely, guts and all. I will be flirst in line at that yard sale!</td>', 'Good angle, goog mix of light and shadow, good shapes = good photo. 6.  But have you seen the hands that reaped what you''ve sown? It''s strange how at a certain angle and lighting you could place an object and a photo of that object in a position that would make it hard to determine which was the real one. I wonder if someday there will be cameras that can capture something completely, guts and all. I will be flirst in line at that yard sale!', '2004-11-20 19:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024681, 121814, 28771, '<td valign="top">Now that''s an odd effect. Is this a reflection of a side of one of those glassy buildings. It certainly does resemble a ceiling. You must be proud of this one, but I am sure this would be better as a color photo. Maybe the b/w makes the ceiling effect for apparent. Palm trees have a certain calming effect on me. Mired here in the northeast, I seen very few in my life. I often wish I could lean up against one of sleep beneath one.</td>', 'Now that''s an odd effect. Is this a reflection of a side of one of those glassy buildings. It certainly does resemble a ceiling. You must be proud of this one, but I am sure this would be better as a color photo. Maybe the b/w makes the ceiling effect for apparent. Palm trees have a certain calming effect on me. Mired here in the northeast, I seen very few in my life. I often wish I could lean up against one of sleep beneath one.', '2004-11-20 19:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024682, 121373, 28771, '<td valign="top">That looks like a great tree for adventures, but I daresay this is not the more interesting of images I''ve seen.</td>', 'That looks like a great tree for adventures, but I daresay this is not the more interesting of images I''ve seen.', '2004-11-20 19:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1024684, 121032, 28771, '<td valign="top">Ginger has very disconcerting eyes. I once woke up after dozing off on the couch to find my dead cat, Sam, looking down at me in much the same way. Then I woke up again and was very relieved.</td>', 'Ginger has very disconcerting eyes. I once woke up after dozing off on the couch to find my dead cat, Sam, looking down at me in much the same way. Then I woke up again and was very relieved.', '2004-11-20 19:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
