(1025599, 120673, 23141, '<td valign="top">If this was a candid:  good job, but tighter cropping would have hid her tummy.  Also could use a little more contrast.<br/>If this was staged:  Would be better with the sunglasses off, put him in something a little more classical (to match the timeless quality of her sweater), and remove his watch, which is a bit distracting to my eye.  A different angle - showing less of his face and more of hers - would be preferable (because let''s face it, women are generally better to look at than men are!)  :)</td>', 'If this was a candid:  good job, but tighter cropping would have hid her tummy.  Also could use a little more contrast.If this was staged:  Would be better with the sunglasses off, put him in something a little more classical (to match the timeless quality of her sweater), and remove his watch, which is a bit distracting to my eye.  A different angle - showing less of his face and more of hers - would be preferable (because let''s face it, women are generally better to look at than men are!)  :)', '2004-11-21 15:33:48.000000', NULL, 1),
