(1025726, 120725, 27845, '<td valign="top">Yeah! Finally I can give out a ten (I''ve seen about 400 submissions by now). You really got everything right to make the cam look like your head. The hands show all the emptions your hidden features can''t. It looks as if you were desperately trying to get out of there. Lovely. Just one thing: You cropped about 25px too much from the bottom. I''d have liked to see the whole of your right hand. Nonetheless a great, powerful picture.</td>', 'Yeah! Finally I can give out a ten (I''ve seen about 400 submissions by now). You really got everything right to make the cam look like your head. The hands show all the emptions your hidden features can''t. It looks as if you were desperately trying to get out of there. Lovely. Just one thing: You cropped about 25px too much from the bottom. I''d have liked to see the whole of your right hand. Nonetheless a great, powerful picture.', '2004-11-21 16:48:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1025728, 120702, 22734, '<td valign="top">returning for comments:<br/>Beautiful sweeping hair which adds to the composition. Good facial expression and lovely backdrop and support. The eyes are stunning. Bumping to 6<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-11-26 21:09:14.</i></td>', 'returning for comments:Beautiful sweeping hair which adds to the composition. Good facial expression and lovely backdrop and support. The eyes are stunning. Bumping to 6', '2004-11-21 16:48:29.000000', '2004-11-26 21:09:14.000000', 1),
