(1025804, 121980, 28771, '<td valign="top">Now that is a nice one. The skeletons of old buildings or perhaps the building blocks of new ones? Anyway, this image gives me a despondent feeling, so I''m guessing you want to portray decay. It seems it''s taken at a shorefront site, if that is sand in the foreground. If I have any problem with this it''s that it''s took dark at the feet of the buildings. This works nicely in B/W.  (5)</td>', 'Now that is a nice one. The skeletons of old buildings or perhaps the building blocks of new ones? Anyway, this image gives me a despondent feeling, so I''m guessing you want to portray decay. It seems it''s taken at a shorefront site, if that is sand in the foreground. If I have any problem with this it''s that it''s took dark at the feet of the buildings. This works nicely in B/W.  (5)', '2004-11-21 18:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
