(1025842, 122081, 28771, '<td valign="top">It isn''t as simple as black and white? Now why would you want to reduce someone so young and vibrant to shades of gray? Is it a depcition of her internal state. She certainly doesn''t look as happy as the rest of her pose would suggest. At any rate, it is a good capture. My eyes are still intact.  (5)</td>', 'It isn''t as simple as black and white? Now why would you want to reduce someone so young and vibrant to shades of gray? Is it a depcition of her internal state. She certainly doesn''t look as happy as the rest of her pose would suggest. At any rate, it is a good capture. My eyes are still intact.  (5)', '2004-11-21 18:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
