(1025854, 120711, 28771, '<td valign="top">My this young one has intense eyes. I knew the spitting image of this boy as a child in New Jersey. His name was Andrew Rider, and he loved to bring stray animals into class. Not to draw any parallels between them, but the resemblance is striking. This isn''t candid, as I would prefer, but it''s not a bad shot.  (5)</td>', 'My this young one has intense eyes. I knew the spitting image of this boy as a child in New Jersey. His name was Andrew Rider, and he loved to bring stray animals into class. Not to draw any parallels between them, but the resemblance is striking. This isn''t candid, as I would prefer, but it''s not a bad shot.  (5)', '2004-11-21 18:40:17.000000', NULL, 1),
