(1025909, 122087, 22748, '<td valign="top">I like this image. She''s beautiful, and the composition is very good. But, I think the lighting is a problem. With more even and softer lighting this would be awesome. I''d like to see more shots of this model from you. Also, I think a slightly lower camera angle, more on level with her nose or so, might improve it a little too. Also, if you submit a slightly larger version of your image, it would be nice. This one is about 468 pixels wide; you can use up to 640 pixels. Nice work, keep it up!<br/>~skylen</td>', 'I like this image. She''s beautiful, and the composition is very good. But, I think the lighting is a problem. With more even and softer lighting this would be awesome. I''d like to see more shots of this model from you. Also, I think a slightly lower camera angle, more on level with her nose or so, might improve it a little too. Also, if you submit a slightly larger version of your image, it would be nice. This one is about 468 pixels wide; you can use up to 640 pixels. Nice work, keep it up!~skylen', '2004-11-21 19:03:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1025911, 120366, 22748, '<td valign="top">Somebody''s got an unsharp mask fetish.<br/>:)<br/>Nice picture, I see the artistic use of the tool. But I think the composition would be improved if you gave her some space to look into. If there were about a third more width to the image, on the left side, it would feel more balanced.<br/>Keep it up!</td>', 'Somebody''s got an unsharp mask fetish.:)Nice picture, I see the artistic use of the tool. But I think the composition would be improved if you gave her some space to look into. If there were about a third more width to the image, on the left side, it would feel more balanced.Keep it up!', '2004-11-21 19:05:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1025912, 121351, 22748, '<td valign="top">ool image, I like the B&amp;W tones and the smoothness of this image.</td>', 'ool image, I like the B&W tones and the smoothness of this image.', '2004-11-21 19:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1025914, 120678, 28771, '<td valign="top">Now I really like this one. It tells a story, allowing me to fill in the details with my imagination. What reason would a man have for using a cell phone in a phone booth? There must be some imminent danger and he cannot risked being heard. His expression is slightly exasperated, either because the photographer is taking too long, he doesn''t like being photographed without being asked, or he''s waiting for his friend on the other line some he can ask to be picked up at Sixth and Main in about five mintues because Maven''s goons are out looking for him. <br/> <br/>(8)</td>', 'Now I really like this one. It tells a story, allowing me to fill in the details with my imagination. What reason would a man have for using a cell phone in a phone booth? There must be some imminent danger and he cannot risked being heard. His expression is slightly exasperated, either because the photographer is taking too long, he doesn''t like being photographed without being asked, or he''s waiting for his friend on the other line some he can ask to be picked up at Sixth and Main in about five mintues because Maven''s goons are out looking for him.  (8)', '2004-11-21 19:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
