(1025926, 122188, 28771, '<td valign="top">My word. I daresay this is one of the coolest pictures I''ve even seen here. At first I though you broke the rules by adding text to your picture, when I realized the were HANGING there. What fantastic architechture and design. The image has the quality of being naturally black and white, without being converted to such. The words, the depth of field, reflections on the floor, the texture of the floors and walls, the dark suited woman walking alone with her bags. This is a stunner, my friend, and I know it will do well. I almost wonder how it would look I you snapped the photo more to the left or from the end of the hall. I would love to see the inside of this place. (10)</td>', 'My word. I daresay this is one of the coolest pictures I''ve even seen here. At first I though you broke the rules by adding text to your picture, when I realized the were HANGING there. What fantastic architechture and design. The image has the quality of being naturally black and white, without being converted to such. The words, the depth of field, reflections on the floor, the texture of the floors and walls, the dark suited woman walking alone with her bags. This is a stunner, my friend, and I know it will do well. I almost wonder how it would look I you snapped the photo more to the left or from the end of the hall. I would love to see the inside of this place. (10)', '2004-11-21 19:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1025936, 120908, 28771, '<td valign="top">My, my. This is the second great photo in a row I have seen. And just stones. A single one gets a three from me, bunch a whole bunch of them gets a nine. Of course it''s not just the amount of them. :)</td>', 'My, my. This is the second great photo in a row I have seen. And just stones. A single one gets a three from me, bunch a whole bunch of them gets a nine. Of course it''s not just the amount of them. :)', '2004-11-21 19:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1025938, 120841, 28771, '<td valign="top">Well aren''t we too cool for school? This would be the sort of picture I would have copied and slipped to girl''s lockers in high school, just a bit of shameless advertising. I was a goofball. Not a perfect photo, but it''s get''s the job done. (6)</td>', 'Well aren''t we too cool for school? This would be the sort of picture I would have copied and slipped to girl''s lockers in high school, just a bit of shameless advertising. I was a goofball. Not a perfect photo, but it''s get''s the job done. (6)', '2004-11-21 19:20:42.000000', NULL, 1),
