(1025944, 122183, 13749, '<td valign="top">at first i thought it was a reflection, now i''m just confused!  good work - although i''m not sure if you had a specific intention with this particular depth of focus.  a little more and we might have seen the name of the bottom crown, or even the details of the entire stack - although it does more of a little feeling of distance/depth to the picture.</td>', 'at first i thought it was a reflection, now i''m just confused!  good work - although i''m not sure if you had a specific intention with this particular depth of focus.  a little more and we might have seen the name of the bottom crown, or even the details of the entire stack - although it does more of a little feeling of distance/depth to the picture.', '2004-11-21 19:24:29.000000', NULL, 1),
