(1025950, 120776, 28771, '<td valign="top">Truely lovely image. In younger day''s I enjoyed walks on bridge such as this. When the sun hit the water just right you could see minnows and tadpoles swimming about, and if you moved to fast they''d all get spooked by your shadow. Every kid should have a little bridge to look over. In fact I saw my first shooting star in the reflection of the sky off that little bridge. <br/> <br/>The made the lighting work for you is amazing. Even the black and white doesn''t make the scene sombe; it''s far too cheerful. The path leads the eyes all the way to the end without a hitch. Great work! (10)</td>', 'Truely lovely image. In younger day''s I enjoyed walks on bridge such as this. When the sun hit the water just right you could see minnows and tadpoles swimming about, and if you moved to fast they''d all get spooked by your shadow. Every kid should have a little bridge to look over. In fact I saw my first shooting star in the reflection of the sky off that little bridge.  The made the lighting work for you is amazing. Even the black and white doesn''t make the scene sombe; it''s far too cheerful. The path leads the eyes all the way to the end without a hitch. Great work! (10)', '2004-11-21 19:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1025954, 121777, 28771, '<td valign="top">A very skillfull photograph, artful and sullen. I could see this in a gallery. (9)</td>', 'A very skillfull photograph, artful and sullen. I could see this in a gallery. (9)', '2004-11-21 19:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
