(1026865, 120798, 29255, '<td valign="top">I wouldn''t guess the tree is the main subject like it seems hinted by the focus. Look is touching even though tones at eye seem to be pretty blocked. So the contrast is not where it should be.</td>', 'I wouldn''t guess the tree is the main subject like it seems hinted by the focus. Look is touching even though tones at eye seem to be pretty blocked. So the contrast is not where it should be.', '2004-11-22 07:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1026867, 120998, 29255, '<td valign="top">This image is seriously missing shades. Composition is very original, the wires wouldn''t bother too much but extra diagonal component on right is probably too much. The sun is partially blocked which is weird. Can''t say I don''t like the idea, but this execution isn''t succesful to my eyes.</td>', 'This image is seriously missing shades. Composition is very original, the wires wouldn''t bother too much but extra diagonal component on right is probably too much. The sun is partially blocked which is weird. Can''t say I don''t like the idea, but this execution isn''t succesful to my eyes.', '2004-11-22 07:18:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1026871, 121918, 29255, '<td valign="top">Killing contrast might work better if the roof would be distinguishable from the woods. If this wasn''t shot on film, try to find contrast from different channels (I guess green would display some difference on roof and woods). Otherwise I like the contrast, as the detail is still present. Composition is a bit odd on bottom, and there''s feeling the image is not straight even though it might be.</td>', 'Killing contrast might work better if the roof would be distinguishable from the woods. If this wasn''t shot on film, try to find contrast from different channels (I guess green would display some difference on roof and woods). Otherwise I like the contrast, as the detail is still present. Composition is a bit odd on bottom, and there''s feeling the image is not straight even though it might be.', '2004-11-22 07:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1026878, 121064, 29255, '<td valign="top">Highlighted stone, with interesting form, is a bit blown, and shadows don''t show too much detail.</td>', 'Highlighted stone, with interesting form, is a bit blown, and shadows don''t show too much detail.', '2004-11-22 07:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1026880, 120711, 29255, '<td valign="top">Hair is very sharp, but skin seems blurred. Both have nice tones. Name doesn''t match the image as it is.</td>', 'Hair is very sharp, but skin seems blurred. Both have nice tones. Name doesn''t match the image as it is.', '2004-11-22 07:22:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1026883, 121104, 29255, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but the image isn''t BW. You could also work on execution, as the topmost pointer is too far on the edge to work well together witht the lower one.</td>', 'Nice idea, but the image isn''t BW. You could also work on execution, as the topmost pointer is too far on the edge to work well together witht the lower one.', '2004-11-22 07:23:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1026888, 122027, 29255, '<td valign="top">Nice low-key. I also like the way light points where the future could be found. The ground look trashed due to extreme shading of "ground litter".</td>', 'Nice low-key. I also like the way light points where the future could be found. The ground look trashed due to extreme shading of "ground litter".', '2004-11-22 07:24:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1026893, 121075, 29255, '<td valign="top">Darker tones are missing, yet this is no high-key. Nice setting, touch-down below ground level. Sky as a background is very dull.</td>', 'Darker tones are missing, yet this is no high-key. Nice setting, touch-down below ground level. Sky as a background is very dull.', '2004-11-22 07:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1026895, 121214, 29255, '<td valign="top">Too low keyed to "see your point". Nice idea though.</td>', 'Too low keyed to "see your point". Nice idea though.', '2004-11-22 07:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1026898, 121779, 29255, '<td valign="top">And white remains. Tones are good on white, but the black piece is missing a bit. Nice idea, and execution. I would have liked other composition, less action on center.</td>', 'And white remains. Tones are good on white, but the black piece is missing a bit. Nice idea, and execution. I would have liked other composition, less action on center.', '2004-11-22 07:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1027018, 121768, 29255, '<td valign="top">Very nice subject. For long time I thought it''s a wall of gray blocks and the snow is the whiter area on top of the block before I realised what''s it''s really about.<br/>Know has tones, even on background, so exposure is just correct.</td>', 'Very nice subject. For long time I thought it''s a wall of gray blocks and the snow is the whiter area on top of the block before I realised what''s it''s really about.Know has tones, even on background, so exposure is just correct.', '2004-11-22 09:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1027019, 121988, 29255, '<td valign="top">There''s sharpness and lazy times, but borders don''t match good image in my opinion.</td>', 'There''s sharpness and lazy times, but borders don''t match good image in my opinion.', '2004-11-22 09:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1027020, 121870, 29255, '<td valign="top">White object looks too gray, but there''s nice detail in the fur.</td>', 'White object looks too gray, but there''s nice detail in the fur.', '2004-11-22 09:26:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1027022, 121516, 29255, '<td valign="top">There''s form, but looks like sharpness and shadow detail is missing. The sign on background is in wrong place, so give this good idea another take.</td>', 'There''s form, but looks like sharpness and shadow detail is missing. The sign on background is in wrong place, so give this good idea another take.', '2004-11-22 09:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1027023, 120599, 29255, '<td valign="top">Queen has quite noisy background.</td>', 'Queen has quite noisy background.', '2004-11-22 09:27:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1027024, 122015, 26464, '<td valign="top">nice study<br/></td>', 'nice study', '2004-11-22 09:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1027025, 121791, 26464, '<td valign="top">this works well as fine art, but it won''t do well here i dont think. <br/></td>', 'this works well as fine art, but it won''t do well here i dont think. ', '2004-11-22 09:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1027027, 121224, 29255, '<td valign="top">Nice tones. Clouds are nice, and close to be enough of a main subject to make this image work.</td>', 'Nice tones. Clouds are nice, and close to be enough of a main subject to make this image work.', '2004-11-22 09:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1027028, 121507, 26464, '<td valign="top">hehe funny and well done<br/>candid?<br/></td>', 'hehe funny and well donecandid?', '2004-11-22 09:29:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1027029, 121183, 29255, '<td valign="top">Lot of shining white snow is just gray in this one. The peak is a beauty however.</td>', 'Lot of shining white snow is just gray in this one. The peak is a beauty however.', '2004-11-22 09:29:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1027030, 122170, 26464, '<td valign="top">nice fore/background contrasts<br/></td>', 'nice fore/background contrasts', '2004-11-22 09:29:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1027032, 121592, 29255, '<td valign="top">Nice skin tones in almost high-key image.</td>', 'Nice skin tones in almost high-key image.', '2004-11-22 09:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1027034, 120870, 29255, '<td valign="top">Looks like action is missed. There''s a hint of wrong-doing and escaping, but the object hinting isn''t made of any bad thoughts, so it''s controversial. Tilted.</td>', 'Looks like action is missed. There''s a hint of wrong-doing and escaping, but the object hinting isn''t made of any bad thoughts, so it''s controversial. Tilted.', '2004-11-22 09:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
