(1027037, 121929, 29255, '<td valign="top">Low-key winter isn''t that often met. This however, is missing all highlight, expect sharpening halo at the leftmost mountain edge.</td>', 'Low-key winter isn''t that often met. This however, is missing all highlight, expect sharpening halo at the leftmost mountain edge.', '2004-11-22 09:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1027039, 120830, 29255, '<td valign="top">Too noisy, to recognize what''s this about even with name.</td>', 'Too noisy, to recognize what''s this about even with name.', '2004-11-22 09:31:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1027040, 121263, 26464, '<td valign="top">nice<br/> <br/>whats up with the b/w symbol?<br/></td>', 'nice whats up with the b/w symbol?', '2004-11-22 09:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1027042, 120623, 29255, '<td valign="top">Now, here''s an abstraction. There''s form, lines and tones. Fills the Challenge''s bill, even though I don''t like it.</td>', 'Now, here''s an abstraction. There''s form, lines and tones. Fills the Challenge''s bill, even though I don''t like it.', '2004-11-22 09:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1027044, 122175, 29255, '<td valign="top">This image has too much mass on top, feels for me like it''s falling real soon now. Detail is exquisite, but feels like it''s under utilized.</td>', 'This image has too much mass on top, feels for me like it''s falling real soon now. Detail is exquisite, but feels like it''s under utilized.', '2004-11-22 09:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1027045, 122113, 29255, '<td valign="top">Odd crop, to include top, and nothing feels sharp. Or to top rock feels, but it shouldn''t be the focal point.</td>', 'Odd crop, to include top, and nothing feels sharp. Or to top rock feels, but it shouldn''t be the focal point.', '2004-11-22 09:34:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1027046, 121159, 29255, '<td valign="top">Couple of centimeters left, and the flower would be perfectly silhouetted. Now there''s slight overlap. Also, the image is tilted a bit. Nice composition.</td>', 'Couple of centimeters left, and the flower would be perfectly silhouetted. Now there''s slight overlap. Also, the image is tilted a bit. Nice composition.', '2004-11-22 09:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1027048, 121347, 29255, '<td valign="top">Dunno about the name. The focus is too far back. Sharpness is nice, and oil or whatever, to paint the fingers in good light.</td>', 'Dunno about the name. The focus is too far back. Sharpness is nice, and oil or whatever, to paint the fingers in good light.', '2004-11-22 09:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1027049, 122137, 29255, '<td valign="top">The contradiction of icy environment on left and warm feeling on right is great. I also like tones on left, but somehow tones are missing on right.</td>', 'The contradiction of icy environment on left and warm feeling on right is great. I also like tones on left, but somehow tones are missing on right.', '2004-11-22 09:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1027051, 121335, 29255, '<td valign="top">Bottom makes me feel more space on top as well. Nice whirls.</td>', 'Bottom makes me feel more space on top as well. Nice whirls.', '2004-11-22 09:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1027053, 122151, 29255, '<td valign="top">Image feels tilted, but sky is nice.</td>', 'Image feels tilted, but sky is nice.', '2004-11-22 09:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1027054, 122057, 29255, '<td valign="top">Here''s nice idea and good execution. It wouldn''t feel soft enough without the tiny hair on left side cheek (model''s right). :)</td>', 'Here''s nice idea and good execution. It wouldn''t feel soft enough without the tiny hair on left side cheek (model''s right). :)', '2004-11-22 09:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1027056, 121389, 29255, '<td valign="top">Very middle toned image. Too gray for my taste.</td>', 'Very middle toned image. Too gray for my taste.', '2004-11-22 09:40:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1027057, 121781, 29255, '<td valign="top">I like the haze and idea, but I''d like more sharpness.</td>', 'I like the haze and idea, but I''d like more sharpness.', '2004-11-22 09:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1027059, 121947, 29255, '<td valign="top">Spalding looks nice, but immense white block doesn''t, and Wilsons are too dark.</td>', 'Spalding looks nice, but immense white block doesn''t, and Wilsons are too dark.', '2004-11-22 09:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1027062, 121048, 29255, '<td valign="top">Not low-key, and still there''re no lighter shades.</td>', 'Not low-key, and still there''re no lighter shades.', '2004-11-22 09:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1027063, 120804, 29255, '<td valign="top">This is not high-key and yet the darker tones are not in their place.</td>', 'This is not high-key and yet the darker tones are not in their place.', '2004-11-22 09:43:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1027066, 121864, 29255, '<td valign="top">horse is nice subject, while the fence isn''t. The leaves take too much role here, and it''s a bit hard to get autumn feeling just because leaves are quite light.</td>', 'horse is nice subject, while the fence isn''t. The leaves take too much role here, and it''s a bit hard to get autumn feeling just because leaves are quite light.', '2004-11-22 09:44:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1027067, 120415, 29255, '<td valign="top">First toned I encountered. Didn''t knew it was ok. At least it''s underutilized. Toning fits this one. The tree gets enough attention even though there''s a lot of competition for the main subject status.</td>', 'First toned I encountered. Didn''t knew it was ok. At least it''s underutilized. Toning fits this one. The tree gets enough attention even though there''s a lot of competition for the main subject status.', '2004-11-22 09:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1027069, 120450, 29255, '<td valign="top">The band maybe?) Great shot in a way that the rock doesn''t get main attention.</td>', 'The band maybe?) Great shot in a way that the rock doesn''t get main attention.', '2004-11-22 09:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1027071, 121881, 29255, '<td valign="top">Nice light!</td>', 'Nice light!', '2004-11-22 09:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1027073, 121211, 29255, '<td valign="top">Bridge in a gray world.</td>', 'Bridge in a gray world.', '2004-11-22 09:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1027074, 120744, 29255, '<td valign="top">Quite tilted. I don''t see the reason.</td>', 'Quite tilted. I don''t see the reason.', '2004-11-22 09:48:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1027075, 121657, 29255, '<td valign="top">This would probably get better by adding contrast, and since white flowers seem to grab more attention, maybe even give them more of the contrast area.</td>', 'This would probably get better by adding contrast, and since white flowers seem to grab more attention, maybe even give them more of the contrast area.', '2004-11-22 09:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1027076, 121557, 29255, '<td valign="top">Light side lacks detail, so I''d say this is overexposured.</td>', 'Light side lacks detail, so I''d say this is overexposured.', '2004-11-22 09:50:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1027077, 121810, 29255, '<td valign="top">At first it was hard to see what this was about.</td>', 'At first it was hard to see what this was about.', '2004-11-22 09:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1027078, 121453, 29255, '<td valign="top">So little contrast goes well with lazy feeling. Quite used subject, but sky and unusual location makes it an image anyway.</td>', 'So little contrast goes well with lazy feeling. Quite used subject, but sky and unusual location makes it an image anyway.', '2004-11-22 09:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1027080, 121634, 29255, '<td valign="top">Beast inside!</td>', 'Beast inside!', '2004-11-22 09:52:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1027082, 121043, 29255, '<td valign="top">What a nice idea. Very well executed that so little has overlapped. But would be better without those 4 overlaps.</td>', 'What a nice idea. Very well executed that so little has overlapped. But would be better without those 4 overlaps.', '2004-11-22 09:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1027085, 121500, 29255, '<td valign="top">Many pins seem sharp but nothing on plant. Odd feeling :).</td>', 'Many pins seem sharp but nothing on plant. Odd feeling :).', '2004-11-22 09:54:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1027086, 122198, 29255, '<td valign="top">Original idea.</td>', 'Original idea.', '2004-11-22 09:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
