(1027100, 121263, 29255, '<td valign="top">Nice take on shades, forms and lines. I''m missing tones, but would have been hard for this one, wouldn''t it?</td>', 'Nice take on shades, forms and lines. I''m missing tones, but would have been hard for this one, wouldn''t it?', '2004-11-22 10:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
