(1027137, 120713, 29255, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t feel straight. Tones are good, and shape''s there. Still, doesn''t fly for me.</td>', 'Doesn''t feel straight. Tones are good, and shape''s there. Still, doesn''t fly for me.', '2004-11-22 10:14:24.000000', NULL, 1),
