(1027146, 120822, 29255, '<td valign="top">There''re islands and there are islands. Top tones work well, bottom tones are too gray.</td>', 'There''re islands and there are islands. Top tones work well, bottom tones are too gray.', '2004-11-22 10:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
