(1027722, 122041, 20204, '<td valign="top">Overexposure, motion blur, focus problems.  This shot doesn''t lend itself well to b/w because therer is very little contrast between design elements.</td>', 'Overexposure, motion blur, focus problems.  This shot doesn''t lend itself well to b/w because therer is very little contrast between design elements.', '2004-11-22 17:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
