(1027744, 121955, 29535, '<td valign="top">It''s too dark, with no real contrast between blacks and whites it''s not such a great exposure.  Also, the composition could do with some work, but this reeks of potetntial so definitely try again.</td>', 'It''s too dark, with no real contrast between blacks and whites it''s not such a great exposure.  Also, the composition could do with some work, but this reeks of potetntial so definitely try again.', '2004-11-22 17:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
