(1027771, 122167, 29535, '<td valign="top">This has potential.  The only advice I can give is practice your landscape-style shots.  Well done!</td>', 'This has potential.  The only advice I can give is practice your landscape-style shots.  Well done!', '2004-11-22 17:54:48.000000', NULL, 1),
