(1028185, 121306, 27293, '<td valign="top">Ah, should have moved the camera to the right just a little, so the ball is not right in the middle... would have been a 10. AS it is -- a 9.</td>', 'Ah, should have moved the camera to the right just a little, so the ball is not right in the middle... would have been a 10. AS it is -- a 9.', '2004-11-22 23:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
