(1028205, 121222, 18799, '<td valign="top">Returning for comments<br/> The sky gives this a magical feel.  I would have liked to have seen the towers more off to the right though - of course I don''t know what''s on the left side of the border.  In any event, good work  8</td>', 'Returning for comments The sky gives this a magical feel.  I would have liked to have seen the towers more off to the right though - of course I don''t know what''s on the left side of the border.  In any event, good work  8', '2004-11-23 00:03:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1028206, 120623, 18799, '<td valign="top">Certainly can''t say this doesn''t meet the challenge of shades of gray!  The sharpness is good, the diagonals are good and the shades are good - but there is just something lacking for me - I just can''t put my finger on it.  5</td>', 'Certainly can''t say this doesn''t meet the challenge of shades of gray!  The sharpness is good, the diagonals are good and the shades are good - but there is just something lacking for me - I just can''t put my finger on it.  5', '2004-11-23 00:05:40.000000', NULL, 1),
