(1028214, 120740, 18799, '<td valign="top">Nice effort, great sharpness and good interest with it on one leg like this.  Slight blow-out off the feathers on the left side of the beak - not that big a deal though.  6</td>', 'Nice effort, great sharpness and good interest with it on one leg like this.  Slight blow-out off the feathers on the left side of the beak - not that big a deal though.  6', '2004-11-23 00:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
