(1028218, 120583, 18799, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot (not crazy about the poo running down the side of the bust).  The background is a bit busy, I think a shallower DOF would have made a big difference.  5</td>', 'Interesting shot (not crazy about the poo running down the side of the bust).  The background is a bit busy, I think a shallower DOF would have made a big difference.  5', '2004-11-23 00:15:20.000000', NULL, 1),
