(1028241, 120578, 29168, '<td valign="top">Cast the light just right to avoid the knee (distracting), remove the objects at the right background  and this shot is a solid 10 imo. Awesome balance of negative space also imo. If this is self portrature you are to be complimented on an excellent pose under the timer. The subject himself needs no further compliments. Beautiful. 8. Bumped to 9. What can I say. I just love the form :) Good luck!</td>', 'Cast the light just right to avoid the knee (distracting), remove the objects at the right background  and this shot is a solid 10 imo. Awesome balance of negative space also imo. If this is self portrature you are to be complimented on an excellent pose under the timer. The subject himself needs no further compliments. Beautiful. 8. Bumped to 9. What can I say. I just love the form :) Good luck!', '2004-11-23 00:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1028242, 122194, 20662, '<td valign="top">Nice!</td>', 'Nice!', '2004-11-23 00:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1028243, 121512, 28771, '<td valign="top">That is a creative image with wonderful lighting. However I would spare myself he splinters and not ride these waves! :) (8)</td>', 'That is a creative image with wonderful lighting. However I would spare myself he splinters and not ride these waves! :) (8)', '2004-11-23 00:40:55.000000', NULL, 1),
