(1028258, 121844, 7190, '<td valign="top">this really a sweet photo the exposure on the left of the image is great but the upper right is a bit too over exposed . I can see maybe wanting to fade off but the bright area  in that corner is a bit jarring and I find it  distracting because it pulls my eye out of the frame.</td>', 'this really a sweet photo the exposure on the left of the image is great but the upper right is a bit too over exposed . I can see maybe wanting to fade off but the bright area  in that corner is a bit jarring and I find it  distracting because it pulls my eye out of the frame.', '2004-11-23 00:55:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1028283, 120740, 19311, '<td valign="top">This image is incredible with a wonderfull display of different shades.  Awesome work. 10</td>', 'This image is incredible with a wonderfull display of different shades.  Awesome work. 10', '2004-11-23 01:46:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1028284, 121399, 29437, '<td valign="top">I think this would do better with a broader range of values.  The subject is great, but there''s just so much white.</td>', 'I think this would do better with a broader range of values.  The subject is great, but there''s just so much white.', '2004-11-23 01:49:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1028287, 121811, 29437, '<td valign="top">Very technically nice.  I like the background of tiles, lines, and angles.  The shot angle is also very engaging.  I feel it is lacking in contrast, however.  Very nice capture of your subject.</td>', 'Very technically nice.  I like the background of tiles, lines, and angles.  The shot angle is also very engaging.  I feel it is lacking in contrast, however.  Very nice capture of your subject.', '2004-11-23 01:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1028290, 121457, 29437, '<td valign="top">excellent range of values.  It almost feels like it''s still in color.  If only there were a bit more contrast between the foreground trees and the immediate hill behind them to highlight the foreground subject.  Still, beautiful.  Definite 9.</td>', 'excellent range of values.  It almost feels like it''s still in color.  If only there were a bit more contrast between the foreground trees and the immediate hill behind them to highlight the foreground subject.  Still, beautiful.  Definite 9.', '2004-11-23 01:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
