(1028293, 121984, 29437, '<td valign="top">Using a sheet in the background would have hidden some of that out of focus bric-a-brac and could have been used to create more contrast (and creatively even more atmosphere).  Nice shot.</td>', 'Using a sheet in the background would have hidden some of that out of focus bric-a-brac and could have been used to create more contrast (and creatively even more atmosphere).  Nice shot.', '2004-11-23 02:02:22.000000', NULL, 1),
