(1028335, 121940, 29460, '<td valign="top">Well, once you get past the punny title...Its a really good shot.  Nice contrast, nice angle, dynamic, clear, and I like the negative space.</td>', 'Well, once you get past the punny title...Its a really good shot.  Nice contrast, nice angle, dynamic, clear, and I like the negative space.', '2004-11-23 02:34:10.000000', NULL, 1),
