(1028337, 121000, 28742, '<td valign="top">Pretty neat. I almost think it would''ve been more interesting without the girl - just the shadow. Spoooky.  ;-)</td>', 'Pretty neat. I almost think it would''ve been more interesting without the girl - just the shadow. Spoooky.  ;-)', '2004-11-23 02:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1028340, 120825, 29460, '<td valign="top">Add a caption ("When I grow up, I want to go SHOPPING!") and you could make some money selling posters.  Nice contrast, texture and line, and you capture her personality well.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Add a caption ("When I grow up, I want to go SHOPPING!") and you could make some money selling posters.  Nice contrast, texture and line, and you capture her personality well.  Nicely done.', '2004-11-23 02:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
