(1028510, 122010, 27767, '<td valign="top">Very interesting subject, though the perfect framing from edge to edge, and the lack of a specific point of interest makes the shot feel more plain than it could be.  I bet this barn has tons of interesting detail upclose.  I would love to see a shot showing the weathered texture of some of the boards, or rusted nails, or moss growing in the shade and using an interesting angle or crop.</td>', 'Very interesting subject, though the perfect framing from edge to edge, and the lack of a specific point of interest makes the shot feel more plain than it could be.  I bet this barn has tons of interesting detail upclose.  I would love to see a shot showing the weathered texture of some of the boards, or rusted nails, or moss growing in the shade and using an interesting angle or crop.', '2004-11-23 07:40:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1028512, 121761, 27767, '<td valign="top">I like the path and closest tree on the left, though the shot feels really busy.  I think it is so much of the small undergrowth with highlights and shade.  Maybe a softer light that would show less texture of all the small plant leaves would soften the shot enough that the path is a clear point of focus.</td>', 'I like the path and closest tree on the left, though the shot feels really busy.  I think it is so much of the small undergrowth with highlights and shade.  Maybe a softer light that would show less texture of all the small plant leaves would soften the shot enough that the path is a clear point of focus.', '2004-11-23 07:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
