(1028663, 122194, 28741, '<td valign="top">I would have voted a higher mark if you had the shadow in focus and allowed the player to be out of focus, this would have given them equal weight and offered the viewer a choice of who to listen to..so to speek.</td>', 'I would have voted a higher mark if you had the shadow in focus and allowed the player to be out of focus, this would have given them equal weight and offered the viewer a choice of who to listen to..so to speek.', '2004-11-23 10:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
