(1028677, 121941, 20679, '<td valign="top">I really enjoy looking at this. It is almost liek a charcoal drawing and the eyes are lovely. I would be interested to see a similar treatment with the model looking at the camera as I wonder if that wouldn''t have an even stronger connection with the viewer. But this is one of my favorites. 9</td>', 'I really enjoy looking at this. It is almost liek a charcoal drawing and the eyes are lovely. I would be interested to see a similar treatment with the model looking at the camera as I wonder if that wouldn''t have an even stronger connection with the viewer. But this is one of my favorites. 9', '2004-11-23 10:43:18.000000', NULL, 1),
