(1028685, 121743, 20679, '<td valign="top">I''ve tried these kind of shots before and they are hard to get right.  I find the striped shirt a little distracting and the light is a bit harsh coming from above. If your cameral allows it, using a slow flash with a long exposure can be effective as it provided a sharp, in focus view of the hands in addition to some transparency and movement</td>', 'I''ve tried these kind of shots before and they are hard to get right.  I find the striped shirt a little distracting and the light is a bit harsh coming from above. If your cameral allows it, using a slow flash with a long exposure can be effective as it provided a sharp, in focus view of the hands in addition to some transparency and movement', '2004-11-23 10:50:55.000000', NULL, 1),
