(1028953, 121144, 28771, '<td valign="top">Now that is a stately looking edifice. I look at this image and hear a swelling score punctuated by booming drums. This cathedral would be central to the plot. But this image doesn''t cry "hope" for me. Black and white somehow causes that. The lack of color makes that building more aggressive looking.  (7)</td>', 'Now that is a stately looking edifice. I look at this image and hear a swelling score punctuated by booming drums. This cathedral would be central to the plot. But this image doesn''t cry "hope" for me. Black and white somehow causes that. The lack of color makes that building more aggressive looking.  (7)', '2004-11-23 12:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
