(1029168, 122081, 20679, '<td valign="top">there''s something great about this portrait - the lighting and pose are good but I''m afraid I''m not keen on the dark cloth (towel?) as the shape looks too much like a mirror image of the model''s jeans and detracts from the strong shape created by her legs. Also I think the bottom right hand corner is too busy, and the finger looks like it is not attached to the body. Perhaps by cropping closer at the bottom of the shot it would have been stronger?</td>', 'there''s something great about this portrait - the lighting and pose are good but I''m afraid I''m not keen on the dark cloth (towel?) as the shape looks too much like a mirror image of the model''s jeans and detracts from the strong shape created by her legs. Also I think the bottom right hand corner is too busy, and the finger looks like it is not attached to the body. Perhaps by cropping closer at the bottom of the shot it would have been stronger?', '2004-11-23 15:41:18.000000', NULL, 1),
