(1029515, 121928, 18799, '<td valign="top">The major issues with this photo for me are that the wall is so strong that it negatively competes for attention and the lighting is very harsh.<br/>Please don''t take offense to this comment, but she looks more drunk that musing.</td>', 'The major issues with this photo for me are that the wall is so strong that it negatively competes for attention and the lighting is very harsh.Please don''t take offense to this comment, but she looks more drunk that musing.', '2004-11-23 20:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
