(1029628, 121655, 11800, '<td valign="top">It is most likely my monitor but this seems extremly dark. I do try to make sure all the bars are showing at the bottom of the page. They are showing right now but all I can see is half of the bottle label, the foam, and gui on the mug. Sorry. This would have been a wonderful picture.</td>', 'It is most likely my monitor but this seems extremly dark. I do try to make sure all the bars are showing at the bottom of the page. They are showing right now but all I can see is half of the bottle label, the foam, and gui on the mug. Sorry. This would have been a wonderful picture.', '2004-11-23 21:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
