(1029667, 121744, 11800, '<td valign="top">What I''ve noticed is that the photograper can improve on a trite idea, the picture will get low marks. I like the profile reflection in the top of the glass.  That is new! What lets the picture down is the dingy white and not so sharp focus. I think both of these could have been corrected using the basic editing rules.</td>', 'What I''ve noticed is that the photograper can improve on a trite idea, the picture will get low marks. I like the profile reflection in the top of the glass.  That is new! What lets the picture down is the dingy white and not so sharp focus. I think both of these could have been corrected using the basic editing rules.', '2004-11-23 21:36:48.000000', NULL, 1),
