(1029685, 121255, 11800, '<td valign="top">This does have an erie feel to it. Looks like something left empty. The reasons I didn''t give this a high score are the blown out branches and the contrast. Maybe go back just at sunset and try to get more even lighting. That should help with both the contrast and the problem with the branches.</td>', 'This does have an erie feel to it. Looks like something left empty. The reasons I didn''t give this a high score are the blown out branches and the contrast. Maybe go back just at sunset and try to get more even lighting. That should help with both the contrast and the problem with the branches.', '2004-11-23 21:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
