(1029858, 120542, 6008, '<td valign="top">Good detail on the heron, wonderful reflection, and I love the perspective - it feels like I''m in the water with the bird. The tones and contrast are good and I''m sure it looks just as good in color.</td>', 'Good detail on the heron, wonderful reflection, and I love the perspective - it feels like I''m in the water with the bird. The tones and contrast are good and I''m sure it looks just as good in color.', '2004-11-23 23:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029859, 121445, 13119, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, i like how the whites fade into the distance.<br/>a Strong &lt;8&gt;</td>', 'Nice picture, i like how the whites fade into the distance.a Strong <8>', '2004-11-23 23:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029863, 121483, 12573, '<td valign="top">My only 10 of the challenge.  I''m not sure why, but this image captivates me.  I must be boring and mundane. LOL!</td>', 'My only 10 of the challenge.  I''m not sure why, but this image captivates me.  I must be boring and mundane. LOL!', '2004-11-23 23:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029864, 122137, 13119, '<td valign="top">Nice stuff!<br/>6</td>', 'Nice stuff!6', '2004-11-23 23:10:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029865, 121981, 18799, '<td valign="top">Good take on the challenge.  Unfortunately, the black and white doesn''t highlight the colors very well, but the pattern  is interesting  5</td>', 'Good take on the challenge.  Unfortunately, the black and white doesn''t highlight the colors very well, but the pattern  is interesting  5', '2004-11-23 23:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029867, 121913, 18799, '<td valign="top">Nice image with good detail.  The feeling of dilapidated comes through very well.  I like the shadows in the doorway.</td>', 'Nice image with good detail.  The feeling of dilapidated comes through very well.  I like the shadows in the doorway.', '2004-11-23 23:12:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029868, 121148, 6008, '<td valign="top">I love the mood in this shot formed by the fog, color, and softness. It''s almost like a scene from Jack the Ripper. All the elements come together to make a nice timeless image.</td>', 'I love the mood in this shot formed by the fog, color, and softness. It''s almost like a scene from Jack the Ripper. All the elements come together to make a nice timeless image.', '2004-11-23 23:12:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029870, 122202, 12573, '<td valign="top">Fresh and vibrant.  I like this relationship established between the woman and puppy.  The background is a distraction though.  I also, I think you could have cropped some more out of the top and gotten a stronger image.  Lastly, the post-processing seems to have smoothed out the woman''s face a bit too much, making her face seem flattened.</td>', 'Fresh and vibrant.  I like this relationship established between the woman and puppy.  The background is a distraction though.  I also, I think you could have cropped some more out of the top and gotten a stronger image.  Lastly, the post-processing seems to have smoothed out the woman''s face a bit too much, making her face seem flattened.', '2004-11-23 23:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029871, 121191, 13119, '<td valign="top">I like the crop although i would have liked to have seen a little more of the center.<br/>Nice photo though.<br/>A 7</td>', 'I like the crop although i would have liked to have seen a little more of the center.Nice photo though.A 7', '2004-11-23 23:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029872, 121403, 18799, '<td valign="top">While it is in b/w and therefor meets the challenge, I don''t see anything of any real interest here.  Not trying to sound harsh.</td>', 'While it is in b/w and therefor meets the challenge, I don''t see anything of any real interest here.  Not trying to sound harsh.', '2004-11-23 23:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029873, 121496, 13119, '<td valign="top">A little busy but a nice reflection.<br/>&lt;7&gt;</td>', 'A little busy but a nice reflection.<7>', '2004-11-23 23:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029874, 121487, 6008, '<td valign="top">The tones are great and I love the soft glow. Having the diagonal branch coming into the shot adds interest and leads the eye nicely. Wonderful image, very peaceful.</td>', 'The tones are great and I love the soft glow. Having the diagonal branch coming into the shot adds interest and leads the eye nicely. Wonderful image, very peaceful.', '2004-11-23 23:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029875, 122029, 12573, '<td valign="top">Excellent work here.  The only niggle is that there appear to be two horizons in the image, seemingly tilted in opposite directions.  You made the right choice by making the tree perfectly vertical, but the horizontal orientation points out the flaw in the horizon.  Re-compose in the portrait/vertical orientation and you have a winner.</td>', 'Excellent work here.  The only niggle is that there appear to be two horizons in the image, seemingly tilted in opposite directions.  You made the right choice by making the tree perfectly vertical, but the horizontal orientation points out the flaw in the horizon.  Re-compose in the portrait/vertical orientation and you have a winner.', '2004-11-23 23:16:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029876, 120429, 18799, '<td valign="top">I do get the feeling of fillilng the hand from the photo.  The photo is very sharp, and the black background sets of the nice contrasts in the photo.  A little nit from me...  I don''t care much for that little piece of thumb in the lower left.  I would have liked either more, or none at all, better. Maybe just me.</td>', 'I do get the feeling of fillilng the hand from the photo.  The photo is very sharp, and the black background sets of the nice contrasts in the photo.  A little nit from me...  I don''t care much for that little piece of thumb in the lower left.  I would have liked either more, or none at all, better. Maybe just me.', '2004-11-23 23:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029878, 121490, 19982, '<td valign="top">I love this shot  From the intricate details in the very center, to the blurred, but still visible details around the edges.  From what I''ve seen (admittedly only about 60%) this one gets the blue.  GOOD LUCK!  :-)</td>', 'I love this shot  From the intricate details in the very center, to the blurred, but still visible details around the edges.  From what I''ve seen (admittedly only about 60%) this one gets the blue.  GOOD LUCK!  :-)', '2004-11-23 23:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029880, 121924, 18799, '<td valign="top">This does look like wintery, cold and barren.  Because the tree can''t be offset to thirds, I think it would have been better symetrical so the crop was equal on both sides of the tree.  Otherwise, well done.</td>', 'This does look like wintery, cold and barren.  Because the tree can''t be offset to thirds, I think it would have been better symetrical so the crop was equal on both sides of the tree.  Otherwise, well done.', '2004-11-23 23:19:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029882, 121587, 23680, '<td valign="top">Great job - one of my favorites, love the negative space</td>', 'Great job - one of my favorites, love the negative space', '2004-11-23 23:21:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029884, 120539, 23680, '<td valign="top">Hey, I know who that is - how''d that happen :)</td>', 'Hey, I know who that is - how''d that happen :)', '2004-11-23 23:22:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029885, 121512, 23680, '<td valign="top">This just cracked me up - great original idea - Thanks :)</td>', 'This just cracked me up - great original idea - Thanks :)', '2004-11-23 23:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029886, 121445, 6532, '<td valign="top">Awesome macro of an eye - but that light spot - I have not decided - does it distract or add????</td>', 'Awesome macro of an eye - but that light spot - I have not decided - does it distract or add????', '2004-11-23 23:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029887, 121226, 23680, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous</td>', 'Gorgeous', '2004-11-23 23:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029888, 121242, 23680, '<td valign="top">I am a sucker for flower pictures, I''m sure these are gorgeous in real life, but I like them just as much in B&amp;W 10</td>', 'I am a sucker for flower pictures, I''m sure these are gorgeous in real life, but I like them just as much in B&W 10', '2004-11-23 23:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029889, 121546, 18799, '<td valign="top">I keep coming back to this image.  When I orginially viewed it, my first reaction was that it is too noisy, and the face is too light.   After two or three times, I''m beginning to like the image.  I still think the face is a little bright, but it could be a bright scene in the movie.  You''ve captured and old time photo look in this theatre.  The compostion is really good.  I orginally gave this a 5, I''m bumping to 8</td>', 'I keep coming back to this image.  When I orginially viewed it, my first reaction was that it is too noisy, and the face is too light.   After two or three times, I''m beginning to like the image.  I still think the face is a little bright, but it could be a bright scene in the movie.  You''ve captured and old time photo look in this theatre.  The compostion is really good.  I orginally gave this a 5, I''m bumping to 8', '2004-11-23 23:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029890, 121832, 23680, '<td valign="top">I think these are shower heads, whatever they are, they work - good job!</td>', 'I think these are shower heads, whatever they are, they work - good job!', '2004-11-23 23:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029892, 121134, 23680, '<td valign="top">This is absolutely gorgeous, one of my favorites in this challenge and maybe on all of DPC 10</td>', 'This is absolutely gorgeous, one of my favorites in this challenge and maybe on all of DPC 10', '2004-11-23 23:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029893, 121767, 23680, '<td valign="top">Too out of focus and the border is too much</td>', 'Too out of focus and the border is too much', '2004-11-23 23:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029896, 121912, 23680, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t look like black and white to me</td>', 'Doesn''t look like black and white to me', '2004-11-23 23:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029898, 121289, 18799, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting choice.  At first I didn''t care for it, and gave it a 4.  I''m looking at it again, and like the motion-blurred cats - there is kind of an emotive feel to it.  I''m bumping to 7</td>', 'This is an interesting choice.  At first I didn''t care for it, and gave it a 4.  I''m looking at it again, and like the motion-blurred cats - there is kind of an emotive feel to it.  I''m bumping to 7', '2004-11-23 23:26:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029899, 121403, 23680, '<td valign="top">Too out of focus</td>', 'Too out of focus', '2004-11-23 23:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029901, 122195, 23680, '<td valign="top">Black and white ?</td>', 'Black and white ?', '2004-11-23 23:27:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029903, 122143, 18799, '<td valign="top">The lighting flattens out most of the detail in this photo.</td>', 'The lighting flattens out most of the detail in this photo.', '2004-11-23 23:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029904, 121227, 23680, '<td valign="top">The shadow on the front leaf is distracting</td>', 'The shadow on the front leaf is distracting', '2004-11-23 23:28:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029906, 122082, 23680, '<td valign="top">Kind of snapshoty</td>', 'Kind of snapshoty', '2004-11-23 23:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029907, 120579, 18799, '<td valign="top">I love the shadows.  Overall, it''s a little flat.  I''m wondering if some levels and contrast adjustment would have made it "pop".   Interesting choice of subjects!</td>', 'I love the shadows.  Overall, it''s a little flat.  I''m wondering if some levels and contrast adjustment would have made it "pop".   Interesting choice of subjects!', '2004-11-23 23:29:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029908, 121671, 25464, '<td valign="top">This is almost abstract.  Some will hate it.  Some will like it.  I am really a bit unsure, but I think you captured the dog beautifully.  I am just not sure about the background.  It definitely makes it stand out, which is probably a good thing with so many entries.  Good luck.</td>', 'This is almost abstract.  Some will hate it.  Some will like it.  I am really a bit unsure, but I think you captured the dog beautifully.  I am just not sure about the background.  It definitely makes it stand out, which is probably a good thing with so many entries.  Good luck.', '2004-11-23 23:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029912, 121768, 23680, '<td valign="top">Very nice abstract and I''m not a big fan of snow, but I like this - 10</td>', 'Very nice abstract and I''m not a big fan of snow, but I like this - 10', '2004-11-23 23:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029913, 120798, 18799, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, the tree is in better focus that the boy.   For a photo like this to work, the eyes have to be tack sharp  IMO</td>', 'Unfortunately, the tree is in better focus that the boy.   For a photo like this to work, the eyes have to be tack sharp  IMO', '2004-11-23 23:32:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029915, 121063, 23680, '<td valign="top">Very emotional</td>', 'Very emotional', '2004-11-23 23:34:04.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1029916, 121671, 23680, '<td valign="top">This is one of the best dog pictures I''ve seen :)   just beautiful</td>', 'This is one of the best dog pictures I''ve seen :)   just beautiful', '2004-11-23 23:34:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029917, 121067, 18799, '<td valign="top">Interesting how you''ve tilted the photo to make the smoke appear vertical.  Creative touch.  I''m not sure what the TV image in the background adds though</td>', 'Interesting how you''ve tilted the photo to make the smoke appear vertical.  Creative touch.  I''m not sure what the TV image in the background adds though', '2004-11-23 23:34:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029918, 121148, 25464, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot; however, I think it could have been improved with something in the foreground in sharp focus like a tree branch or a boat.</td>', 'I really like this shot; however, I think it could have been improved with something in the foreground in sharp focus like a tree branch or a boat.', '2004-11-23 23:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029921, 121642, 25464, '<td valign="top">Lovely, crisp, great light and reflection.  The brickwork adds great texture to the photo.  This should be a top 10 in my opinion.</td>', 'Lovely, crisp, great light and reflection.  The brickwork adds great texture to the photo.  This should be a top 10 in my opinion.', '2004-11-23 23:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029922, 121134, 25464, '<td valign="top">A really nice subject for black and white.  Good job.</td>', 'A really nice subject for black and white.  Good job.', '2004-11-23 23:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029925, 121744, 18799, '<td valign="top">I''m not keen about the angle you''ve chosen to shoot from, it makes for weird reflections in the glass opening.  There is also some color in the photo which I''m sure you''ve heard already so I won''t belabor it.</td>', 'I''m not keen about the angle you''ve chosen to shoot from, it makes for weird reflections in the glass opening.  There is also some color in the photo which I''m sure you''ve heard already so I won''t belabor it.', '2004-11-23 23:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029926, 121587, 23394, '<td valign="top">lovely range of tones.  nice detail.  i enjoy looking at this.</td>', 'lovely range of tones.  nice detail.  i enjoy looking at this.', '2004-11-23 23:39:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029927, 122210, 25464, '<td valign="top">Not a big fan of the kitty shot; however, this one is great. 8.</td>', 'Not a big fan of the kitty shot; however, this one is great. 8.', '2004-11-23 23:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029928, 122011, 23394, '<td valign="top">very enjoyable image.  very sharp.</td>', 'very enjoyable image.  very sharp.', '2004-11-23 23:40:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029929, 121445, 18799, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp high key look to this.  I think the reflection may be a little big, but just minor nit.</td>', 'Nice sharp high key look to this.  I think the reflection may be a little big, but just minor nit.', '2004-11-23 23:40:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029930, 121058, 23394, '<td valign="top">very trusting eyes.  seems to be either very used to the lens, or fond of it...time will tell.  enjoy these moments while you can.</td>', 'very trusting eyes.  seems to be either very used to the lens, or fond of it...time will tell.  enjoy these moments while you can.', '2004-11-23 23:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029932, 121496, 18799, '<td valign="top">This reflection photo, while sharp and well composed, is also very busy.  There also seems to be a lot of color tone in it, is this because of in-camera conversion?</td>', 'This reflection photo, while sharp and well composed, is also very busy.  There also seems to be a lot of color tone in it, is this because of in-camera conversion?', '2004-11-23 23:42:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029933, 121592, 25464, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely pose and lovely expression.  I would say it needs a little more contrast and the focus seems the slightest bit soft.</td>', 'This is a lovely pose and lovely expression.  I would say it needs a little more contrast and the focus seems the slightest bit soft.', '2004-11-23 23:42:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029934, 121608, 3214, '<td valign="top">love this, great composition, tones and use of light--top ten?</td>', 'love this, great composition, tones and use of light--top ten?', '2004-11-23 23:42:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029935, 121245, 23394, '<td valign="top">i think this could be a great image, but this version seems a bit over-processed.</td>', 'i think this could be a great image, but this version seems a bit over-processed.', '2004-11-23 23:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029938, 121107, 23394, '<td valign="top">great lines, great angle/perspective.</td>', 'great lines, great angle/perspective.', '2004-11-23 23:43:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029941, 121482, 23394, '<td valign="top">a little too tightly cropped</td>', 'a little too tightly cropped', '2004-11-23 23:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029942, 121490, 3214, '<td valign="top">Dynamite job making the ordinary extraordinary.</td>', 'Dynamite job making the ordinary extraordinary.', '2004-11-23 23:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029944, 121104, 23394, '<td valign="top">i guess you forgot to take out all the color?  too bad, because this would be a great image.  maybe you''ll revisit it without the constraints of basic editing?</td>', 'i guess you forgot to take out all the color?  too bad, because this would be a great image.  maybe you''ll revisit it without the constraints of basic editing?', '2004-11-23 23:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029945, 121481, 23394, '<td valign="top">could use a little more range of light</td>', 'could use a little more range of light', '2004-11-23 23:45:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029946, 121340, 23394, '<td valign="top">this could use a bit more focus.</td>', 'this could use a bit more focus.', '2004-11-23 23:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029947, 120750, 3214, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF and universal appeal</td>', 'Nice DOF and universal appeal', '2004-11-23 23:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029948, 120727, 23394, '<td valign="top">not sure how this image wound up like this, but it is a little too grainy for me.</td>', 'not sure how this image wound up like this, but it is a little too grainy for me.', '2004-11-23 23:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029949, 121117, 3214, '<td valign="top">nice old photo feel</td>', 'nice old photo feel', '2004-11-23 23:47:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029950, 121970, 23394, '<td valign="top">a little flat and a little blown out.  adusting levels could help it pop more.  maybe cropping a little tighter might help as well.</td>', 'a little flat and a little blown out.  adusting levels could help it pop more.  maybe cropping a little tighter might help as well.', '2004-11-23 23:49:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029952, 121883, 12573, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see a tighter crop on the bird on the right.  I''m sure it''s been said already, but the remainder of the image is not really interesting to me.  Still, the backlighting is superb and the foliage in the background lends itself to the subject.  Next time, though, get closer and see what comes of it. :)</td>', 'I would have liked to see a tighter crop on the bird on the right.  I''m sure it''s been said already, but the remainder of the image is not really interesting to me.  Still, the backlighting is superb and the foliage in the background lends itself to the subject.  Next time, though, get closer and see what comes of it. :)', '2004-11-23 23:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029954, 121283, 23394, '<td valign="top">i think i would like this more if you had backed up about 30-40 feet, and given me more of its surroundings.</td>', 'i think i would like this more if you had backed up about 30-40 feet, and given me more of its surroundings.', '2004-11-23 23:50:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029955, 121038, 255, '<td valign="top">gene simmons a demon? i can see that. ;) fun shot--awesome contrasts. :)</td>', 'gene simmons a demon? i can see that. ;) fun shot--awesome contrasts. :)', '2004-11-23 23:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029959, 120801, 12573, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  A tight crop such as this is a welcome addition to a challenge full of clunky backgrounds.  I''m not sure whether the grain is helpful to the image or not.  Jury is still out.  His hair looks a little strange, though I imagine it''s the nature of the exposure and the post-editing that was done.  All in all, a strong and emotive image. 8</td>', 'Very nice.  A tight crop such as this is a welcome addition to a challenge full of clunky backgrounds.  I''m not sure whether the grain is helpful to the image or not.  Jury is still out.  His hair looks a little strange, though I imagine it''s the nature of the exposure and the post-editing that was done.  All in all, a strong and emotive image. 8', '2004-11-23 23:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029962, 122019, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice image, especially the lighting.  i know someone will be happy to have this hanging on their wall.  [note:  not that this has anything to do with scoring, but titles in all caps are a bit hard on the eyes]</td>', 'nice image, especially the lighting.  i know someone will be happy to have this hanging on their wall.  [note:  not that this has anything to do with scoring, but titles in all caps are a bit hard on the eyes]', '2004-11-23 23:53:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029963, 121771, 12253, '<td valign="top">This is great.  Wonderful tones, wonderful vision.  My top pick--though I''m not sure the site population has the vision to pick this!</td>', 'This is great.  Wonderful tones, wonderful vision.  My top pick--though I''m not sure the site population has the vision to pick this!', '2004-11-23 23:54:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029964, 121527, 23394, '<td valign="top">i like this, just wish it was a little sharper.</td>', 'i like this, just wish it was a little sharper.', '2004-11-23 23:54:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029965, 121564, 12253, '<td valign="top">This is exquisite!<br/> <br/>Edit: Fixed typo.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-11-24 00:41:43.</i></td>', 'This is exquisite! Edit: Fixed typo.', '2004-11-23 23:54:37.000000', '2004-11-24 00:41:43.000000', 1),
(1029966, 121820, 12573, '<td valign="top">There''s just a lack of a compelling subject here.  The dichotomy of the two colors of chain is lost among the garbled jumble of plant growth.  Perhaps some symmetry would work well with the chains leading the viewer into (or out of) the scene.  The contrast between black and white/light and dark is always interesting and I think you should have explored it further.</td>', 'There''s just a lack of a compelling subject here.  The dichotomy of the two colors of chain is lost among the garbled jumble of plant growth.  Perhaps some symmetry would work well with the chains leading the viewer into (or out of) the scene.  The contrast between black and white/light and dark is always interesting and I think you should have explored it further.', '2004-11-23 23:55:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029967, 122176, 12253, '<td valign="top">Great crop, good detail.  The light area in the chest is a bit distracting, but oh that face!  In the top ten for sure.</td>', 'Great crop, good detail.  The light area in the chest is a bit distracting, but oh that face!  In the top ten for sure.', '2004-11-23 23:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029968, 121107, 12253, '<td valign="top">Great perspective, wonderful shot.</td>', 'Great perspective, wonderful shot.', '2004-11-23 23:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029970, 121216, 23394, '<td valign="top">great shot, just wish you had corrected the tilt on the horizon...</td>', 'great shot, just wish you had corrected the tilt on the horizon...', '2004-11-23 23:56:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029971, 122150, 12573, '<td valign="top">Interesting compostion.  The inclusion of the foliage on the left is, well, unnecessary.  Perhaps getting closer and making the s-curve in the bridge entirely fill the frame would have improved the shot.  Also, you may want to explore bumping up the contrast a bit. The toning seems a little washed out.</td>', 'Interesting compostion.  The inclusion of the foliage on the left is, well, unnecessary.  Perhaps getting closer and making the s-curve in the bridge entirely fill the frame would have improved the shot.  Also, you may want to explore bumping up the contrast a bit. The toning seems a little washed out.', '2004-11-23 23:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1029972, 121104, 93, '<td valign="top">I don''t know whether to score this lower because I can see color.. or higher because it''s a unique view of the challenge..<br/> <br/></td>', 'I don''t know whether to score this lower because I can see color.. or higher because it''s a unique view of the challenge.. ', '2004-11-23 23:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
