(1030053, 121587, 10413, '<td valign="top">I swear I had a feeling this was yours. Outstanding Judith!  Congratulations on your 6th place win.<br/>I posted at 2am this morning when I woke up to go to the bathroom and just had to check out the results (don''t laugh I know there of many of you who do the same thing):)  I just had to come back and comment again. Judith this is exceptional. It pleases me to see how far you have come in the last couple of years.  Your work was great when we first met, but now everything you do makes me say WOW.  I see a ribbon in your near future.  You are just coming too close not to get one soon.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-11-24 10:01:48.</i></td>', 'I swear I had a feeling this was yours. Outstanding Judith!  Congratulations on your 6th place win.I posted at 2am this morning when I woke up to go to the bathroom and just had to check out the results (don''t laugh I know there of many of you who do the same thing):)  I just had to come back and comment again. Judith this is exceptional. It pleases me to see how far you have come in the last couple of years.  Your work was great when we first met, but now everything you do makes me say WOW.  I see a ribbon in your near future.  You are just coming too close not to get one soon.', '2004-11-24 00:18:14.000000', '2004-11-24 10:01:48.000000', 0),
