(1030188, 122183, 11800, '<td valign="top">Bravo. I thought it was glass but the bottom threw me. If you retake it, move back and then crop. That way you might get more in focus.</td>', 'Bravo. I thought it was glass but the bottom threw me. If you retake it, move back and then crop. That way you might get more in focus.', '2004-11-24 00:49:05.000000', NULL, 0),
