(1030190, 122188, 16241, '<td valign="top">glad to see you ribboned, thought you would, excellent shot.</td>', 'glad to see you ribboned, thought you would, excellent shot.', '2004-11-24 00:49:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(1030197, 120822, 11078, '<td valign="top">wow this is lovely well done</td>', 'wow this is lovely well done', '2004-11-24 00:50:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(1030200, 120539, 3102, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by lentil:</b></div><hr/><i> Great photo. I have to ask how on earth did you get this and did Boston Rob approve? :o) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Heh... Amber is a friend -- she lives in a nearby community :)  I shot a bunch of photos of her last week, some of which I''ll use on her web site, and I''m probably going to use some to promote my own photography work, too.  She''s a super person who has managed to stay quite down to earth despite becoming a heavily-sought after millionaire this year!<br/> <br/>Thanks to everyone for the kind comments -- I was quite pleasantly surprised at how well this did in such a large pool of entries!  And yes, I would have done this a bit differently had this been an advanced editing challenge.  I knew the collar would be an issue...<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-11-24 00:56:44.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by lentil: Great photo. I have to ask how on earth did you get this and did Boston Rob approve? :o)   Heh... Amber is a friend -- she lives in a nearby community :)  I shot a bunch of photos of her last week, some of which I''ll use on her web site, and I''m probably going to use some to promote my own photography work, too.  She''s a super person who has managed to stay quite down to earth despite becoming a heavily-sought after millionaire this year! Thanks to everyone for the kind comments -- I was quite pleasantly surprised at how well this did in such a large pool of entries!  And yes, I would have done this a bit differently had this been an advanced editing challenge.  I knew the collar would be an issue...', '2004-11-24 00:51:08.000000', '2004-11-24 00:56:44.000000', 0),
(1030202, 121222, 11078, '<td valign="top">lovely work Congrats on the blue</td>', 'lovely work Congrats on the blue', '2004-11-24 00:52:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(1030204, 121058, 93, '<td valign="top">I think you definitely got the "I''m tired of seeing babies/children" hit..  (I think my shot got it too).. but 119 is nothing to sniff at!<br/> <br/>This is such a fantastic, wonderfully candid portrait.. and.. I''ll never tire of seeing babies/children when done so beautifully.</td>', 'I think you definitely got the "I''m tired of seeing babies/children" hit..  (I think my shot got it too).. but 119 is nothing to sniff at! This is such a fantastic, wonderfully candid portrait.. and.. I''ll never tire of seeing babies/children when done so beautifully.', '2004-11-24 00:52:51.000000', NULL, 0),
