(1030217, 121040, 27293, '<td valign="top">I suppose the depth of field or the position of the focus plane should have been slightly different, so that the line itself is at least partially in focus. Otherwise it''s a very nice self (?, looks like your picture on the author''s page) portrait. Grain and blur all work, i agree that you can almost see the thoughts. Pretty good lighting, maybe only somewhat questionable composition. I would probably move the camera slightly south-east. I was one of the five sevens you got.</td>', 'I suppose the depth of field or the position of the focus plane should have been slightly different, so that the line itself is at least partially in focus. Otherwise it''s a very nice self (?, looks like your picture on the author''s page) portrait. Grain and blur all work, i agree that you can almost see the thoughts. Pretty good lighting, maybe only somewhat questionable composition. I would probably move the camera slightly south-east. I was one of the five sevens you got.', '2004-11-24 00:55:19.000000', NULL, 0),
