(1030631, 121959, 11800, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 4 on my first pass. But then I kept looking at the thumbnail and thinking how unique it was. I like how the little blades of grass are leaning up against the window as if they want to come into the warm dryness. So I bumped up your score. Good job.</td>', 'I gave this a 4 on my first pass. But then I kept looking at the thumbnail and thinking how unique it was. I like how the little blades of grass are leaning up against the window as if they want to come into the warm dryness. So I bumped up your score. Good job.', '2004-11-24 03:10:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(1030635, 121238, 27440, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for voting on me ! <br/> <br/>And now some explaining :)<br/> <br/>It''s a STARGATE and you''re about to fall into it. It can''t be off- center!<br/>It''s in front as a gate so that you can walk into it :)<br/>The middle is also black intentionaly, like in a whirl- you can''t<br/>See the center untill you enter. The leading lines are pulling you right into the black unknown, well that was my intention.<br/> <br/>Oh it''s not back lit it''s lit from above. It was reflecting light and it created a very interesting light show.<br/>Here is the original in colour the way it came out of the camera :)<br/>//www.widzew.net/~insane/P1010187.JPG.<br/> <br/>Cheers<br/></td>', 'Thank you all for voting on me !  And now some explaining :) It''s a STARGATE and you''re about to fall into it. It can''t be off- center!It''s in front as a gate so that you can walk into it :)The middle is also black intentionaly, like in a whirl- you can''tSee the center untill you enter. The leading lines are pulling you right into the black unknown, well that was my intention. Oh it''s not back lit it''s lit from above. It was reflecting light and it created a very interesting light show.Here is the original in colour the way it came out of the camera :)//www.widzew.net/~insane/P1010187.JPG. Cheers', '2004-11-24 03:15:48.000000', NULL, 0),
