(1030725, 121812, 29196, '<td valign="top">I realized now that an better crop would be done.  That is the best reward from challenges: knowledge, learning and consciousness.<br/> <br/>Thanks all for comments.</td>', 'I realized now that an better crop would be done.  That is the best reward from challenges: knowledge, learning and consciousness. Thanks all for comments.', '2004-11-24 05:08:15.000000', NULL, 0),
