(1030729, 121866, 29535, '<td valign="top">Thanks everyone, this got some good reviews a few days prior to the contest (I submitted within hours of the closing) and I thought I''d give it a shot.  Some people liked the darkness, some didn''t, that''s cool it''s all relative.<br/>Thank you!  173/638 is nothing to be ashamed of!</td>', 'Thanks everyone, this got some good reviews a few days prior to the contest (I submitted within hours of the closing) and I thought I''d give it a shot.  Some people liked the darkness, some didn''t, that''s cool it''s all relative.Thank you!  173/638 is nothing to be ashamed of!', '2004-11-24 05:11:43.000000', NULL, 0),
