(1030791, 122070, 24486, '<td valign="top">I''m a little surprised with your placing &amp; that 105 voters gave you a 5.<br/>I gave this a 10 &amp; was sure this was in the top 3.Keep it up, this is a wonderful photograph.</td>', 'I''m a little surprised with your placing & that 105 voters gave you a 5.I gave this a 10 & was sure this was in the top 3.Keep it up, this is a wonderful photograph.', '2004-11-24 05:51:17.000000', NULL, 0);
