(1030831, 121649, 24951, '<td valign="top">10 from me too. I can''t believe this photo is not in the top ten.<br/>Not only is the light,lines and textures great, it can be difficult to express the beauty of flora in b&amp;w.Great dof also.</td>', '10 from me too. I can''t believe this photo is not in the top ten.Not only is the light,lines and textures great, it can be difficult to express the beauty of flora in b&w.Great dof also.', '2004-11-24 06:40:29.000000', NULL, 0),
