(1030842, 122210, 24951, '<td valign="top">Can''t say I''m a cat  photo fan either, but I thought this was great - I also have a cat and realize trying to photography these beasts can be a difficult task. Should have done a lot better score-wise.</td>', 'Can''t say I''m a cat  photo fan either, but I thought this was great - I also have a cat and realize trying to photography these beasts can be a difficult task. Should have done a lot better score-wise.', '2004-11-24 06:49:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(1030848, 121676, 24951, '<td valign="top">Loved it. Should got a better score. Great to see some one think outside the box. I love seeing photography art.</td>', 'Loved it. Should got a better score. Great to see some one think outside the box. I love seeing photography art.', '2004-11-24 06:54:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(1030849, 121403, 22010, '<td valign="top">Wow. I got every single score. I suppose some people gave me a 1 simply because of the subject material. Since I meet the challenge and my shot is technically EXACTLY how I want it to be, this boggles my mind. But like I said, good for them.</td>', 'Wow. I got every single score. I suppose some people gave me a 1 simply because of the subject material. Since I meet the challenge and my shot is technically EXACTLY how I want it to be, this boggles my mind. But like I said, good for them.', '2004-11-24 06:54:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(1030855, 122029, 24951, '<td valign="top">I thought this would place higher. The effect hits you immediately as does the sense of motion. The 2 horizon thing - didn''t even notice, but I thought it was a change in landscape - it almost seems like water - which is in keeping with your concept of "as the bird flies" and with the sense of speed and motion.<br/>I think I also like this because I''m a poet and have written a poem exploring bird flight, from their prospective, and based on your image - I must admit I captured the idea quite nicely. It''s nice to see a visual creation of the concept of flight.</td>', 'I thought this would place higher. The effect hits you immediately as does the sense of motion. The 2 horizon thing - didn''t even notice, but I thought it was a change in landscape - it almost seems like water - which is in keeping with your concept of "as the bird flies" and with the sense of speed and motion.I think I also like this because I''m a poet and have written a poem exploring bird flight, from their prospective, and based on your image - I must admit I captured the idea quite nicely. It''s nice to see a visual creation of the concept of flight.', '2004-11-24 07:10:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(1030860, 121459, 2741, '<td valign="top">Great Shot. I loved this one.<br/> <br/>6 "2" votes, and 6 "1" votes ??<br/> <br/>Sometimes I don''t get this site either.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-11-24 07:20:23.</i></td>', 'Great Shot. I loved this one. 6 "2" votes, and 6 "1" votes ?? Sometimes I don''t get this site either.', '2004-11-24 07:20:07.000000', '2004-11-24 07:20:23.000000', 0),
(1030862, 121768, 93, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by basia03:</b></div><hr/><i> thanks a lot for all your great comments!<br/> <br/>to bigfish: to answer your question "how did you get the snow to fall like that?" - i didn''t... that''s the way the snow falls on a chain link fence... didn''t have the time to arrange every single snowflake this time, but i liked the way it looked anyway and took the picture... </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Bahahahahahahahaa... didn''t have the time to arrange every single snowflake.. hahahaha.. priceless.</td>', 'Originally posted by basia03: thanks a lot for all your great comments! to bigfish: to answer your question "how did you get the snow to fall like that?" - i didn''t... that''s the way the snow falls on a chain link fence... didn''t have the time to arrange every single snowflake this time, but i liked the way it looked anyway and took the picture...   Bahahahahahahahaa... didn''t have the time to arrange every single snowflake.. hahahaha.. priceless.', '2004-11-24 07:27:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(1030863, 121222, 24642, '<td valign="top">Congrats on a work well done. 1 out of 638 that''s impressive.</td>', 'Congrats on a work well done. 1 out of 638 that''s impressive.', '2004-11-24 07:29:42.000000', NULL, 0),
