(1030870, 122207, 4482, '<td valign="top">You got concept Pedro!!</td>', 'You got concept Pedro!!', '2004-11-24 07:38:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(1030872, 121067, 24642, '<td valign="top">Strong out of the box thinking.  IMO the composition might be improved by eliminating the distracting space below the TV and including more of the ashtray.<br/> <br/>Keep on pushing the limits.</td>', 'Strong out of the box thinking.  IMO the composition might be improved by eliminating the distracting space below the TV and including more of the ashtray. Keep on pushing the limits.', '2004-11-24 07:41:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(1030873, 121587, 12611, '<td valign="top">this really deserved a ribbon- no offense to the others- but this has a feeling of spirit and soul.</td>', 'this really deserved a ribbon- no offense to the others- but this has a feeling of spirit and soul.', '2004-11-24 07:41:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(1030880, 121222, 7291, '<td valign="top">Good job on earning your first ribbon.</td>', 'Good job on earning your first ribbon.', '2004-11-24 08:00:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(1030882, 122188, 25024, '<td valign="top">Well done. This was a very firm favourite of mine that most certainly deserves a ribbon. Personally, I think its the best of the three winners, but there we are. Keep up the good work!</td>', 'Well done. This was a very firm favourite of mine that most certainly deserves a ribbon. Personally, I think its the best of the three winners, but there we are. Keep up the good work!', '2004-11-24 08:01:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(1030889, 120822, 25486, '<td valign="top">Well done Thomas, I idn''t get time to vote i the challenge but I like to look through the entries afterwards and, as you did with my entry, I recognised that shoreline as your handywork.<br/> <br/>Great lead in lines from the waves, Haystack Rock is a bit central, might have been better compositionaly a bit to the right?<br/> <br/>Nice cloud detail and misty shoreline, congratulations.</td>', 'Well done Thomas, I idn''t get time to vote i the challenge but I like to look through the entries afterwards and, as you did with my entry, I recognised that shoreline as your handywork. Great lead in lines from the waves, Haystack Rock is a bit central, might have been better compositionaly a bit to the right? Nice cloud detail and misty shoreline, congratulations.', '2004-11-24 08:08:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(1030900, 121587, 25486, '<td valign="top">blindjustice is right about it deserving a ribbon, unfortunately there''s only three to give out.<br/> <br/>It really does have feeling, I think its an outstanding shot, one I would be very proud of.<br/> <br/>The composition is excellent the range of tones very good, only the one house on the left is a bit burn out.  The sky adds to the feeling.  Very well done, an excellent result.</td>', 'blindjustice is right about it deserving a ribbon, unfortunately there''s only three to give out. It really does have feeling, I think its an outstanding shot, one I would be very proud of. The composition is excellent the range of tones very good, only the one house on the left is a bit burn out.  The sky adds to the feeling.  Very well done, an excellent result.', '2004-11-24 08:15:46.000000', NULL, 0),
