(1030942, 121134, 28638, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Gil P:</b></div><hr/><i> simplier???   great shot anyway!! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks for the comments.  Feel pretty stupid about the typo in the title.  Unfortunately, when I realized what I had done it was too late to fix it.  The entry deadline had passed.  Very pleased with how this photo did in the challenge.  Only downside is the typo will forever live in my profile.  Wish there was a way to fix it.</td>', 'Originally posted by Gil P: simplier???   great shot anyway!!   Thanks for the comments.  Feel pretty stupid about the typo in the title.  Unfortunately, when I realized what I had done it was too late to fix it.  The entry deadline had passed.  Very pleased with how this photo did in the challenge.  Only downside is the typo will forever live in my profile.  Wish there was a way to fix it.', '2004-11-24 08:41:35.000000', NULL, 0),
