(1031126, 121502, 23394, '<td valign="top">i personally an not drawn to an image of something oozing out of someone else''s mouth.  in my youth, i might have found it erotic, but after having children, it''s just one more mess to clean up.<br/> <br/>while i can appreciate the effort you made and what the image means to you, it just didn''t have the same effect on me.  all the same, dpc represents a very wide and diverse audience, and you should not let my reaction or opinion necessarily guide or affect your future efforts.<br/> <br/>good luck, and keep submitting!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-11-24 10:50:20.</i></td>', 'i personally an not drawn to an image of something oozing out of someone else''s mouth.  in my youth, i might have found it erotic, but after having children, it''s just one more mess to clean up. while i can appreciate the effort you made and what the image means to you, it just didn''t have the same effect on me.  all the same, dpc represents a very wide and diverse audience, and you should not let my reaction or opinion necessarily guide or affect your future efforts. good luck, and keep submitting!', '2004-11-24 10:49:58.000000', '2004-11-24 10:50:20.000000', 0),
