(1031132, 121107, 14603, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent picture Tony and deserved a higher placing IMO.<br/>I`ve been trying to work out how you managed to get 38 votes under 5 and can`t quite do it.<br/>Maybe the faded out look of the background worked against you..although I think it helps to isolate the subject and should have been one of the plusses.<br/>Good work.<br/></td>', 'This is an excellent picture Tony and deserved a higher placing IMO.I`ve been trying to work out how you managed to get 38 votes under 5 and can`t quite do it.Maybe the faded out look of the background worked against you..although I think it helps to isolate the subject and should have been one of the plusses.Good work.', '2004-11-24 10:55:55.000000', NULL, 0),
