(1031178, 120407, 27913, '<td valign="top">thanks for looking! this was an impromptu submission that i didn''t really expect to do well. i was shooting some b&amp;w water textures and when i was reviewing my images this one just caught my eye. it looked to me like a monkey with a helmet on, and the stick was almost like a club being held over his head...i decided just to submit with no post-processing.<br/>the next day my computer crashed and i lost everything! luckily i had been backing up files to cd...<br/>peace</td>', 'thanks for looking! this was an impromptu submission that i didn''t really expect to do well. i was shooting some b&w water textures and when i was reviewing my images this one just caught my eye. it looked to me like a monkey with a helmet on, and the stick was almost like a club being held over his head...i decided just to submit with no post-processing.the next day my computer crashed and i lost everything! luckily i had been backing up files to cd...peace', '2004-11-24 11:25:35.000000', NULL, 0),
