(1031772, 121671, 19708, '<td valign="top">OK, time to fess up &amp; be honest.<br/> <br/>I have looked at this shot over &amp; over, and thought it was a scalvert original and placed well, it just didn''t do "something" for me.<br/>Don''t get me wrong, as it''s all done right, just maybe isn''t my kind of shot? I certainly won''t be a hypocrite and add to the ooohs and ahhs just to go with eveyone else. You are a very creative and gifted photographer, but as we all know, nobody can please everybody all the time.<br/> <br/>Respectfully, and hopefully still friends?<br/>:)</td>', 'OK, time to fess up & be honest. I have looked at this shot over & over, and thought it was a scalvert original and placed well, it just didn''t do "something" for me.Don''t get me wrong, as it''s all done right, just maybe isn''t my kind of shot? I certainly won''t be a hypocrite and add to the ooohs and ahhs just to go with eveyone else. You are a very creative and gifted photographer, but as we all know, nobody can please everybody all the time. Respectfully, and hopefully still friends?:)', '2004-11-24 16:49:48.000000', NULL, 0),
