(1032063, 121345, 649, '<td valign="top">Thanks to everyone who voted for my picture.  This was a Chihuly at the Atlanta Botanical Gardens.  I was lucky to be able to go to the show because they extended past this summer.<br/> <br/>No special lighting was used.  Just the sun about 2 hours for sunset.<br/> <br/>Thanks Nico, I look to enter more.  8-)<br/> <br/>Thanks again.<br/> <br/>Lee</td>', 'Thanks to everyone who voted for my picture.  This was a Chihuly at the Atlanta Botanical Gardens.  I was lucky to be able to go to the show because they extended past this summer. No special lighting was used.  Just the sun about 2 hours for sunset. Thanks Nico, I look to enter more.  8-) Thanks again. Lee', '2004-11-24 21:50:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(1032066, 121769, 25500, '<td valign="top">Thanks to everyone who offered feedback and enjoyed the photo.  If you didn''t like the shot, you are in good company - Katie''s grandmother thought that it was simply dreadful (ironic, since she is a staunch advocate of put the baby in a crib and let them cry themselves to sleep).  If you''d like to see her in a happier mood (usually), you can check her out at <a href="//www.chai-mulkerin.com/KatieIndex.htm." rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//www.chai-mulkerin.com/KatieIndex.htm.</a>  And yes, she was calm as a foggy morning about two minutes later - the miracle of the bottle.</td>', 'Thanks to everyone who offered feedback and enjoyed the photo.  If you didn''t like the shot, you are in good company - Katie''s grandmother thought that it was simply dreadful (ironic, since she is a staunch advocate of put the baby in a crib and let them cry themselves to sleep).  If you''d like to see her in a happier mood (usually), you can check her out at //www.chai-mulkerin.com/KatieIndex.htm.  And yes, she was calm as a foggy morning about two minutes later - the miracle of the bottle.', '2004-11-24 21:54:05.000000', NULL, 0),
