(1032147, 121771, 11800, '<td valign="top">I would have never guessed this was a building. The visual clues made me think it was balsa wood boxes over a bamboo mat. And I looked at it a long time before I decided that was what I thought it was. Very impressive. It was one of my higher rated photos. an 8 and I guess that tiny toy would have been lost in the setting.</td>', 'I would have never guessed this was a building. The visual clues made me think it was balsa wood boxes over a bamboo mat. And I looked at it a long time before I decided that was what I thought it was. Very impressive. It was one of my higher rated photos. an 8 and I guess that tiny toy would have been lost in the setting.', '2004-11-24 23:36:16.000000', NULL, 0),
