(1032416, 121976, 1570, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by ahaze:</b></div><hr/><i> It might be a good idea to try to photograph something more original for the next DPC challenge. Keep trying! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>i think that this little dawggy''s sweet face expression - even while sleeping! - makes this picture plenty original... but then again, i have three dawgs and think that it is just poetic, whatever a dawg does, so, what do i know... irina.</td>', 'Originally posted by ahaze: It might be a good idea to try to photograph something more original for the next DPC challenge. Keep trying!   i think that this little dawggy''s sweet face expression - even while sleeping! - makes this picture plenty original... but then again, i have three dawgs and think that it is just poetic, whatever a dawg does, so, what do i know... irina.', '2004-11-25 08:43:21.000000', NULL, 0),
