(1032885, 121183, 27399, '<td valign="top">I saw the thumbnail version of the pic and thought to myself, "I think that''s Mt. Rainier!"  I was pleased to see it was.  I am from the Seattle area and have flown by that mountain many times, and I, too, have tried to capture it.  You did a great job and it is a joy to see a home-town treat.  Your window must have been pretty clean, too! ;)  We have a saying up there when the weather is clear: "The Mountain''s Out"</td>', 'I saw the thumbnail version of the pic and thought to myself, "I think that''s Mt. Rainier!"  I was pleased to see it was.  I am from the Seattle area and have flown by that mountain many times, and I, too, have tried to capture it.  You did a great job and it is a joy to see a home-town treat.  Your window must have been pretty clean, too! ;)  We have a saying up there when the weather is clear: "The Mountain''s Out"', '2004-11-25 18:43:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(1032889, 121347, 17505, '<td valign="top">I didn''t vote in this challenge, but I would have voted this one high. Nice detail and great choice of black and white. I love that the hand is dirty, a working mans hand. Nice shot.</td>', 'I didn''t vote in this challenge, but I would have voted this one high. Nice detail and great choice of black and white. I love that the hand is dirty, a working mans hand. Nice shot.', '2004-11-25 18:47:46.000000', NULL, 0),
