(1032984, 122100, 1031, '<td valign="top">I find it''s the one tree in front of the ess-curve in the path which is the most distracting; the path is the title subject, and you are partly obscuring it''s most "interesting" feature. Perhaps moving a couple of feet to the left would frame the curve of the path between the more substantial trees.<br/> <br/>This would be a good shot to try in duotone mode, using a light blue or cool gray as the second color to accentualte the feeling of coldness; duotones often have more of a feeling of depth to them than do monochromes.</td>', 'I find it''s the one tree in front of the ess-curve in the path which is the most distracting; the path is the title subject, and you are partly obscuring it''s most "interesting" feature. Perhaps moving a couple of feet to the left would frame the curve of the path between the more substantial trees. This would be a good shot to try in duotone mode, using a light blue or cool gray as the second color to accentualte the feeling of coldness; duotones often have more of a feeling of depth to them than do monochromes.', '2004-11-25 22:05:00.000000', NULL, 0),
