(1040564, 121757, 8860, '<td valign="top">Ooh - he/she looks so comfortable - in only the way that cats can! Great light and texture too. The little dark triangle in the frgound is the only flaw really. And I think you''ve been voted down too low with this.</td>', 'Ooh - he/she looks so comfortable - in only the way that cats can! Great light and texture too. The little dark triangle in the frgound is the only flaw really. And I think you''ve been voted down too low with this.', '2004-12-01 09:04:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(1041207, 121459, 27735, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by md8speed:</b></div><hr/><i> Very nice.  Where is this photo taken from? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>This photo was taken from Baker Beach. Thank you for everyone that voted. Hopefully I''ll be able to place this high again :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-12-01 14:06:56.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by md8speed: Very nice.  Where is this photo taken from?   This photo was taken from Baker Beach. Thank you for everyone that voted. Hopefully I''ll be able to place this high again :)', '2004-12-01 14:05:09.000000', '2004-12-01 14:06:56.000000', 0),
(1041579, 121757, 28299, '<td valign="top">You''re right. Someone did mention I should crop a little tighter, and I just didn''t see it then, but I do now (damn little triangle, I didn''t even catch that!) Thanks ... oh yeah, and this was actually my first challenge, so I wasn''t disappointed with the results. I''m learning y''know? <br/>(and I know cats are not original, but I''m wondering if one of my commenters is a cat-hater because I''ve noticed that person has commented the same thing on every cat photo - LOL!)</td>', 'You''re right. Someone did mention I should crop a little tighter, and I just didn''t see it then, but I do now (damn little triangle, I didn''t even catch that!) Thanks ... oh yeah, and this was actually my first challenge, so I wasn''t disappointed with the results. I''m learning y''know? (and I know cats are not original, but I''m wondering if one of my commenters is a cat-hater because I''ve noticed that person has commented the same thing on every cat photo - LOL!)', '2004-12-01 16:10:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(1043114, 122104, 29721, '<td valign="top">really amazing one.<br/></td>', 'really amazing one.', '2004-12-02 10:49:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(1043133, 121601, 27562, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by ajschmidt:</b></div><hr/><i> dose not look like an ir shot </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I didn''t realize that infrared had to have a certain look.  I''ve been shooting infrared for almost twenty years, and I know what you were trying to say.  I took over 200 photos that day and 99% of them had the "IR Look" with the glowing white vegetation, etc, etc, but I picked this photo BECAUSE It didn''t look like that.  My scores show that many didn''t like it, but I do ;-).</td>', 'Originally posted by ajschmidt: dose not look like an ir shot   I didn''t realize that infrared had to have a certain look.  I''ve been shooting infrared for almost twenty years, and I know what you were trying to say.  I took over 200 photos that day and 99% of them had the "IR Look" with the glowing white vegetation, etc, etc, but I picked this photo BECAUSE It didn''t look like that.  My scores show that many didn''t like it, but I do ;-).', '2004-12-02 10:59:18.000000', NULL, 0),
