(1050663, 122207, 23458, '<td valign="top">This is a great work. The contrast between the windswept landscape and the man in corporate attire is particularly effective. Add the child like baloon and the image loses all seriousness but takes on an air of comic social commentary. <br/> <br/>Great! Should have done better.</td>', 'This is a great work. The contrast between the windswept landscape and the man in corporate attire is particularly effective. Add the child like baloon and the image loses all seriousness but takes on an air of comic social commentary.  Great! Should have done better.', '2004-12-07 18:51:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(1056471, 121442, 12896, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  too bad you couldnt have shot it with the 828 ;)</td>', 'Great shot!  too bad you couldnt have shot it with the 828 ;)', '2004-12-10 18:13:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(1057681, 120679, 6900, '<td valign="top">I can see the lines as well and they do distract.<br/> <br/>However, the angles and lines give my eyes lots to do and it makes me interested in the subject.  I like the little tad of background image we have - the other boats, water, shoreline - which add to the overall feel of the picture.<br/> <br/>I like contrasty black and white shots, so I would bump it +7 or so contrast, just to get that feel to it, but overall I like the image a lot.<br/> <br/>M</td>', 'I can see the lines as well and they do distract. However, the angles and lines give my eyes lots to do and it makes me interested in the subject.  I like the little tad of background image we have - the other boats, water, shoreline - which add to the overall feel of the picture. I like contrasty black and white shots, so I would bump it +7 or so contrast, just to get that feel to it, but overall I like the image a lot. M', '2004-12-11 20:27:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(1057858, 122064, 29132, '<td valign="top">Natural or not, I really like the pose. It works well with the lighting and compliments your model''s form. This is a beautiful photo.</td>', 'Natural or not, I really like the pose. It works well with the lighting and compliments your model''s form. This is a beautiful photo.', '2004-12-12 00:41:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(1057859, 121721, 29132, '<td valign="top">This photo deserved a much higher score. It must have been penalized for the nudity. I would respectfully disagree with my fellow DPC members who found the nakedness gratuitous. On the contrary -- it''s a nice juxtaposition to the innocence of Pooh. And the shadow effect is great.</td>', 'This photo deserved a much higher score. It must have been penalized for the nudity. I would respectfully disagree with my fellow DPC members who found the nakedness gratuitous. On the contrary -- it''s a nice juxtaposition to the innocence of Pooh. And the shadow effect is great.', '2004-12-12 00:45:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(1058078, 121481, 29132, '<td valign="top">Wow, tough crowd! The darkness doesn''t bother me, but eliminating the bra lines (this photo''s only distraction) would improve it. Still, I believe this one deserved a much higher score.</td>', 'Wow, tough crowd! The darkness doesn''t bother me, but eliminating the bra lines (this photo''s only distraction) would improve it. Still, I believe this one deserved a much higher score.', '2004-12-12 08:30:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(1058291, 121640, 10867, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition, cropping and lighting in this shot, Robert.  I especially like the beautiful diagonal formed by the "highlighted" edge of the guitar neck and the lighting on the model''s hair.</td>', 'Beautiful composition, cropping and lighting in this shot, Robert.  I especially like the beautiful diagonal formed by the "highlighted" edge of the guitar neck and the lighting on the model''s hair.', '2004-12-12 12:52:49.000000', NULL, 0),
