(1133613, 122013, 23913, '<td valign="top">i must''ve missed this durring my voting on the monster of a challenge B&amp;W, and i''m very sorry for that.<br/> <br/>i was going throungh my monthly random user picking hoping to find some really nice shot and i came up with this 1 it went stright to my favs.<br/> <br/>the great part of this shot is the lighting in combo. with the grain it takes me back to the beloved film days when 1 would pick some illford 400asa off the shelf and go looking for subjects that were inhanced by grain(or a grainy affect).<br/> <br/>a touch of film never hurts and this is an marvilous example.<br/> <br/>sorry i missed it in the very argous task of voting on b&amp;w and sorry i was not able to get it higher than 170.:(<br/> <br/>great shot:)</td>', 'i must''ve missed this durring my voting on the monster of a challenge B&W, and i''m very sorry for that. i was going throungh my monthly random user picking hoping to find some really nice shot and i came up with this 1 it went stright to my favs. the great part of this shot is the lighting in combo. with the grain it takes me back to the beloved film days when 1 would pick some illford 400asa off the shelf and go looking for subjects that were inhanced by grain(or a grainy affect). a touch of film never hurts and this is an marvilous example. sorry i missed it in the very argous task of voting on b&w and sorry i was not able to get it higher than 170.:( great shot:)', '2005-01-26 15:33:07.000000', NULL, 0),
