(1263634, 122194, 33560, '<td valign="top">It''s a beautiful image and a clever shot.  The hat, glasses, and jacket all work well.  So does the lighting.  I wonder whether the dark brooding sensibility characteristic of effective blues might not be more accurately expressed if the wall were just a little less starkly bright  or the shadow a little less contrasty.  The blues trumpeter is being upstaged by his shadow - an apt concept (see also Steely Dan''s Deacon Blues "This is the day of the expanding man..." )  but not sure it gives the best visual result.    Just thinking out loud. Hope this helps.</td>', 'It''s a beautiful image and a clever shot.  The hat, glasses, and jacket all work well.  So does the lighting.  I wonder whether the dark brooding sensibility characteristic of effective blues might not be more accurately expressed if the wall were just a little less starkly bright  or the shadow a little less contrasty.  The blues trumpeter is being upstaged by his shadow - an apt concept (see also Steely Dan''s Deacon Blues "This is the day of the expanding man..." )  but not sure it gives the best visual result.    Just thinking out loud. Hope this helps.', '2005-04-01 13:35:49.000000', NULL, 0),
