(1594345, 121285, 19010, '<td valign="top">I will give this photo credit for bieng interesting. I don''t feel however feel it followed a lot of the "rules" It has strong lines but the tend to lead the veiwer off the page or towards nothing. It is very crisp and clear but it has no solid foundation or focal point. The image does however loosley follow the rule of thirds wich gives it balance. It is at a diagonal wich gives it a feeling of speed and motion. This was a very well photographed shot. But I feel that without having a main subject that it would not do very well with the masses. Good job.</td>', 'I will give this photo credit for bieng interesting. I don''t feel however feel it followed a lot of the "rules" It has strong lines but the tend to lead the veiwer off the page or towards nothing. It is very crisp and clear but it has no solid foundation or focal point. The image does however loosley follow the rule of thirds wich gives it balance. It is at a diagonal wich gives it a feeling of speed and motion. This was a very well photographed shot. But I feel that without having a main subject that it would not do very well with the masses. Good job.', '2005-08-08 08:59:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(1602339, 121751, 39531, '<td valign="top">Thank you for your comments on my pics. You do exceptional work yourself and your work shows a sophistication beyond your years. If you choose to follow a photographic or other artistic path I am sure you will be most successful. Best Regards</td>', 'Thank you for your comments on my pics. You do exceptional work yourself and your work shows a sophistication beyond your years. If you choose to follow a photographic or other artistic path I am sure you will be most successful. Best Regards', '2005-08-10 21:00:08.000000', NULL, 0),
