(3623609, 121866, 52439, '<td valign="top">I think this is a great shot.<br/>What i''d have done differently however is to try and dodge some highlights to a) brighten the image slightly and b) by selective dodging, i''d have tried to lead the viewer down the path more. As it is it''s a little dark.<br/>I think the trees about 1/3 of the way down (the brighter ones) are perfect, but then after those they go pitch black which stops the eye from going any further i think.<br/> <br/>I might be talking complete rubbish, but seems to make sense in my head, haha.</td>', 'I think this is a great shot.What i''d have done differently however is to try and dodge some highlights to a) brighten the image slightly and b) by selective dodging, i''d have tried to lead the viewer down the path more. As it is it''s a little dark.I think the trees about 1/3 of the way down (the brighter ones) are perfect, but then after those they go pitch black which stops the eye from going any further i think. I might be talking complete rubbish, but seems to make sense in my head, haha.', '2007-05-07 09:42:20.000000', NULL, 0),
